<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1KI" style="id">- Toma Bible</book>
  <para style="h">1 Masagiti</para>
  <para style="toc1">Masagiti Ta-Zɛʋɛ Mɔungi</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Masagiti</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Ma</para>
  <para style="mt1">Masagiti Ta-Zɛʋɛ Mɔungi</para>
  <para style="imt">Sɛʋɛi lɔɔzeizuʋɛ ma woo mɔungiti</para>
  <para style="ip">Tɔɔzeizu mɔunpa, Masagiti Ta-Zɛʋɛ Mɔungi ta Felesiɛi ti ɓɔni su, ti ɠɛ ga sɛʋɛ zuɠooza gila kpe nɔ. Sɛpetante zɛʋɛi zu ɠa gaaɠwɛɛni su ná mɔunpa. Sɛpetante zɛʋɛi naa ɠa é ga Minazeɠe Pɔlɔmai, nii tatigai Gɛlɛke wooi zu. Nu la kwɛɛ zɔi é Masagiti Ta-Zɛʋɛ Mɔungi ta Felesiɛi zɛʋɛai, ɓaa é ti ɠaalɛai ba. Masagiti Ta-Zɛʋɛi ɠɛɛ nui wɛlɛʋɛ ada mɔinmɔin, é ʋa sɛʋɛi niiti gaalɛba (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 11:41">1Ma 11:41</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 14:19">14:19</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 14:29">29</ref></char>). Nu la ɓalaa kɛɛ yeeɠɛɠalai ɓaa gaalɛba yeeɠɛɠala ɓɔɠɔɓɔɠɔgi ɠwɛɛ. Koleʋɛ ga sɛʋɛi niiti kɛɛ vai ɠaaɓelagɛ masagi Yeɠoyakin ɠula ʋoluma kasoi ɠa, kona undɔɔlugɔ puulɔzita maazu ɠilagi ma (561), aisa Yesu Kilista ʋa zɔlɔɔ. Tɔɔzei niima vaiti sɛʋɛʋɛ Masagiti Ta-Zɛʋɛi Velesiɛi zu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 25:27">2Ma 25:27</ref></char>). Faaɠwɛ nu mɔinmɔin daaʋɛ da ga sɛʋɛi niiti ná bɔɔlɔzu ɠɛɛʋɛ kona mɔinmɔin su ná luɠɔ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Masagiti Ta-Zɛʋɛ Mɔungi ta Felesiɛi ta Izilayɛle ta Zuda masagiti ti ɠilagilagiti pɛ ta-wɔlɔwɔlɔ vai zuɠulazu, é tɔɔzei masagi Salomɔn ná-yeeɠɛɠalai, názu masa zou felegɔiti kpɔga ɠɛni de dɛ su. Ta naa ɓalaa suɠulazu, ʋele masadai ɠaaɠwɛɛni la su fele, ti ɛsɛ gilagilagi ná-wɔlɔwɔlɔ vai zuɠula, eyɛsu yeeɠɛɠalai naa ma, siɛgi zu ti ti felegɔ pɛ soga la, ti li ga tiye duɔlai zu. Sɛʋɛi ɠɛɛ nui ɠa dɛɛzu ɓalaa, ʋelei masagi ɠilagilagiti ti yɔɠɔzuʋɛ ɠɛni la ta GALA, ni ma nu ɠɛni ziɛzu ga GALA ziimai, ɓaa ni é la ɠɛni ziɛzu ga GALA ziimai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Masagi tanigaa «ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yiima vai ɠɛɛni» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 18:3">2Ma 18:3</ref></char>). Tanigaa ma «ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wanama vai ɠɛɛni» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 21:2">2Ma 21:2</ref></char>). Masagi niiti kpein ti ziɛni ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yiima ʋelei, sɛʋɛi ɠɛɛ nui ɠa naati ta-wɔlɔwɔlɔ vaiti suɠulazu ga pagɔ, é dɛɛ ga zooi ɠilagilagi ná-dituɠɔmai ma ungi ɠɛni ɠulazu ta-masagiti ta-wooɠɛɠiladai zu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. Masagiti Ta-Zɛʋɛi Velesiɛi 17:7 zu toɠa ɠalasu miná ga Izilayɛle liini duɔlai zu, tɔɔzei Izilayɛle nuiti «ti kotoi ɠɛɛni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laalɔɠɔma,» ta «ti ɠɛni gala kiligiti dɛbizu.»</para>
  <para style="iot">Unsosuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Davide ná-doun zunui Salomɔn ɠɛɛ vai ga masagi, ta ʋelei é masa fai ɠɛɛni la Izilayɛle pɛ unda (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 1:1-11:43">1:1—11:43</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Masadai ɠaaɠwɛ vai su Izilayɛle ta Zuda, ta ta-masagi tanigaa ta-vaiti (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 12:1-16:34">12:1—16:34</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. GALA goo wo nui Eli ná-botii é kɛɛni, ta ma un ge daa ma mɛɛ ga ti yɔɠɔzuʋɛ ta Izilayɛle masagi Akaɓe (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 17:1-19:21">17:1—19:21</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Izilayɛle ta Zuda masagi taɠiligaa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 20:1-22:54">20:1—22:54</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1KI 1"/>
  <para style="ms1">Davide Ná-Masadai Ɓelagi <optbreak/> Ta Salomɔn Nɔnɔi Lɔɔzeigi</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="1KI 1:1-11:43">1:1—11:43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">Masa kpɔkpɔgi wɔin ɠɛɛ vai Adoniya ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 1:1"/>Masagi Davide wɔlɔzaɠaga ɠɛni de niina, anɛɛ ɓalaa ta la seɠeiti felevele ma, naa la ɠɛni kɔɔlɛsu. <verse eid="1KI 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 1:2"/>Ná-botiɠɛ nuiti ti ɠɛni ma: «Ɓɛ gi anzalopo ɓea ɠila gaiziɛ màliɠii masagi ʋɛ, é ɗa boti ɠɛ è ʋɛ, é ɗa è makɛ, ta é ɗa la è ɠoba, naa ɠa ɠɛɛna kɔɔlɛi ɠa zeɠe màliɠii masagi ma.» <verse eid="1KI 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 1:3"/>Ti wɛlɛni Izilayɛle yooi zu ná pɛ ga anzalopo ʋagɔ. Ti Aɓisage ɠaani, Sunɛme nui, ti ʋaa la masagi ɠoba. <verse eid="1KI 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 1:4"/>Anzalopoi naa wola ʋani, é ɠaaɓaani masagi ma, é ɗa boti ɠɛ bɛ. Kɛlɛ masagi la ɠɛni daani ʋolu pɛ ga anza.<verse eid="1KI 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 1:5"/>Naama ziɛgi zu, Davide ta Ɠagite ti-loun zunui Adoniya ɓɔɠɔ lɛɛzu su, é ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Nà ɠa gè ɠɛɛzu ga masagi.» É wotolo vaaɠɛɛni ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ, ta soo ɓizɛ zalaʋusuiti, naa ʋɛɛ zunu ʋuulɔɔlugɔ (50) ʋa, ti ɗa ɓizɛ tɔun tuɠɔ. <verse eid="1KI 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 1:6"/>Kaipa, sii ma voloi pɛ su, kɛɛɠɛ la ɠɛni zeliloni ma, é ʋa ɠɛ ma: «Toɠa ɠale, è naa ɠɛɛzu?» É ɠula naa ʋolu, Adoniya ɠɛni ga lakpa doun ʋapa, Aɓasalɔme deɠe ɠɛni de. <verse eid="1KI 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 1:7"/>Ti yɛpɛni ta Zoaɓe, Seluya ná-doun zunui, naa ʋɛɛ zalaɠa ɠula nui Aɓiataal ʋa, naati ti ʋilɛ Adoniya ʋolu. <verse eid="1KI 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 1:8"/>Kɛlɛ zalaɠa ɠula nui Sadɔke ʋe, Yeɠoyada ná-doun zunui Ɓenaya ʋe, GALA goo wo nui Natan ʋe, Simeyi ʋe, ta Leyi, naa ʋɛɛ Davide ná-kɔɔɠuluɓaiti ba, ti tanɔpɛ ge la ɠɛni Adoniya ʋolu.<verse eid="1KI 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 1:9"/>Yeeta Adoniya zalaɠai ɠulani Zɔyelɛte ɠɔtui ɠobaʋɛ, nii é En-Lɔgɛle ɠobaʋɛ, ga baalagiti, ta nikɛiti, ta nikɛ yiʋoiti ti wulɔai. É kɛɛɠɛlointi pɛ tolini, masagi ná-dointi, ta Zuda nu ɓiigi niiti kpein ti ɠɛni boti ɠɛɛzu masagi ʋɛ. <verse eid="1KI 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 1:10"/>Kɛlɛ é la ɠɛni GALA goo wo nui Natan lolini, ta Ɓenaya, ta masagi ná-salaʋusu wolaiti, naa ʋɛɛ deɠei Salomɔn ʋa.<verse eid="1KI 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Natan ta Ɓate-Seɓa <optbreak/> ti Salomɔn nɔnɔ ma ʋepei ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 1:11"/>Natan liini Salomɔn dee Ɓate-Seɓa ʋɔ bɛ, é ɠɛ ma: «È suɠwɛɛ ɓaa ga Ɠagite ná-doun zunui Adoniya ɠana ɓɔɠɔ ɠɛ ga masagi ade-maliɠii Davide ɠi poluma? <verse eid="1KI 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 1:12"/>Woilo, gè tɛnɛ fe è ya, nii a wo-yɛnvuiti kizo, wa è-loin Salomɔn. <verse eid="1KI 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 1:13"/>Liina fala masagi ʋɔ bɛ, è gaazaɠa, è ɠɛ ma: ‹Ee, màliɠii masagi, ɗa lɛi è minazeɠeni bɛ̀, è ɠona, ga dòun zunui Salomɔn ɠa é masadai zeɠezu è ʋoluʋelei, é zei ɗa-masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa? Toɠa ɠale mu Adoniya masadai ɠɛɛzu?› <verse eid="1KI 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 1:14"/>Ɗa yɛsu nɔ ɓɔɛzu masagi ʋɔ, gè lɛ nà ɓɔɠɔi, gè è-wooi mɔta maaɓakpa.»<verse eid="1KI 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 1:15"/>Ɓate-Seɓa liini masagi laa ʋɛlɛi wu. Naa wɔlɔzaɠaga ɠɛni de niina gola, Sunɛme nui Aɓisage ɗa ɠaaɓa ma. <verse eid="1KI 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 1:16"/>Ɓate-Seɓa ʋilɛni ɲiibiɠa, é la masagi ɠɔɠɔwu. Naa zɛba é gaazaɠa, é ɠɛ ma: «Leeni ɠa è pɔ gè kɛ è ʋɛ?»<verse eid="1KI 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 1:17"/>É gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Màliɠii, è minazeɠeʋɛ bɛ̀, nɛ̀i gè ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ anzanui, è ɠona ɗa-ƓALAGI Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laaseigi zu ga dòun zunui Salomɔn ɠa é masadai ɠɛɛzu è ʋoluʋelei, é zei ɗa-masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa. <verse eid="1KI 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 1:18"/>Kɛlɛ wɛlɛ niina, Adoniya ɓɔɠɔ ɠɛa ga masagi, màliɠii masagi è-ɠi ge la su. <verse eid="1KI 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 1:19"/>É togani mɔinmɔin kulani ga zalaɠai: nikɛ zinɛ wolaiti, nikɛ yiʋoiti ti wulɔai, ta baalagiti, é masagi ná-doun zunuiti pɛ toli, ta zalaɠa ɠula nui Aɓiataal, naa ʋɛɛ kɔɔʋɛbɛi ma lotuɠɔi Zoaɓe ʋa, kɛlɛ é la è-loun zunui Salomɔn lolini. <verse eid="1KI 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 1:20"/>Tama Izilayɛle pɛ gaazu ɠa ɗa nɔ ʋa, màliɠii masagi, ga è naama nui lɛ, nii é zeizu è-ʋoga màliɠii ɗa-masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa. <verse eid="1KI 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 1:21"/>Ni naa laade, siɛgi zu màliɠii masagi è liizu la è-mɛmɛwolani pɔ, ta ʋaazu gi zosu eɠɛ faa ɲɔu ɠɛ ʋea, gá dòun zunui Salomɔn.»<verse eid="1KI 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 1:22"/>É yɛni nɔ ɓɔɛzu masagi ʋɔ, GALA goo wo nui Natan ʋaa. <verse eid="1KI 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 1:23"/>Ti ʋa ti ɠɛ masagi ma: «Wɛlɛ GALA goo wo nui Natan ʋa.» Naa lɛɛni masagi ʋɔ bɛ, é la kɔɠɔwu, nɔungi ʋilɛgai zooi ma, <verse eid="1KI 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 1:24"/>é ɠɛ ma: «Ee, màliɠii masagi, ɗa ɠa è bogai ɓaa ga Adoniya ɠa masadai ɠɛ è ʋoluʋelei, ta é zei ɗa-masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa? <verse eid="1KI 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 1:25"/>Mazɔlɔɔ diiʋɛ za, é nikɛiti ta nikɛ yiʋoiti ti wulɔai, ta baala mɔinmɔin ga ɠula ga zalaɠai, é masagi ná-doun zunuiti pɛ toligɛ, ta kɔɔʋɛbɛi ma lotuɠɔiti, naa ʋɛɛ zalaɠa ɠula nui Aɓiataal ʋa. Tiya ɠanu, ti daamii ta kpɔɔlei wosu ta tiye, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: ‹Masagi Adoniya lɛbi ɠeke faan!› <verse eid="1KI 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 1:26"/>Kɛlɛ é la nɔ̀un tolini, nɛ̀i gè ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui, é la zalaɠa ɠula nui Sadɔke lolini, ta Yeɠoyada ná-doun zunui Ɓenaya, ta ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui Salomɔn. <verse eid="1KI 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 1:27"/>Nii ɠɛɠala vai ɠa zoo ɠɛɛzu ɓaa màliɠii masagi ná-devei wu, ga è la zooga è ʋa naa lɛ ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nuiti, zɔi é màliɠii masagi maavalibosu masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa?»<verse eid="1KI 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Davide yeelo fai ʋotogi ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 1:28"/>Masagi Davide gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «À Ɓate-Seɓa loli dɛɛ bɛ̀.» Naa lɛɛni masagi ʋɔ bɛ, é lo kakala. <verse eid="1KI 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 1:29"/>Masagi ɓɔɛni pɔ konai zu, é ɠɛ ma: «Gè ɠonaa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma, nii é vulua, nii é kùlaai ziiɓɔlɔiti pɛ su, <verse eid="1KI 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 1:30"/>gè bo è ma ga za nɔ, nà minazeɠegi naa laazeelizu, nii gè kɛɛni è ʋɛ, gè ɠona Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI laaseigi zu, siɛgi zu gè ɠɛa è ma la è-loun zunui Salomɔn ɠa é masadai ɠɛɛzu pòluʋele, é zei nà-masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa pòtogi zu.» <verse eid="1KI 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 1:31"/>Ɓate-Seɓa ʋilɛni ɲiibiɠa, é la masagi ɠɔɠɔwu, é ɠɛ ma: «Màliɠii masagi Davide lɛbi ɠeke faan!»<verse eid="1KI 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 1:32"/>Masagi ɠɛni ma: «À zalaɠa ɠula nui Sadɔke loli, ta GALA goo wo nui Natan, naa ʋɛɛ Yeɠoyada ná-doun zunui Ɓenaya.» Ti lɛɛni masagi ʋɔ bɛ. <verse eid="1KI 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 1:33"/>Masagi ɠɛni ti ma: «À nà-botiɠɛ nuiti pɛ toli, ti ʋilɛ wo ʋolu, wo dòun zunui Salomɔn lɛ nà-soovale fuului ɠɔma, wo yei la Giyon. <verse eid="1KI 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 1:34"/>Miná ɠa zalaɠa ɠula nui Sadɔke ta GALA goo wo nui Natan ti gulɔi ziɛzu ma ná, é ɠɛ ga Izilayɛle masagi. Wa puʋugi vɛɛzu, wo ɗa ɠɛ ma: ‹Masagi Salomɔn lɛbi ɠeke faan!› <verse eid="1KI 1:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 1:35"/>Wa yɛsu polu, wo lɛ, é ʋa é zei nà-masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa. Tɔ ɠa é masadai ɠɛɛzu pòtogi zu. Gè yeeloga ba ga Izilayɛle ta Zuda ta-lotuɠɔi.»<verse eid="1KI 1:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 1:36"/>Yeɠoyada ná-doun zunui Ɓenaya masagi wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «É ɠɛ ɠana! Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI é ga màliɠii masagi ɗa-ƓALAGI, naa laawooi ɠana! <verse eid="1KI 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 1:37"/>Eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yɛgai la màliɠii masagi è ʋa, é yɛ ɠana nɔ Salomɔn ʋa, é ná-masadai ma lɛbiyai zuwɔɔlɔ, é leʋe màliɠii masagi Davide nɔnɔi ʋa.»<verse eid="1KI 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 1:38"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui Sadɔke-o, GALA goo wo nui Natan-o, ta Yeɠoyada ná-doun zunui Ɓenaya, ta Kelɛte nuiti, naa ʋɛɛ Pelɛte geleiti ba, ti Salomɔn zeɠeni, ti tɛ masagi Davide ná-soovale fuului ɠɔma, ti lii la Giyon. <verse eid="1KI 1:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 1:39"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui Sadɔke minɛi zeɠeni, nii gulɔi ɠɛni su, seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu, é gulɔi ziɛ Salomɔn ma. Ti puʋugi vɛɛni, nuɓusɛiti pɛ ti ɠɛ ma: «Masagi Salomɔn lɛbi ɠeke faan!» <verse eid="1KI 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 1:40"/>Nuɓusɛi pɛ ge loni ga poluʋelei, ti ɗa lɛ, nuiti ti ɗa kooleiti fɛ ti ɗa ɠoozunɛ ga gola, eyɛsu zooi ɓali ga ti-wooi lugi.<verse eid="1KI 1:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Salomɔn Adoniya maavaayɛ fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 1:41"/>Adoniya ta ná-nu loligaiti ti zɔngɔ wooi mɛnini, siɛgi zu ti ɠɛni ɓesu la ga ta-vɛti laamii wo. Zoaɓe puʋugi wooi mɛnigai ma, é gaazaɠagi woni, é ɠɛ ma: «Lee ma vaa wuulee ka, é taazuʋɛ?» <verse eid="1KI 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 1:42"/>É yɛni nɔ ɓɔɛzu, zalaɠa ɠula nui Aɓiataal ná-doun zunui Zonatan ʋa. Adoniya ɠɛni ma: «Ʋa, mazɔlɔɔ ɗa ga sɔɓelama nu, tanisu woo niinɛ ʋagɔ ɠa è ʋaazu bosu.»<verse eid="1KI 1:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 1:43"/>Zonatan Adoniya wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Naa laade vɔlɔ pɛ, ade-maliɠii masagi Davide ɠa é Salomɔn zeiɗai ga masagi. <verse eid="1KI 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 1:44"/>Masagi zalaɠa ɠula nui Sadɔke, ta GALA goo wo nui Natan, ta Yeɠoyada ná-doun zunui Ɓenaya, ta Kelɛte nuiti ta Pelɛte nuiti pilɛgɛ polu, ti tɛɛʋɛ masagi ná-soovale fuului ɠɔma. <verse eid="1KI 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 1:45"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui Sadɔke ta GALA goo wo nui Natan ti gulɔi ziaa ma Giyon ga é ɠɛ ga masagi. Miná ɠa ti zeɠeai ná, ti lɛ ga koozunɛɛi, taai zu ɠɛ wuulee, naama zɔngɔ wooi ɠa wo mɛnigai. <verse eid="1KI 1:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 1:46"/>Salomɔn vɔlɔ zeiɗa masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa. <verse eid="1KI 1:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 1:47"/>Ade-maliɠii masagi Davide ná-nu wolaiti ti ʋaa ga ti tuya loo bɛ, ti ɠɛ ma: ‹Ɗa-ƓALAGI kɛ, é Salomɔn lɔɠɔi ɠula, é leʋe ɗɔnɔi ʋa, ta ná-masadai ma lɛbiyai wɔɔlɔ ɗɔnɔi ʋa!› Masagi yɛgɛ daa ʋetei zu, é nɔkɔ. <verse eid="1KI 1:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 1:48"/>Naa pɛ poluma, masagi wooi ɠaa, nii é bogai: ‹Mamagi ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI, nii é nu zeiɗai za nà-masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa, ta gè kaa ga ɠaazu.› »<verse eid="1KI 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 1:49"/>Adoniya ná-nu loligaiti ti naama wooi mɛnigai ma, ti zuɓalini, ɛsɛ ge ɗa li liizu ʋele. <verse eid="1KI 1:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 1:50"/>Adoniya lua ʋelei ma Salomɔn ʋa, é wuzeɠeni, é li, é zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma minɛiti so. <verse eid="1KI 1:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 1:51"/>Ti liini, ti ɠɛ Salomɔn ma: «Pɛtɛ, duai maaʋele ma, Adoniya liiʋɛ, é zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma minɛiti so, é ɗa ɠɛ ma: ‹Masagi Salomɔn minazeɠe bɛ̀ za, é ɠona ga é la pàa ga boɠa zɔkpɔi!› » <verse eid="1KI 1:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 1:52"/>Salomɔn ɠɛni ma: «Ni a ziɛna eɠɛ sɔɓelama nu, nɔundeɠai gila kpalaa ge la loɠa zooi ma. Kɛlɛ ni a ɠɛna ga sɔba nu, toɠa za.» <verse eid="1KI 1:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 1:53"/>Masagi Salomɔn numaa leʋeni, ti li, ti Adoniya zeɠe zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ, ti ʋaa la. É laani masagi Salomɔn ɠɔɠɔwu, Salomɔn ɠɛ ma: «Li ɗa-ʋɛlɛi wu.»<verse eid="1KI 1:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1KI 2"/>
  <para style="s">Davide falima woo ɠaaɓelagiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 2:1"/>Davide kaai ma ga toɠa na ʋa zaazu, é valini ná-doun zunui Salomɔn ma ga niima wooiti: <verse eid="1KI 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 2:2"/>«Nɔ̀un nà ga li ʋɛ ná ga fulu nui pɛ gaaɓelazuʋɛ. Zɛbɛzeɠe, é ɠɛ ga zunu! <verse eid="1KI 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 2:3"/>Ɠolo ɗa-ƓALAGI Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, è ɗa ziima vai nɔ ɠɛ, è ɠolo ná-deveiti ta ná-tɔgiti bɛ, ta ná-kala gooiti, eɠɛʋelei é sɛʋɛai la Moize ná-tɔgi zu, naa ɠa a kɛ è ɓɔɠɔ zɔlɔɔ naa pɛ su, nii ɗa yeeʋuu bu, <verse eid="1KI 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 2:4"/>nii a kɛ ɓalaa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI minazeɠegi naa laazeeli, nii é kɛɛni bɛ̀, siɛgi zu é ɠɛni la mà: ‹Ni è-mavofodaiti ta zìima vai ɠɛna wooɠɛɠiladai zu, ga ti-yii pɛ ta ti-yɛnvui pɛ, nu ɠa zɔlɔɔ nɔ ɠɔ ti zaama, nii a ɠɛ zeizu Izilayɛle masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa.›<verse eid="1KI 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 2:5"/>«Naa ʋoluma, è kwɛni nii kpein Seluya ná-doun zunui Zoaɓe kɛɛni ga ze, nii é kɛɛni ga Izilayɛle ɠɔɔʋɛbɛi ma lotuɠɔ felegɔiti Nɛɛl ná-doun zunui Aɓenɛɛl, ta Yetɛɛl ná-doun zunui Amasa. É ti ʋaani ziilɛigi ma ziɛgi zu, eɠɛʋelei a la kɛɛ la kɔɔɠɔ ziɛgi zu, naati ma ɲamai ma ɠasɔi ɠa tɔun unma. <verse eid="1KI 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 2:6"/>Ɠɛ ga ɠima nu tetemazu, mina zɛ ná, é ʋa za gaanɛ zu pɔlɔzaɠagi ya.<verse eid="1KI 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 2:7"/>«Mina yeema è Galaade nui Ɓaalazilayi ná-doun zunuiti so ga pagɔ, ti ɠɛ naati saama, niiti è ti ɠɔnɔkulazu, mazɔlɔɔ ʋele ɠana ti dàaɠomini la, kɛ̀ai ma ʋelazu è-liɛ Aɓasalɔme ʋa.<verse eid="1KI 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 2:8"/>«Mina yeema ga Simeyi ɠa è ɠoba, Ɓɛnzamɛn nui, Gela ná-doun zunui, nii é ɠɛni zeini Ɓaɠulime, é pòomuni, é kòto ga ɲɔuɗa, voloi gè ɠɛni liizu la Maɠanayime. Kɛlɛ gàlesuʋɛ ma, é ʋaani, é dàaɠomi Zuludɛn laaʋɛ, gè ɠonani bɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laaseigi zu, gè ɠɛ ma: ‹Gè la è ʋaa ga boɠa zɔkpɔi pɛ.› <verse eid="1KI 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 2:9"/>Niizu mina so ga sɔbalala nu, ɗa ga ɠima nu, è kwɛni ʋelei ɗa so da, anɛɛ ni pɔlɔzaɠagɛ na, kɛni è kɛ ʋele-o-ʋele ti paa.»<verse eid="1KI 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Davide zaa vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 29:26-28">1 Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛi 29:26-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 2:10"/>Davide zaani, ti maaɠulu Zeluzalɛme. <verse eid="1KI 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 2:11"/>É kona ʋuunaanigɔ (40) ɠɛni masadai zu Izilayɛle unda: É kona dɔfelai ɠɛɛni Eɓelɔn, é kona ʋuusaʋagɔ maazu saʋagɔi (33) ɠɛ Zeluzalɛme. <verse eid="1KI 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 2:12"/>Salomɔn zeini kɛɛɠɛ Davide ná-masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa, é tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ná-masadai zapelɔ.<verse eid="1KI 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Adoniya zaa vai leve vai Salomɔn ʋɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 2:13"/>Ɠagite ná-doun zunui Adoniya liini Salomɔn dee Ɓate-Seɓa ʋɔ bɛ. Naa gaazaɠani, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa ʋaazu nɛi ga kisiɛ ʋagɔa?» Adoniya ɠɛ ma: «Ungo. <verse eid="1KI 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 2:14"/>Nà pɔ gè ɓɔɛ è ʋɔ.» Naa ɠɛ ma: «Ɓɔɛna, ɓɛgele ʋe?» <verse eid="1KI 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 2:15"/>Adoniya ɠɛ ma: «È kwɛni ga masadai ɠɛa ga nɔ̀nɔ, ta Izilayɛle nuiti pɛ gaazu ɠɛa bà ga ti kɛ̀ ga masagi, kɛlɛ masadai latiga dèɠei ma, mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa é seiɗa tuɠɔ. <verse eid="1KI 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 2:16"/>Faa ɠila kpe nɔ ɠa gè falizu è ma, mina ɠɛlɛ gòoi ʋa.» Ɓate-Seɓa ɠɛ ma: «Ɓɔɛna!» <verse eid="1KI 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 2:17"/>É kpɔɛi zeɠeni, é ɠɛ ma: «Nà è maanɛɛnɛzu, bo masagi Salomɔn ma, é Sunɛme nui Aɓisage ve zèa, é ɠɛ ga ànzai. Mazɔlɔɔ nii nɔpɛ ɗa fali ma, é la ɠɛlɛa è-woo ʋa.» <verse eid="1KI 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 2:18"/>Ɓate-Seɓa ɠɛni ma: «Naa ʋagɛ. Nà ɓɔɠɔi nà ɓɔɛzu pɔ é ʋilɛ è ʋa.»<verse eid="1KI 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 2:19"/>Ɓate-Seɓa liini masagi Salomɔn ʋɔ bɛ ga é Adoniya ná-faa wo ma. Masagi wuzeɠeni, é li daaɠomisu, é laani tɔun kɔɠɔwu, é zei ná-masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa, é masa kpɔkpɔgi taɠili pilɛ, dee zei ga zeezazuʋɛ. <verse eid="1KI 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 2:20"/>É ɠɛni ma: «Gaazaɠa ko ɠila nɔ ɠa gè bosu ga ɗe, mina ɠɛlɛ bà.» Masagi ɠɛni ma: «Ɓɛgele ɠa è pɔ, dèe, gè la ɠɛlɛa.» <verse eid="1KI 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 2:21"/>Ɓate-Seɓa ɠɛ ma: «Ɓɛ Sunɛme nui Aɓisage ve è-ɠɛɛloin Adoniya ʋɛ é ɠɛ ga anzai.» <verse eid="1KI 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 2:22"/>Masagi Salomɔn dee wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Lee vaa zu è Sunɛme nui Aɓisage maavalizu Adoniya ʋɛ? Masadai pɛ maavali bɛ mu, tɛi tɔ ɠa é ga dìɛi, maavali tɔun bɛ, ta zalaɠa ɠula nui Aɓiataal ʋɛ, naa ʋɛɛ Seluya ná-doun zunui Zoaɓe ʋa!»<verse eid="1KI 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 2:23"/>Masagi Salomɔn ɠonani naazu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma, é ɠɛ ma: «GALA ge sò ná-ziiɠaawanai pɛ su, ni gè la Adoniya ʋaani, tɔɔzei nuu ʋa é maaɠaazaɠabogai. <verse eid="1KI 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 2:24"/>Gè ɠonaa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma, nii é vulua, tɛi é sèiɗai kpaan kɛ̀ɛ Davide ná-masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa, ta é minazeɠeai bɛ̀ ga masadai nà-o, màvofodaiti-yo, ga za nɔ ta Adoniya ʋa.» <verse eid="1KI 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 2:25"/>Masagi Salomɔn Yeɠoyada ná-doun zunui Ɓenaya leʋeni, é paa, ʋele ɠana Adoniya zaani la.<verse eid="1KI 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Salomɔn Aɓiataal ɠula vai ná-botii zu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 2:26"/>Masagi Salomɔn ɠɛni zalaɠa ɠula nui Aɓiataal ma: «Ɠale ma, è li è-ɠɔligiti saama ɗa-laazu Anatɔte, mazɔlɔɔ saai zoloogɛ è ma. Kɛlɛ gè la è ʋaazu za, mazɔlɔɔ è ɠɛni Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-minazeɠe kesui zeɠezu kɛ̀ɛ Davide ʋɛ, ta è ɗɔnɔ zɔlɔɔni ná-ziiɓɔlɔi pɛ su.» <verse eid="1KI 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 2:27"/>Ʋele ɠana Salomɔn Aɓiataal ɓɛɛni la, é kula Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-zalaɠa ɠula vai zu, nii a kɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laawooi laazeeli, nii é boni Eli ná-pɛlɛyeɠei ma Silo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wɛlɛ ʋɛ: <char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 2:30-36">1Sa 2:30-36</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="1KI 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Salomɔn devei vee vai ga <optbreak/> ti Zoaɓe ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 2:28"/>Naama wooi zeelini Zoaɓe ma. Zoaɓe ma ge ʋilɛni Adoniya ʋolu, anɛɛ ni é la ɠɛni ʋilɛni Aɓasalɔme ʋolu, naa ɠa é kɛɛni Zoaɓe liini, é lɔɔɠu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu, é li, é zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma minɛiti so. <verse eid="1KI 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 2:29"/>Ti liini, ti ɠɛ masagi Salomɔn ma: «Zoaɓe lɔɔɠuʋɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu, toɠa zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɠobaʋɛ.» Salomɔn Yeɠoyada ná-doun zunui Ɓenaya leʋeni naazu, é ɠɛ ma: «Li, è paa.» <verse eid="1KI 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 2:30"/>Ɓenaya zeeliai ma Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-seɠe ʋɛlɛi ma, é ɠɛni Zoaɓe ma: «Masagi ɠɛ, è ɠula.» Kɛlɛ é gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɓa-o! Ʋɛ ɠa gè zaazu ná!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:30">Ɓenaya ɠaleni ma masagi ʋɔ bɛ, é Zoaɓe ná-gooɠaaʋotegi wo ma. <verse eid="1KI 2:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 2:31"/>Masagi ɠɛni ma: «Li, è kɛ eɠɛʋelei é bogai la, paa, naa ʋoluma ɗa maaɠulu, è faa zeɠe gi unma gá nà-pɛlɛyeɠei, ɲamai naa vaa zu Zoaɓe puai fuun. <verse eid="1KI 2:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 2:32"/>Ɲamaiti é ti ʋuai, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa naati da tɔ ɓɔɠɔ unma, tɔɔzei é zunu felegɔ ʋaani, Nɛɛl ná-doun zunui Aɓenɛɛl, nii é ɠɛni ga Izilayɛle ɠɔɔʋɛbɛi ma lotuɠɔi, ta Yetɛɛl ná-doun zunui Amasa, Zuda ɠɔɔʋɛbɛi ma lotuɠɔi, niiti ti lelebogai, ti vizɔgai é leʋe tɔun ba, é ti ʋaa ga boɠa zɔkpɔi, kɛ̀ɛ Davide ɠwɛɛ faa la ɠɛni su. <verse eid="1KI 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 2:33"/>Ti-ma ɲamai ɠa la Zoaɓe ta mavofodaiti unma eyɛsu ɠɔ. Kɛlɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-ziilɛigi ɠa ɠɛ Davide ta mavofodaiti bɛ, ná-pɛlɛyeɠei ta ná-masa kpɔkpɔgi ʋɛ eyɛsu ɠɔ.»<verse eid="1KI 2:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 2:34"/>Yeɠoyada ná-doun zunui Ɓenaya liini, é Zoaɓe ʋaa. Ti maaɠuluni ná-zooi ma teʋebai zu. <verse eid="1KI 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 2:35"/>Masagi Yeɠoyada ná-doun zunui Ɓenaya ʋilɛni potogi zu kɔɔʋɛbɛi unda, é zalaɠa ɠula nui Sadɔke ʋilɛ Aɓiataal ʋotogi zu.<verse eid="1KI 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Simeyi ʋaa vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 2:36"/>Masagi keela leʋeni Simeyi ma, ti toli é ʋa, masagi ɠɛ ma: «Pɛlɛ lo ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ Zeluzalɛme, ná ɠa è ɠɛɛzu ná, è mina ɠula, è ʋa ziɛziɛ. <verse eid="1KI 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 2:37"/>Kwɛɛ ga voloi è ɠulazu la taai ʋa, è Sedelɔn ʋɛtugi maaleʋe, ɗa za, è-ma ɲamai ɠa la è unma.» <verse eid="1KI 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 2:38"/>Simeyi ɠɛni masagi ma: «Naa ʋagɛ! Nii nɔpɛ è bosu, màliɠii masagi, nɛ̀i gè ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui nà kɛ.» Simeyi lɛbini Zeluzalɛme.<verse eid="1KI 2:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 2:39"/>Kɛlɛ kona saʋagɔ ʋoluma, ná-duɔ felegɔ ʋelani, ti zeɠe pɔ bɛ, ti li Maaka ná-doun zunui Akise ʋɔ bɛ, Gate masagi. Ti ɠɛni Simeyi ma: «Ɗa-luɔiti ta Gate.» <verse eid="1KI 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 2:40"/>Simeyi wuzeɠeni názu, é ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛ, é lɛ ná-soovalegi ɠɔma, é li Gate, Akise ʋɔ bɛ, é ná-duɔiti seɠe, é ɠale ma ga tiye. <verse eid="1KI 2:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 2:41"/>Naama wooi zeelini Salomɔn ma ga Simeyi zeɠeʋɛ Zeluzalɛme, é li Gate, é ɠale ma. <verse eid="1KI 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 2:42"/>Masagi Simeyi lolini, é ɠɛ ma: «Gè la ɠɛni ɠɛɛni è ma: ‹Ɠona Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma ga è la ɠula taai ʋa,› ɓaa, gè ɠɛ è ma: ‹Voloi è ɠulazu la taai ʋa, ɗa za›? È la ɠɛni gòoɠaaʋoteni, è ʋa ɠɛ mà: ‹Naa ʋagɛ, gè mɛniga,› ɓaa? <verse eid="1KI 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 2:43"/>Lee vaa zu mu è konai naa zeɠea ma, nii boga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, è la ɠoloni devei ʋɛ gè feeni è ya?» <verse eid="1KI 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 2:44"/>Masagi ɠɛni Simeyi ma: «È kwɛni ɗa ɓɔɠɔi, faa ɲɔi nii è kɛa ga gaaɠilima ga kɛ̀ɛ Davide. Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ɗa-nu ɲɔulai ma ɠasɔi la è unma. <verse eid="1KI 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 2:45"/>Kɛlɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa tuya loo bɛ̀, é Davide ná-masa kpɔkpɔgi zapelɔ eyɛsu ɠɔ.» <verse eid="1KI 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 2:46"/>Masagi devei veeni Yeɠoyada ná-doun zunui Ɓenaya ya, naa ɠula, é Simeyi ʋaa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:46">Ʋele ɠana masadai zeini la ga pagɔ Salomɔn yeezu.<verse eid="1KI 2:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1KI 3"/>
  <para style="s">Salomɔn Falaɠɔn ná-doun anzanui <optbreak/> vulu vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 3:1"/>Salomɔn Ezipete masagi Falaɠɔn ná-doun anzanui vuluni, vului naa maaʋele ma, ti ɠilini ʋa ta Falaɠɔn. É ʋa ɠɛ é ɓe ga masa pɛlɛi lo, ta Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi, naa ʋɛɛ siɠigi ʋa Zeluzalɛme ma, nii é ɠɛni lolisu ɓalaa ga Davide ná-taa wolai, miná ɠa é zeini ná. <verse eid="1KI 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 3:2"/>Nuɓusɛiti ti ɠɛni dɛ zalaɠaiti kulazu zalaɠa ɠula adaʋɛti, mazɔlɔɔ ti la ɠɛni dɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi loni bɛ. <verse eid="1KI 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 3:3"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI nɛɛni Salomɔn ʋɛ, é ɠɛni ziɛzu ga kɛɛɠɛ Davide ná-tɛnɛ gooiti. Kɛlɛ tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ɠɛni zalaɠaiti kulazu, é ɗa ansansegiti gala zalaɠa ɠula adaʋɛti.<verse eid="1KI 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠigi vee vai Salomɔn ʋɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 1:2-13">2 Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛi 1:2-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 3:4"/>Yeeta, masagi liini Gaɓaɠɔn ga é zalaɠai ɠula, Mazɔlɔɔ miná ɠa ná ɠɛni ga zalaɠa ɠula ada ɓiigi: Salomɔn gala zalaɠa mɔinmɔingaa ɠulani niina zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ miná. <verse eid="1KI 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 3:5"/>Kpidii, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠulani bɛ kɛlɛma segi zu Gaɓaɠɔn, é ɠɛ ma: «Nii wɔin è ma, dɛɛ, gè kɛ è ʋɛ.» <verse eid="1KI 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 3:6"/>Salomɔn gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «È ɗa-wooɠɛɠilada wolai ɠulaʋɛ kɛlɛma ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui kɛ̀ɛ Davide ʋɛ, tɔ ɓalaa é ziɛ gaamai ta telebodai zu, naa ʋɛɛ sɔledai ʋa è ʋɛ. È naama wooɠɛɠiladai makɛga bɛ ga è doun zunu ve bɛ, nii é zeini za ná-masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa. <verse eid="1KI 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 3:7"/>Niizu niina, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI nà-GALAGI, ɗa ɠa è kɛ̀a ga masagi, nɛ̀i gè ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui, kɛ̀ɛ Davide ʋotogi zu, nà ma, nà ga zunu loungo nɔ, nii é la zooni deve wosu. <verse eid="1KI 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 3:8"/>Nɔ̀un nɛ̀i gè ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui, gè wɛlɛa nɔ, gè ɓɔɠɔ ɠa ɗa-nuɓusɛiti untuɠɔ, niiti è yiimazeɠeai ga tiye, ti mɔinɗai, nu la zooga ti ɠaalusu, è ʋa ti-lie kwɛɛ. <verse eid="1KI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 3:9"/>Naa ɠa é ba, ɠigi ve zèa, nɛ̀i gè ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui, nii nà lo da ɗa-nuɓusɛiti tuɠɔ, gè kwɛɛ nii pagai ta nii ɲɔuɗai. Mazɔlɔɔ ni naa laade, ɓɛ ɠa a zoo losu ɗa-nuɓusɛ mɔinmɔingi niiti tuɠɔ?»<verse eid="1KI 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 3:10"/>Naama ƓALA falii Salomɔn kɛɛni, é nɛɛni Maliɠii ʋɛ. <verse eid="1KI 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 3:11"/>GALA ge wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Tɛi naa ɠa è falizu, è la sii zuɠooza valini ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ, è la naavolo valini ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ, è la ɓalaa è zili nuiti saa vai valini, kɛlɛ ɠigi ɠa è falizu, nii a kɛ è masadai ɠɛ ga telebodai, <verse eid="1KI 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 3:12"/>nà è yiima vai laazeelizu, nii a kɛ ɠigi ɠɛ è ma, ta è ɠeleɠele, é leʋe naati ba, ti ɠɛa è luɠɔ, ta niiti ti ʋaazu è ʋoluʋele. <verse eid="1KI 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 3:13"/>Naa pɛ poluma, nii è la falini, nà naa veezu è ya, naavoloi ta lɛbiyai, nii a kɛ è-zii ma voloi pɛ su, è ɠɛɠala mina zɔlɔɔ masagiti saama. <verse eid="1KI 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 3:14"/>Ni ɗa ziɛna ga nà-peleiti, è ɠolo nà-deveiti ta nà-tɔgiti bɛ ga è-ɠɛɛ Davide ɠɛʋele, nà è-zii zuɠooza.»<verse eid="1KI 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 3:15"/>Salomɔn wuunni, é gaaɠa ga GALA kpɔɛʋɛ pɔ segi zu. É ɠaleni ma Zeluzalɛme, é li Maliɠii ná-minazeɠe kesui ʋɔ bɛ. É gala zalaɠaiti ta ziilɛi zalaɠaiti kulani, é fɛti wola ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛ ná-botiɠɛ nu wolaiti bɛ.<verse eid="1KI 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Salomɔn tukpɔi ɠaaleʋe vai ga ɠimalai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 3:16"/>Yeeta koloɠolo anzanu felegɔ ʋaani masagi ʋɔ bɛ, ti lo kakala. <verse eid="1KI 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 3:17"/>Gilagi ɠɛni ma: «Ni ɗa vaana bu, màliɠii, woilo gòo ma. Gá anzanui nii gá ɲiizu pɛlɛ ɠilagi wu, gè doun zunu ɠila sɔlɔɔgɛ koba. <verse eid="1KI 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 3:18"/>Folo saʋagɔ ʋoluma, tɔ ɓalaa é doin zɔlɔɔ. Giya ɠila nɔ ɠa gi ɠɛa pɛlɛi wu, nu ɠili nɔpɛ ge la ɠɛa gi ɠoba, kɛni gi felegɔ nɔ. <verse eid="1KI 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 3:19"/>Kpidii niina é laani ná-doin ma, naa za. <verse eid="1KI 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 3:20"/>Buzeɠe ʋele ɠana kua zaamai, názu nɛ̀i gè ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ anzanui gè ɲiizu, é dòin zeɠe kàkala, é da ɠakala, é nɔnɔ ma loun ʋoomai la kàkala. <verse eid="1KI 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 3:21"/>Sobui gè wuzeɠea ga gè ɲiimii ve doin ya, gè ka ga doungoi zaaʋɛ. Foloi ɠulaai ma, gè ɗa pɛtɛ ga pagɔ, gè ka niina ga nɔ̀nɔ ma loin laade, nii gè sɔlɔɔgai.»<verse eid="1KI 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 3:22"/>Zɔi yɛ ná, é ɠɛ ma: «Zɛ! Dòin ɠa é vulua, ɗɔnɔi ɠa saai!» Ma mɔungi ɠɛ ma: «Ɓa-o, ɗɔnɔ naa mu ka saai, nɔ̀nɔi ɠa é vulua!» Naama maaɠaalii ɠa ti ɠɛni ga masagi ɠakala. <verse eid="1KI 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 3:23"/>Gaaɓelagi zu, naa ɗa ɠɛ ti ma: «Zɔi ɠɛ: ‹Dòin ɠa é vulua, ɗɔnɔi ɠa saai,› zɔi ɓalaa ge ɠɛ: ‹Ɓa-o! È-loin ɠa saai, nɔ̀nɔi ɠa é vulua.› » <verse eid="1KI 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 3:24"/>Masagi ɠɛ ma ʋolu: «À ʋa ga boɠa zɔkpɔi ta pɔ̀.» Ti ʋa ga boɠa zɔkpɔi pɔ. <verse eid="1KI 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 3:25"/>É ɠɛ ma: «Doungoi nii é vulua, à teʋe su fele, wo gilazuʋɛ ve zɔi ya, wo gilagi ve zɔi ɓalaa zea.»<verse eid="1KI 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 3:26"/>Zɔi nɔnɔ ɠɛni ga doungoi é vulua, ná-doin maawɔin soni ga gola, é ɠɛ masagi ma: «Maliɠii, doungoi nii é vulua, à fe zea, kɛlɛ à mina paa!» Kɛlɛ bɔɔlai ɠɛni ma: «Ɓa-o! À teʋe su, naazu é la yɛga zèa, é la yɛga zea.» <verse eid="1KI 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 3:27"/>Názu ɠa masagi tukpɔi ɠaaleʋeni la, é ɠɛ ma: «À mina doungoi ʋaa, nii é vulua, wo fe anzanu mɔungi ya, toɠa ná-doun ʋe.»<verse eid="1KI 3:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 3:28"/>Izilayɛle nuiti pɛ ti masagi ná-tukpɔɠaaleʋei naa ma woo mɛnini. Ti pɛ ti luani ba, tɔɔzei ti kwɛɛni ga é ɠigi zɔlɔɔgɛ GALA zea tukpɔɠaaleʋe vai zu.<verse eid="1KI 3:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1KI 4"/>
  <para style="s">Salomɔn ná-botiɠɛ nu wolaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 4:1"/>Masagi Salomɔn ɠɛni Izilayɛle pɛ unda. <verse eid="1KI 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 4:2"/>Ná-nu wolaiti daaseigiti kaa: Zalaɠa ɠula nui Azalia, Sadɔke ná-doun zunui, <verse eid="1KI 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 4:3"/>Sisa ná-doun zunu felegɔiti, Eliyɔlɛfe ta Ayiya, naati ka ti ɠɛni ga ná-sɛʋɛ ɠɛ nuiti. Ayilude ná-doun zunui Zozafate ɠɛ ga laavaawogi. <verse eid="1KI 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 4:4"/>Yeɠoyada ná-doun zunui Ɓenaya ɠɛni ga kɔɔʋɛbɛi ma lotuɠɔi, Sadɔke ta Aɓiataal ti ɠɛ ga zalaɠa ɠula nuiti. <verse eid="1KI 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 4:5"/>Natan ná-doun zunui Azalia ɠa é ɠɛni ga zou zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠiiti ta-ɠundiɠii, Natan ná-doun zunui Zaɓude ɠɛni ga zalaɠa ɠula nui, é ɠɛ ga masagi bɔɔlai. <verse eid="1KI 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 4:6"/>Ayisaal ɠa é ɠɛni wɛlɛzu masa pɛlɛi ma, Aɓada ná-doun zunui Adonilame ɠa é ɠɛni ga duɔla wotii ma ɠundiɠii.<verse eid="1KI 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 4:7"/>Zou zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠi puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12) ɠa é ɠɛni Salomɔn ya Izilayɛle yooi ná pɛ su, tiya ɠa ti ɠɛni masagi ta ná-pɛlɛyeɠei ɠɔnɔ fai gaaɠulazu ba, ti ɠilagilagiti pɛ ti ɓena alu gilagila seɠe konagi zu. <verse eid="1KI 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 4:8"/>Ti-laaseigiti kaa: Ɠuul ná-doun zunui, nii é ɠɛni Efelayime ɠize yooi zu. <verse eid="1KI 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 4:9"/>Deekɛɛl ná-doun zunui ɠɛni Makase, ta Saalaɓime, ta Ɓɛte-Semɛse, ta Elon Ɓɛte-Ɠanan unda. <verse eid="1KI 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 4:10"/>Ɠesɛde ná-doun zunui ɠa é ɠɛni Aluɓɔte, tɔ ɠa Soko ta Ɠefɛɛl yooi ɠɛni zea. <verse eid="1KI 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 4:11"/>Aɓinadaɓe ná-doun zunui ɠa Dɔɔl yooi ɠɛni zea, Salomɔn ná-doun anzanui Tafate ɠa é ɠɛni ga anzai. <verse eid="1KI 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 4:12"/>Ayilude ná-doun zunui Ɓaana ɠa Taanake ta Megido ɠɛni zea, ta Ɓɛte-Seyan pɛ, nii é Saletan ɠobaʋɛ Zizeleyɛle wuʋɛ, é zo Ɓɛte-Seyan, é li Aɓɛle-Meɠola, é li Yokemeyame. <verse eid="1KI 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 4:13"/>Geɓɛɛl ná-doun zunui ɠɛni zeini Lamɔte Galaade yooi zu. Tɔ ɠa é ɠɛni Manasé ná-doun zunui Yayiil ná-taaiti unda ga kundiɠii, niiti ti ɠɛni Galaade, naa ʋɛɛ Aalagɔɓe ɠoʋii Ɓasan yooi zu ʋa, taa wola ʋuulɔzita (60) ɠɛni ná, siɠigi ti ma, ti laa ɗa ɠulu ga kɔlu ɓɔi sɔɠɔgi. <verse eid="1KI 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 4:14"/>Ido ná-doun zunui Ayinadaɓe ɠa é ɠɛni Maɠanayime. <verse eid="1KI 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 4:15"/>Ayimaase ɠɛni Nɛfɛtali. Naa ɓalaa Salomɔn ná-doun anzanui ta zeɠeni ga anza, daa ga Ɓasemate. <verse eid="1KI 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 4:16"/>Ɠusayi ná-doun zunui Ɓaana ɠa é ɠɛni Asɛɛl ta Ɓealɔte. <verse eid="1KI 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 4:17"/>Palua ná-doun zunui Zozafate ɠa é ɠɛni Isakaal. <verse eid="1KI 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 4:18"/>Ela ná-doun zunui Simeyi ɠɛ Ɓɛnzamɛn. <verse eid="1KI 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 4:19"/>Uli ná-doun zunui Geɓɛɛl ɠɛni Galaade yooi zu, Amool masagi Siɠon ná-zooi ɠɛni zea, ta Ɓasan masagi Wɔge ná-zooi. Zou zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠi ɠila nɔ ɠa é ɠɛni zooi ná zu. <verse eid="1KI 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 4:20"/>Zuda ta Izilayɛle ti mɔinni eɠɛ kpoloɗɛi ɠoba ɲaɠaegi. Ti ɠɛni daamii ta kpɔɔlei wosu, ti ɗa ɠoozunɛ.<verse eid="1KI 4:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1KI 5"/>
  <para style="s">Salomɔn ná-masadai zeelizuʋɛti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 5:1"/>Salomɔn ɠɛni masadai ɠɛɛzu zɔɔma masada ʋɛlɛʋɛlɛgiti pɛ unda, é zo ziɛ wolai Efelate, é li Filisiti yooi zu, é zeeli Ezipete yooi ɠwɛgi ma. Sii ma voloi pɛ su, naama yooiti ti ɠɛni maazoloo ganii ɠulazu, ta ti ɠoloni bɛ.<verse eid="1KI 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 5:2"/>Folo-o-folo Salomɔn ta ná-nuɓusɛiti kɔnɔgi ɓena ɠɛ ga ɓulu vukɔ ʋagɔi ma ɓaazagi kilo waataaʋuugɔ (9.000), ta ɓulu vukɔi kilo waapuugɔ maazu lɔsaʋa (18.000). <verse eid="1KI 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 5:3"/>Nikɛ puugɔ niiti ti makɛgai ga pagɔ, ta nikɛ ʋuufelegɔ (20) niiti ti zogai nikɛ makɛsuʋɛ dɔɓɔi zu, baala ungila (100), naa la ʋɛɛni goegiti, ta dopaiti, ta boliiti ba, ta wɔniiti ti makɛgai ga pagɔ. <verse eid="1KI 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 5:4"/>É ɠɛni masadai ɠɛɛzu yooiti pɛ unda niiti ti folo liizu ʋelei ziɛ wolai Efelate letemaʋɛ, é zo Tifisa, é zeeli Gaza, é ɠɛni naama you yɔɠɔzuʋɛ masagiti pɛ unda, ta ziilɛigi ɠɛni ti yɔɠɔzu ta maaɠoolii zu yooiti pɛ. <verse eid="1KI 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 5:5"/>Sii ma voloi pɛ su, Zuda ta Izilayɛle nuiti sei ʋele ʋani, é zo Dan, é li Ɓeel-Seɓa, ɛsɛ pɛ ge ɠɛni ná-leezɛn ɓelei ta ná-kooleɠoole gului wu, é ɗa ɠoozunɛ ná ziilɛigi zu.<verse eid="1KI 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 5:6"/>Soo waaʋuunaanigɔ (40.000) makɛ pɛlɛiti ti ɠɛni Salomɔn ya, ta soo ɓizɛ zalaʋusu waapuugɔ maazu felegɔ (12.000), ná-wotoloiti faa zu. <verse eid="1KI 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 5:7"/>Zou zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠiiti ti ɠɛni masagi Salomɔn ɠɔnɔ fai ɠaaɠulazu ba, ta niiti kpein é ɠɛni ti ɠɔnɔkulazu, ɛsɛ ge ɠɛni ná-botii ɠɛɛ alugi naa zu nii feai zea, ti la ɠɛni vaazu bu ga ani nɔpɛ ge ʋala ti ya. <verse eid="1KI 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 5:8"/>Ɛsɛ ge ɠɛni sooiti ta kpizɛ geleiti kɔnɔgi leʋesu naama adaʋɛ ʋɛ masagi ɠɛni ná, ga moloi nii daa ga wɔɔlezegi, ta molo ɓaɠai, é zoloo devei ma bogai.<verse eid="1KI 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Salomɔn ná-ɠimalai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 5:9"/>GALA ge ɠigi ta keleɠele golai veeni Salomɔn ʋɛ, ná-faaɠwɛgi zu vai mɔin eɠɛ kpoloɗɛi laaʋɛ ɲaɠaegi. <verse eid="1KI 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 5:10"/>Salomɔn ɠimalai zɔlɔɔni, é leʋeni ɠima nuiti kpein ba, niiti ti ɠɛni folo ɠulazu ʋele yooiti su, ta Ezipete. <verse eid="1KI 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 5:11"/>Kɛɠala la ɠɛni nuiti saama ɠimalai zu, ná-ɠimalai leʋeni Ezela nui Etan nɔnɔi ʋa, é leʋeni ɓalaa Maɠɔle ná-doun zunuiti ba: Ɠeman, ta Kalakɔle ta Daalada. Salomɔn wɔɔlɔ ʋelei ma, maawooi ziɛni ti maaɠoolizu nuɓusɛiti saama. <verse eid="1KI 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 5:12"/>É faalaali waasaʋagɔ (3.000) ta guye waagila dɔɔlugɔ (1.005) ɓɛtɛni. <verse eid="1KI 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 5:13"/>É ɓɔɛni é ʋilɛ pɔnɔgani kpein ba, é zo Liɓan sɛdele gului ma, é kɔkula ɠizɔɔpe tufa ɓifɔgi ma, é ʋɔnɔsu siɠigi ʋa. É ɓɔɛni mɔnɔ é ʋilɛ suaiti, ta wɔniiti, ta kpokpo suaiti, ta kaleiti ba. <verse eid="1KI 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 5:14"/>Etea masagi niiti pɛ ti ná-ɠimalai ma woo mɛnini, naati ti ɠɛni nuiti teʋesu ga ti ná-ɠima ɓɔɛi ta mɛni.<verse eid="1KI 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Salomɔn GALA sei ʋɛlɛi lo fai <optbreak/> ma ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛi ɠɛɛ vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 7:13-14">1 Masagiti 7:13-14</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="2CH 1:18-2:17">2 Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛi 1:18—2:17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 5:15"/>Tiil masagi Yilame mɛnigai ma ga ti gulɔi ziaa Salomɔn ma, ti kɛ ga masagi kɛɛɠɛ ʋotogi zu, é numaa leʋeni ma. Mazɔlɔɔ Davide bɔɔla wɔlɔwɔlɔ ge ɠɛni ga Yilame. <verse eid="1KI 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 5:16"/>Salomɔn keelaiti teʋeni Yilame ma, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="1KI 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 5:17"/>«Ɗa ɓɔɠɔi è ɠɛa kɛ̀ɛ Davide ɠwɛɛ, é la zooni é ʋa pɛlɛ lo ná-GALAGI Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, tɔɔzei kɔɔi ʋa é ɠɛa kɔɔzu nuɓusɛi naati daalɔɠɔma, ti ɠɛa maaɠakuni, eyɛsu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓe ga ti la kɔɠɔwu. <verse eid="1KI 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 5:18"/>Kɛlɛ niizu, nà-GALAGI Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI dooɠogi vea zèa adɛ pɛ, kɔ̀ɔɲɔɠɔ la mɔ ná, inɛinɛ faa la ná, é ʋa lo maanɔɠɔ vaa ʋa. <verse eid="1KI 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 5:19"/>Wɔin ɠa mà ga gè pɛlɛi lo nà-GALAGI Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laaseigi zu, eɠɛʋelei tɔ ɓɔɠɔi é boni la kɛ̀ɛ Davide ma ga: ‹È-loun zunui nii gè ʋaazu seizu ɗa-masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa è-ʋotogi zu, naa ɠa é ʋaazu pɛlɛi losu dàaseigi zu.› <verse eid="1KI 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 5:20"/>Va bu niizu, è devei ve ga ti Liɓan sɛdele gului ta leʋe bɛ̀. Nà-botiɠɛ nuiti ta ɓɔsu ɗɔnɔiti ba, nii nɔpɛ ɗa bo ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nuiti salai, nà naa veezu. Mazɔlɔɔ ɗa ɓɔɠɔi è kwɛni ga gulu leʋe nu ʋagɔ la gi zaama ga wo ɠɛʋele, Sidɔn nuiti.»<verse eid="1KI 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 5:21"/>Yilame Salomɔn wooi mɛnigai ma, gola ɠoozunɛɛni, é ɠɛni ma: «Mamagi ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, nii é ɠima loun vea Davide ʋɛ, nii a lo niima nuɓusɛ mɔinmɔingi niiti tuɠɔ.» <verse eid="1KI 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 5:22"/>Yilame wooleʋeni Salomɔn ma, é gooɠaaʋote, é ɠɛ ma: «Nii è bogai ɗa-wooleʋegi zu, gè mɛniga. Nii nɔpɛ è pɔ é lo sɛdele gului ta sipɛlɛ gului ʋa, nà fe è ʋɛ. <verse eid="1KI 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 5:23"/>Nà-botiɠɛ nuiti ta ti zeɠezu Liɓan ɠizeiti ma, ti yei ga tiye kpoloɗɛi laaʋɛ, ti guluɓumaiti gili ba, ti kɛ ga bebeiti, ti da ziɛi ɠa eyɛsu ti zeeli ga tiye ʋɛ è ná lɛɛzu ga ze, ti bebei naati fie ná. Ɗa-wotiɠɛ nuiti ta ʋa, ti guluiti seɠe miná. Ɗa ma, è nà-pɛlɛyeɠei ɠɔnɔgi ve, nii nà bo è ma.»<verse eid="1KI 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 5:24"/>Yilame sɛdele gului ta sipɛlɛ gului veeni Salomɔn ya, ʋelei é ɠɛni pɔ la. <verse eid="1KI 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 5:25"/>Salomɔn ma tetegi, kona-o-kona é ɠɛni masagi Yilame ná-pɛlɛyeɠei ɠɔnɔgi veezu, moloi nii daa ga ɓelee, naa ma ɠilo miliyɔn lɔzita (6.000.000) ta wolive wulɔ ʋagɔi litɛlɛ waadɔsaʋa (8.000), é ɠɛ ga ná-masa pɛlɛyeɠei ɠɔnɔgi. <verse eid="1KI 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 5:26"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠigi veeni Salomɔn ʋɛ eɠɛʋelei é minazeɠeni la bɛ. Ziilɛigi ɠɛni Salomɔnni zɔɠɔzu ta Yilame, ti felegɔ ti minazeɠe kɛɛni yɔɠɔzu.<verse eid="1KI 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 5:27"/>Masagi Salomɔn duɔla wotiɠɛ nu waaʋuusaʋagɔ (30.000) laasei sɛʋɛni Izilayɛle yooi zu ná pɛ. <verse eid="1KI 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 5:28"/>Alu gilagila é ɠɛni nu waapuugɔ (10.000) leʋesu Liɓan, ti ɠɛni alu gila kɛɛzu Liɓan, ti alu felegɔ ɠɛ ta-laazu. Adonilame ɠa é ɠɛni ga ta-ɠundiɠii. <verse eid="1KI 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 5:29"/>Kasɔ mɛɛn nu waaʋuulɔfela (70.000) ɠɛni Salomɔn ya, ta kɔtu zaɠa nu waaʋuulɔsaʋa (80.000) gize yooi zu, <verse eid="1KI 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 5:30"/>é ɠula kundiɠii waasaʋagɔ unsaʋagɔiti (3.300) polu, niiti ti ɠɛni Salomɔn ná-zou zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠiiti bu, ta ti ɠɛni wɛlɛzu botiɠɛ ʋɛbɛi naa ná-botii ma. <verse eid="1KI 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 5:31"/>Masagi Salomɔn devei veeni ga ti kɔtu ɓaaza papagiti kula, ti ti zaɠa, ti ɠɛ ga pɛlɛi wuulaagi. <verse eid="1KI 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 5:32"/>Salomɔn ta Yilame ta-wotiɠɛ nuiti ta Geɓale nuiti ti ɠɛɛni kɔtuiti saɠazu, ti ɗa guluiti ta kɔtuiti kɛʋele ɓɛtɛ pɛlɛi lo fai zu.<verse eid="1KI 5:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1KI 6"/>
  <para style="s">GALA sei ʋɛlɛi lo fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 3:1-14">2 Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛi 3:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 6:1"/>Masagi Salomɔn Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi lo fai lɔɔzeini kona unnaanigɔ puulɔsaʋa (480) ʋoluma Izilayɛle nuiti kula yee ma Ezipete yooi zu, Salomɔn ná-kona naanigɔi ma masadai zu konagi ma alugi velesiɛi ma, nii daa ga Zive. <verse eid="1KI 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 6:2"/>Pɛlɛi nii Salomɔn toni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ sɔligi ɠɛni ga mɛtɛlɛ ʋuusaʋagɔ (30), kogi ɠɛ ga mɛtɛlɛ puugɔ, gaaɠooza ga mɛtɛlɛ puugɔ maazu lɔɔlugɔ (15). <verse eid="1KI 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 6:3"/>Tɛɛ wosuʋɛ ɠɛni GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ɠaazu ʋelei, sakpai ɠɛni ga mɛtɛlɛ puugɔ, é zoloo pɛlɛi ɠogi ma, buuɠooza ga mɛtɛlɛ lɔɔlugɔ. <verse eid="1KI 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 6:4"/>É fenɛtɛlɛiti kpɛtɛni pɛlɛi ʋa, é giliyazegi ʋilɛ ti la. <verse eid="1KI 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 6:5"/>GALA sei ʋɛlɛi maaɠoolii zu, é sangasoiti toni, é ti ʋoluzei pɛlɛ ɠoozu wolai ma ziɠigi ʋa, ta pɛlɛ ɠoozuʋɛ naa ɠɛni pɛlɛ ɓoga ʋelei. <verse eid="1KI 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 6:6"/>Sangasoi ma ʋɛlɛ mɔungi é ɠɛni buuʋɛ, naa ɠoozuʋɛ ɠɛni ga mɛtɛlɛ felegɔ ta tukpɛ (2,5), zaamazu gelei ɠoozuʋɛ ɠɛ ga mɛtɛlɛ saʋagɔ, maazuʋɛ gelei ɠoozuʋɛ ɠɛ ga mɛtɛlɛ saʋagɔ ta tukpɛ (3,5). GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma ziɠigi ɠaa ɠɛni liizu ga ʋɛlɛa etea ʋelei maazuʋɛ, nii a kɛ pɛlɛ maalɛɛ wuluiti ti mina lɔ siɠigi zu.<verse eid="1KI 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 6:7"/>Ti GALA sei ʋɛlɛi loni ga kɔtu zaɠaaiti nɔ, niiti ti ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛni kɔtu ɠulazuʋɛ, naa ɠa é kɛɛni eyɛsu pɛlɛ logi ɓe, nu la malito, ɓaa zoovɛ, ɓaa kɔlu ani nɔpɛ tu mɛnini GALA sei ʋɛlɛ losuʋɛ.<verse eid="1KI 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 6:8"/>Sangasoi ma ʋɛlɛ mɔungi laaʋɛ ɠɛni nu yeezazu ʋelei pɛlɛi ʋa, miná ɠa nu ɠɛni lɛɛzu ná, è ziɛ nu lɛɛzuʋɛ suzeiɗai, è lɛ zaamazu ʋɛlɛi wu, ʋele nɔ ɠana é ɠɛni la nu ʋa lɛ saʋasiɛi zu. <verse eid="1KI 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 6:9"/>Salomɔn ɓegai ma ga GALA sei ʋɛlɛi lo, é dakai ɓɛtɛni ga sɛdele gulu zɛʋɛiti ta é ma wulu ʋaliʋaligiti sei bu. <verse eid="1KI 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 6:10"/>É sangasoiti toni, ti ɠaaɠooza ga mɛtɛlɛ velefele ta tukpɛ (2,5), ti ʋoluzei pɛlɛi ʋa. É ti ɠilini pɛlɛi ʋa ga sɛdele guluiti.<verse eid="1KI 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 6:11"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Salomɔn ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="1KI 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 6:12"/>«Pɛlɛi ɠaa, è tosu, ni ɗa ziɛna é zoloo nà-tɔgiti ma, è ɠolo nà-deveiti bɛ, è ziɛ ga zìimai, ʋelei gè è leveai la, nà nà-minazeɠegi laazeeli è ʋɛ, nii gè kɛɛni è-ɠɛɛ Davide ʋɛ. <verse eid="1KI 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 6:13"/>Nà ʋa, gè zei Izilayɛle nuiti saama, gè la ɠɛlɛa nà-nuɓusɛiti ba, Izilayɛle nuiti.»<verse eid="1KI 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ɠoozuʋɛ ɓɛtɛ vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 6:14"/>Pɛlɛi lo fai ɓegai ma, <verse eid="1KI 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 6:15"/>Salomɔn sɛdele gulu zɛʋɛi ʋɛɛni siɠigi ma pɛlɛ ɠoozuʋɛ, é zo bu, é lɛ dakai ma, é sipɛlɛ gulu zɛʋɛi ʋɛɛ zooi ma pɛlɛ ɠoozuʋɛ ná pɛ. <verse eid="1KI 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 6:16"/>É sɛdele gulu zɛʋɛi ʋɛɛni pɛlɛ ɓoga ʋelei ma leʋesui ma ziɠigi ma, é zo bu, é lɛ dakai ma, sakpai ɠɛ ga mɛtɛlɛ puugɔ, é koozuʋɛ ɓɛtɛni, ná ɠɛ ga ada ɲadega wolai. <verse eid="1KI 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 6:17"/>GALA sei ʋɛlɛi mɔtai, pɛlɛ ɠoozu wolazuʋɛ zakpai ɠɛni ga mɛtɛlɛ ʋuufelegɔ (20). <verse eid="1KI 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 6:18"/>Gulu zɛʋɛi niiti ti ɠɛni pɛlɛ ɠoozuʋɛ, naati maaʋɛlupɛluni ga goolei ʋaaɠulabai ta ani ʋuai niiti ti ɠaaʋuyegai. Pɛlɛi ná pɛ maazeɠeni ga sɛdele gului, nu la ɠɛni kɔtui gila kpalaa kaazu.<verse eid="1KI 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 6:19"/>Salomɔn ada ɲadega wolai ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛni, ʋɛ ná wola vizɔni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi wu, nii a kɛ é Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-minazeɠe kesui la ná. <verse eid="1KI 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 6:20"/>Pɛlɛ ɠoozuʋɛ, ʋɛ é ná ɓɛtɛni, miná ɠogi ɠɛni ga mɛtɛlɛ puugɔ, sakpai ɠɛ ga mɛtɛlɛ puugɔ, gaa zɔligi ɠɛ ga mɛtɛlɛ puugɔ. Zanu kitei ɠa ti siɛni ma ziɠigiti ma, ti zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɓɛtɛni náʋɛ ti sɛdele gulu zɛʋɛiti pɛɛ ma. <verse eid="1KI 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 6:21"/>Salomɔn zanu kitei ziɛni pɛlɛ ɠoozuʋɛ ná pɛ. É zanu yɔlɔɠɔ goiti sɛlɛni ʋoluzu ʋele ʋɛlɛ ɠoozuʋɛ laaʋɛ. <verse eid="1KI 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 6:22"/>Pɛlɛ ɠoozuʋɛ ná pɛ ge ɠɛni nɔ ga zanugi, ʋele nɔ ɠana ɓalaa é ɠɛni la ga zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ nii é ɠɛni la ada ɲadega wolai laaʋɛ.<verse eid="1KI 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 6:23"/>Ti seeluɓɛin felegɔ maaniini saɠani ga dɔɓɔ wolive wului, ti ɠaa zɔligi ɠɛ ga mɛtɛlɛ lɔɔlugɔ, ada ɲadega wolai. <verse eid="1KI 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 6:24"/>Ti-ɠoʋe gilagilagi zuɠoozani ga mɛtɛlɛ felegɔ ta tukpɛ (2,5), ma ɠoʋe felegɔiti ta zeina la é ɠɛ ga mɛtɛlɛ lɔɔlugɔ. <verse eid="1KI 6:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 6:25"/>Seeluɓɛinti kpɛtɛ ʋelei ɠɛni ga faa ɠila nɔ. <verse eid="1KI 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 6:26"/>Ti-zɔligiti ti ɠɛ ga faa ɠila nɔ. <verse eid="1KI 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 6:27"/>Salomɔn seeluɓɛinti pilɛni pɛlɛ ɠoozuʋɛ, GALA sei ʋɛlɛi zaamaʋɛ, zɔi ɠoʋe gilagi zei pɛlɛi ʋa, zɔi ɓalaa ɠoʋe gilagi zei pɛlɛi ʋa, ti-ɠoʋe felegɔi zɔiti ti zei ɓɔɠɔ la. <verse eid="1KI 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 6:28"/>Salomɔn zanugi ziɛni seeluɓɛin naati ɓalaa ma.<verse eid="1KI 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 6:29"/>Ti pɛlɛ ɠoozu felegɔi ma ziɠigiti pɛlupɛluni ga seeluɓɛinti, ta dɔɔ wuluiti, ta ani ʋuaiti ti ɠaaʋuyegai. <verse eid="1KI 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 6:30"/>Ti zanugi ɓalaa puuni gulu zɛʋɛiti ma, niiti ti pɛlɛ ɠoozu felegɔiti buulaani ga tiye.<verse eid="1KI 6:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 6:31"/>Ada ɲadega wolai laaʋɛ ma ɓogi ɠɛni fele, ti ga dɔɓɔ wolive wului, daamasagiti, maazuʋɛ ta kobaʋɛ felegɔiti, naati ti ɠɛni siɠigi ma ɠaaɠwɛsu lɔɔlugɔi ɠila nɔ zeɠezu. <verse eid="1KI 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 6:32"/>Kpo felegɔiti ti ɠɛni ga dɔɓɔ wolive wului, kpo felegɔi naati pɛlupɛluga ɠɛni de ga seeluɓɛinti, ta dɔɔ wuluiti, ta ani ʋua ɠaaʋuyegaiti ti ɓɛtɛai ga zanugi. Ti zanugi ʋuuni ɓalaa seeluɓɛinti ta dɔɔ wuluiti ma maaniinigiti ma. <verse eid="1KI 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 6:33"/>Ʋele ɠana é kɛɛni la ga GALA sei ʋɛlɛi laa wolazuʋɛ ɓalaa. Daamasagiti, maazuʋɛ ta kobaʋɛ felegɔiti, naati ti ɠɛni ga dɔɓɔ wolive wului, ti siɠigi ma ɠaaɠwɛsu naanigɔi ɠila nɔ zeɠe, <verse eid="1KI 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 6:34"/>ta kpo felegɔiti ti ɠɛni ga sipɛlɛ gului, kɔlu ɠala felefelegi ɠɛ ti ɠilagilagiti ba. <verse eid="1KI 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 6:35"/>Ti ti maaʋɛlupɛlu ɓalaa ga seeluɓɛinti, ta dɔɔ wuluiti, ta ani ʋua ɠaaʋuyegaiti, ti zanugi ziɛ ʋɛti, ti naati maazaɠani. <verse eid="1KI 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 6:36"/>Salomɔn koi ɠoozuʋɛ maaɠakuni ga siɠigi, nii toga ɠɛni de ga kɔtu zaɠaai ma ɲɛkpɛ saʋagɔ, ti laani ɓɔɠɔ maazu, sɛdele gulu ʋaliʋaligi ma ɲɛkpɛ ɠila.<verse eid="1KI 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 6:37"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi ma wuulaagi laa vai lɔɔzeini Salomɔn ná-masadai ma ɠonagi naanisiɛi, alugi ma daa ga Zive, <verse eid="1KI 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 6:38"/>ná-masadai ma ɠonagi puugɔ maazu ɠilasiɛi (11) ma, alugi lɔsaʋasiɛi ma, nii daa ga Ɓule, ti ɓeni ga pɛlɛi lo, ti ba vai pɛ kɛ, eɠɛʋelei ti seini la kpasu. Kona dɔfela ɠa ti kɛɛni naazu ti ɓe ga pɛlɛi lo.<verse eid="1KI 6:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1KI 7"/>
  <para style="s">Masa pɛlɛi lo fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 7:1"/>Salomɔn tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ná-masa pɛlɛi lo fai lɔɔzeini, naa ma wotii ɠɛɛni kona puugɔ maazu saʋagɔ (13) laawu, é ɓe. <verse eid="1KI 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 7:2"/>É pɛlɛi loni dɛ, nii ti daasei pɛɛni ga: «Liɓan Lɔɓɔi», sakpai ɠɛni ga mɛtɛlɛ ʋuulɔɔlugɔ (50), kogi ɠɛ ga mɛtɛlɛ ʋuufele maazu lɔɔlugɔ (25), gaaɠooza ga mɛtɛlɛ puugɔ maazu lɔɔlugɔ (15), daaseigi naa ɠɛni ba, tɔɔzei dakai ma lagaiti ti ga sɛdele gulu zɛʋɛiti, naati ti ɠɛni laani kpɛdɛgi ma ɲɛkpɛ naanigɔ ɠa, naati ɓalaa ti ga sɛdele gului. <verse eid="1KI 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 7:3"/>Dakai ɓalaa nii é ɠɛni ga sɛdele gului, naa ɠɛni laani daga ɲɛkpɛ saʋagɔ ma, ti ga puugɔ maazu lɔɔludɔɔlu (15), ti pɛ kpɔga ɠɛ ga puunaanigɔ maazu lɔɔlugɔ (45), naati ɓalaa sɛdelegiti ka ti ɠɛni ti wu ga kpɛdɛgiti. <verse eid="1KI 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 7:4"/>Fenɛtɛlɛ laalaogai ma ɲɛkpɛi ɠɛni saʋa, fenɛtɛlɛi ɠilagilagi pɛ gaaʋotega ɠɛni de taɠili ma. <verse eid="1KI 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 7:5"/>Naama ɓogiti kpein ta daamasagiti, ti seki naanigi ɠazaʋini, ɠaaʋotegai ɓɔɠɔ ma ga felefele, ma ɲɛkpɛi ɠɛ ga saʋagɔ.<verse eid="1KI 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 7:6"/>Salomɔn kpɛdɛ pɛlɛ ɠoozuʋɛ loni, sakpai ɠɛni ga mɛtɛlɛ ʋuufelegɔ maazu lɔɔlugɔ (25), kogi ɠɛ ga mɛtɛlɛ puugɔ maazu lɔɔlugɔ (15). É nu lɛɛzuʋɛ ɓɛtɛni ba, é kpɛdɛgiti sei bu, é ná go maalɛɛ pɛlɛ ɠaazu ʋelei.<verse eid="1KI 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 7:7"/>É pɛlɛ ɠoozuʋɛ ná ta ɓɛtɛni, ʋɛ ɠɛni ga masa kpɔkpɔgi ʋilɛsuʋɛ faawo bo fai ma, é ná laasei pɛɛni ɓalaa ga faawo bo pɛlɛi. Buulaani, koozuʋɛ ma ziɠigi maazeɠe ga sɛdele gului, é zo zooi ma, é zei dakai ʋa.<verse eid="1KI 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 7:8"/>Tɔ ɓɔɠɔi laa ʋɛlɛi ɠɛni koi ɠili su, zɔɔma ɠoi ʋoluʋelei ʋɛ masa kpɔkpɔgi ʋilɛsuʋɛ ɠɛni ná, kɛlɛ é ti lo pelei ɓɔni. Salomɔn naama ʋɛlɛi ma zii loni Falaɠɔn ná-doun anzanui ʋɛ, nii é fuluni.<verse eid="1KI 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 7:9"/>Naama ʋɛlɛiti kpein toga ɠɛni de ga kɔtu ʋapagiti, ti zaɠaai ga pagɔ ga sii, gaazu felegɔi pɛ ma. Zekana é ɠɛni la é zo zooi ma, é lɛ pɛlɛ ɲigaaʋɛ, ta etea ʋelei siɠigi lo fai zu koii ma. <verse eid="1KI 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 7:10"/>Seɓasemaiti ɓɔɠɔi laani ga kɔtu ʋapagiti ti ɠoozakoozagai ga mɛtɛlɛ naaninaani, dɔɔludɔɔlu. <verse eid="1KI 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 7:11"/>Seɓasemai naati ka, ti kɔtu ɠooza ɓaazagiti daani ti ma, ti zaɠaai ga pagɔ ga sii, ta sɛdele guluiti. <verse eid="1KI 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 7:12"/>Siɠigi é ɠɛni koi wolai ma, toga ɠɛni de ga kɔtu ɠooza saɠaai ma ɲɛkpɛ saʋagɔ, ta sɛdele gului ma ɲɛkpɛ ɠila, ʋelei nɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi ma ɠoi ɠoozuʋɛ zu ziɠigi ɠɛni la ta ma lɛɛ wosuʋɛ.<verse eid="1KI 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Botii niiti ti ɠalivaai Yilame ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 7:13"/>Masagi Salomɔn keela leʋeni Yilame ma Tiil yooi zu ga é ʋa. <verse eid="1KI 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 7:14"/>É ɠɛni ga Tiil nu ga kɛɛɠɛ maaʋele, é ɠɛ ga Nɛfɛtali ma wolodamai zu nu ga dee maaʋele, naa ɠɛni ga poanzai. Yilame ɠɛni ga ɠima nu wola, é ɠeleɠele, ta é zoo kɔlu ɓɔigi ɓɛtɛzu gola. É ʋaani masagi Salomɔn ʋɔ bɛ, é naa ná-botiiti pɛ kɛ.<verse eid="1KI 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kɔlu ɓɔi kpɛdɛgiti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 3:15-17">2 Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛi 3:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 7:15"/>Yilame kpɛdɛ felegɔ ɓɛtɛni ga kɔlu ɓɔigi, ti zɔligi ga mɛtɛlɛ laaʋutaaʋu, ma ɠakumai ɠɛ ga mɛtɛlɛ lɔɔlugɔ ta tukpɛ (5,5). <verse eid="1KI 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 7:16"/>É seiga felegɔ ɓɛtɛni kpɛdɛgiti faa ma ga kɔlu ɓɔi gaawuungai, ti ɠilagilagi zɔligi ɠɛni ga mɛtɛlɛ felegɔ ta tukpɛ (2,5). <verse eid="1KI 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 7:17"/>É kɔlu ansa ʋɛlɛʋɛlɛgiti kpɛtɛni, ti ʋilipiligai ɓɔɠɔ zu eɠɛ yɔlɔɠɔ, seigai naati faa ma, é ɠɛni zɔi ʋa lɔfela, é ɠɛ zɔi ʋa lɔfela. <verse eid="1KI 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 7:18"/>É gelenade gulu waai ʋaaɠulabaiti kpɛtɛni ɓalaa, é kɛ ga ma ɲɛkpɛ felegɔ, é kaku kɔlu ansa ʋɛlɛʋɛlɛgiti ma, niiti ti ɠɛni seiga felegɔiti ba. <verse eid="1KI 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 7:19"/>Kpɛdɛ felegɔi niiti ti ɠɛni tɛɛ wosuʋɛ, seigaiti ti ɠɛni ti ɠa, ti-zɔligi ɠɛni ga mɛtɛlɛ velefele, ti ɓɛtɛai ga bulɛgi ma ʋuai ɠazaʋi pelei. <verse eid="1KI 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 7:20"/>Seigai niiti ti ɠɛni kpɛdɛgiti ga, naati kpokolosuʋɛ yeemaazuʋɛ, ʋɛ ná ɓudɛni kɔlu ɓɔi ansa ʋɛlɛʋɛlɛgiti maazu, nu a la zoo è gelenade unvelefele (200) gaalu, ma ɲɛkpɛi ɠakugai seigaiti kɔbuʋɛ. <verse eid="1KI 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 7:21"/>É kpɛdɛ felegɔiti pilɛni tɛɛ wosuʋɛ ɠakalaʋɛ, é nu yeezazu ʋele gelei laasei pɛɛ ga Yakin (nii poluʋɛ ga «toɠa sɛbɛlɔɔi wo su»). Felesiɛi é nu ɠɔʋɛzu ʋelei, é naa laasei pɛɛni ga Ɓoaze (nii poluʋɛ ga «zɛbɛi ɠa tɔun su»). <verse eid="1KI 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 7:22"/>Bulɛgi ma ʋuai ʋaaɠulabai ɠɛni zeini kpɛdɛgiti ungaʋɛ. Ʋele ɠana Yilame kpɛdɛgi kpɛtɛni la.<verse eid="1KI 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kɔlu ɓɔi ziɛ liɠi wolai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 4:2-5">2 Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛi 4:2-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 7:23"/>Yilame ziɛ liɠi wolai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wɛlɛ ʋɛ: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 30:17-21">Ɛgz 30:17-21</ref></char>.</note> ɓɛtɛni ga kɔlu ɓɔi gaawuungai. Kiliɠiligai, koozuʋɛ zɔligi ɠɛni ga mɛtɛlɛ lɔɔlugɔ, gaaɠooza ga mɛtɛlɛ felegɔ ta tukpɛ (2,5), ma ɠakumai ɠɛ ga mɛtɛlɛ puugɔ maazu lɔɔlugɔ (15). <verse eid="1KI 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 7:24"/>Goolei ʋaaɠulabai ɠakuni kɔbuʋɛ, puuvelefelegi (20) ɠa é ɠɛni mɛtɛlɛ ɠilagilagi pɛ ma, ma ɲɛkpɛi ɠɛni fele, é ma ɠɔlu ɓɔigiti gaawuunni ʋɔɔma ta tazai ma ɠɔlu ɓɔigi. <verse eid="1KI 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 7:25"/>Ziɛ liɠi wolai ɓɔɠɔi ɠɛni zeini nikɛ zinɛ ʋaaɠulaba puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12) ɠa, saʋagɔi ɠaaʋoteni ga lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu ɠɔʋɛzu ʋelei, saʋagɔ ɠaaʋote ga folo liizu ʋelei, saʋagɔ ɠaaʋote ga lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu yeezazu ʋelei, saʋagɔi ɠaaʋote ga folo ɠulazu ʋelei, ti ʋoluavegai ɓɔɠɔ ʋa tazai wu. <verse eid="1KI 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 7:26"/>Tazai ɠaaɠilini ga zeelo daa ɠila, dakɔlɔgi ɓɛtɛni eɠɛ ziawɔi, nii kpɛtɛai ga bulɛgi ma ʋuai ɠazaʋi pelei, litɛlɛ waaʋuulɔsaʋa (80.000) ɠɛɠala ɠa é ɠɛni ʋuuzu su.<verse eid="1KI 7:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kɔlu ɓɔi wotoloiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 7:27"/>Yilame wotolo puugɔ ɓɛtɛni ga kɔlu ɓɔigi, ti-ɠogiti ta ti-zakpaiti ti ɠɛni ga mɛtɛlɛ velefele, ti ɠaaɠooza ga mɛtɛlɛ ɠila ta tukpɛ (1,5). <verse eid="1KI 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 7:28"/>Pɛtɛ ʋelei é ti ɓɛtɛni la: Ti ɓɛtɛni ga kɔlu ɓɔi sɛpɛgiti, kɔlu ɓɔi sɛpɛgi naati gilia ɠɛni de ma ɠakaiti zɔɠɔzu. <verse eid="1KI 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 7:29"/>Zalaiti, ta nikɛiti, ta seeluɓɛinti baaɠulabai ɠɛni kɔlu zɛpɛgi naati ma, niiti ti zuzoni wotoloi ma ɠakaiti zɔɠɔzu, ʋele ɠana é ɠɛni ɓalaa wotoloi ma ɠakaiti niiti ti ɠɛni zalaiti ta nikɛiti baaɠulabaiti, ungaʋɛ ta buuʋɛ, naati maaʋɛlupɛluni ga adɛ maanɛɛ aniiti ti yeizu. <verse eid="1KI 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 7:30"/>Wotoloi ɠilagilagiti kpein ti-ɠɔɠɔi ɠɛni ga kɔlu ɓɔigi naaninaani, ti lɔɔni kɔlu ɓɔi sɔkpɔ ɠiliɠiligiti ga, ti ʋa ɗa lati ma. Kɔlu ɓɔi sɔkpɔi naati ɓalaa ti lɔɔni kɔlui tanigaa ɠa, wotoloi zeki naanigɔiti ga nii a kɛ ti taza wolai zuzo. Ti kɔlui naati gaawuunni ʋɔɔma ta wotoloi ma ɠakaiti, kɛlɛ ti la ɠɛni ɓudɛni ani naati maazu, ti ti ʋɛlupɛlugai. <verse eid="1KI 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 7:31"/>Wotoloi ungaʋɛ daaʋɛ ɠiliɠilini, suɠooza ga zeelo felegɔ ta tukpɛ, naa ɠa é ɠɛni tazai zuzosu, ma ɠakumai ɠɛ ga zeelo saʋagɔ ta tukpɛ, daalaosuʋɛ miná ɓalaa ʋɛlupɛluni. Kɔlu zɛpɛgiti ti ɠɛni ga seki naani kpuɠagi, ti la ɠɛni ɠiliɠilini. <verse eid="1KI 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 7:32"/>Ma ɠɔɠɔ naanigɔiti ti ɠɛni kɔlu zɛpɛgiti bu, kɔlui nii ti ɠɛni latisu ga, naa ɠilini wotoloi ʋa buuʋɛ, ma ɠɔɠɔ ɠilagilagi ma ɠakumai ɠɛni ga zeelo saʋagɔ ta tukpɛ. <verse eid="1KI 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 7:33"/>Ma ɠɔɠɔi naati ti ɓɛtɛni ga sooi nɔnɔ ma wotoloi ɠɔɠɔi ɠɛʋele. Nii é latisu ga, ta ma zeikoozuiti pɛ ti ɠɛni ga kɔlu ɓɔi gaawuungai. <verse eid="1KI 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 7:34"/>Kɔlu naanigɔi niiti ti ɠɛni wotoloi zeki naanigɔiti, naati ti ɠɛni ga ani ɠila ta kɔlu zɛpɛgiti. <verse eid="1KI 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 7:35"/>Kɔlu ɓɔi kiliɠiligi ɠɛni wotoloi ungaʋɛ, komaʋɛ wɔɔlɔai ga zeelo gila ta tukpɛ, kɔlu naanigɔi ta kɔlu zɛpɛgiti ti ɠɛni miná, ti ga kɔlu zii ɠila nɔ. <verse eid="1KI 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 7:36"/>Yilame wotoloi zosuʋɛ ma ɠɔlu zɛpɛgiti ta dagaiti pɛlupɛluni ga seeluɓɛinti, ta zalaiti, ta dɔɔ wuluiti, naa ʋɛɛ adɛ maanɛɛ aniiti ba. <verse eid="1KI 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 7:37"/>Ʋele ɠana é kɛɛni la ga wotolo puugɔiti kpein. Ti-zɔligiti ta ti-ɠazaʋigiti kpein ti ɓɔni, ti pɛ ti ɠɛni ga kɔlu ɓɔi gaawuungai.<verse eid="1KI 7:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 7:38"/>É taza wola puugɔ ɓɛtɛni ga kɔlu ɓɔigi, ti ɠilagilagi laaʋɛ zɔligi ɠɛni ga mɛtɛlɛ felegɔ, litɛlɛ waagila undɔzita (1.600) ɠa é ɠɛni ʋuuzu taza gilagi zu, tazai naati gilagilagi pɛ ge ɠɛni zeini wotolo puugɔiti gilagilagiti da. <verse eid="1KI 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 7:39"/>É wotolo lɔɔlugɔ ta ta-ɗɛ liɠiiti toni GALA sei ʋɛlɛi yeezazu ʋelei, é dɔɔlugɔi ta ta-ɗɛ liɠiiti to nu ɠɔʋɛzu ʋelei. Ziɛ liɠi wolai kiliɠiligai naa ɠɛni zeini GALA sei ʋɛlɛi yeezazu ʋelei lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu yeezazu ʋelei.<verse eid="1KI 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zalaɠa ɠula zɔɔlaiti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 4:7-5:1">2 Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛi 4:7—5:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 7:40"/>Yilame zuʋu zo aniɲakaiti ta pɛluiti ta ɲama vaza aniɲakaiti kpɛtɛni. Ʋele ɠana é masagi Salomɔn ná-botiiti kpein gaaɓelani la, nii naa feeni zea Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi vai zu: <verse eid="1KI 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 7:41"/>Kpɛdɛ felegɔ ta seiga felegɔiti ti ɠiliɠiligai, maanɛai ga ti zei ti ɠa, kɔlu ansa ʋɛlɛʋɛlɛ felegɔ niiti ti seiga ɠiliɠiligiti ma, <verse eid="1KI 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 7:42"/>gelenade gulu waai ʋaaɠulabai, naa unnaanigɔ (400) niiti ti ɠɛni zɛlɛni kɔlu ansa ʋɛlɛʋɛlɛgiti ba, ga ma ɲɛkpɛ velefele, <verse eid="1KI 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 7:43"/>wotoloiti ta taza wolaiti niiti ti ɠɛni zeini wotoloiti ga, <verse eid="1KI 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 7:44"/>ziɛ liɠi wolai nii tɔ ɠila é ɠɛni ɓɛtɛ ʋelei ma, ta nikɛi ʋaaɠulaba puugɔ maazu felegɔi (12), niiti é ɠɛni zeini ti ma. <verse eid="1KI 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 7:45"/>Yilame zuʋu zo aniɲakaiti, ta pɛluiti, ta ɲama vaza aniɲakaiti kpɛtɛni. Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi wu zɔɔlai niiti kpein ti ɠɛni ga kɔlu ɓɔigi maaloungai, é ti ɓɛtɛni masagi Salomɔn ʋɛ. <verse eid="1KI 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 7:46"/>Ti ti ɠaawuunni, ti ti ʋu penɛ yeɠeiti su, Zuludɛn ma nɛmɛ wolai zu, Sukɔteni zɔɠɔzuʋɛ ta Saletan. <verse eid="1KI 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 7:47"/>Salomɔn niima zɔɔlaiti pɛ kɛʋele ɓɛtɛni, ti la kɔlu ɓɔigi wuɲɛgi ɠɔɠɔni, tɔɔzei gola mɔinni.<verse eid="1KI 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 7:48"/>Salomɔn zɔɔma zɔɔlaiti kpɛtɛni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi vaa ma: ansansegiti kulazuʋɛ ga zalaɠai, ta taɓalii nii ɓului ɠɛni laazu ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, naati maaziɛni ga zanugi, <verse eid="1KI 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 7:49"/>fitina zei aniiti ti ga zanu kitei, ti ʋilɛgai ga dɔɔludɔɔlu, nu yeezazuʋɛ ta nu ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ, ada ɲadega wolai ɠakalaʋɛ, ta tufa waa ʋuaiti baaɠulabaiti, fitinaiti, ta bɛɛngiti, ti pɛ ti ga zanugi, <verse eid="1KI 7:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 7:50"/>tazaiti, salaʋa zo sɔɔlaiti, ɲama vaza aniɲakaiti, ansanse seɠe ɲakaiti, ansanse gala liɠiiti, ti ga zanu kitei, zanu kalagiti kpogiti faa ma pɛlɛ ɠoozuʋɛ ada ɲadega wolai ma ʋɛlɛlaʋɛ ta GALA sei ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ ma ɓogiti faa ma. <verse eid="1KI 7:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 7:51"/>Salomɔn ɓegai ma ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi lo fai ma wotii pɛ kɛ tɛtɛ, é devei veeni ga ti ʋa ga sɔɔlaiti pɛ kɛɛɠɛ Davide ti veeni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ: walii, zanugi, naa ʋɛɛ sɔɔlai ma zii pɛ ba, é ti pɛ pu GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma naavolo makɛsuʋɛ.<verse eid="1KI 7:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1KI 8"/>
  <para style="s">GALA sei ʋɛlɛi laalao fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 5:2-6:2">2 Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛi 5:2—6:2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 8:1"/>Naama ziɛgi zu masagi Salomɔn Izilayɛle ɠɛwolaiti pɛ, ta bolodama ɠundiɠiiti, ta pɛlɛyeɠeiti gaazuʋɛti pɛ tolini ga ti ɠaalɛ ba koba Zeluzalɛme, ga ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-minazeɠe kesui zeɠe Davide ná-taa wolai zu, ná laa ga Siyɔn, ti li la Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi ma ɠoizuʋɛ. <verse eid="1KI 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 8:2"/>Izilayɛle nuiti kpein ti ɠaalɛɛni ba masagi Salomɔn ɠoba fɛti ɠula vai ma, nii a ɗa ɠɛ alugi lɔfelasiɛi ma, daa ga Etanime.<verse eid="1KI 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 8:3"/>Izilayɛle ɠundiɠiiti pɛ ti ʋaani, zalaɠa ɠula nuiti tosuʋɛ ɠɛni ga ti minazeɠe kesui zeɠe. <verse eid="1KI 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 8:4"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ta Levi nuiti ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-minazeɠe kesui zeɠeni, ta GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi, naa ʋɛɛ bu zɔɔlai ɲadegaiti pɛ ba. <verse eid="1KI 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 8:5"/>Masagi Salomɔn ta Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti pɛ, niiti ti ɠaalɛɛni ba koba, naati ti ɠɛni minazeɠe kesui ɠakalaʋɛ, ti ɗa togani ʋɛlɛʋɛlɛgiti ta ma ɓaazagi ma mɔinmɔin kula ga zalaɠai, nu la ɓena tie kwɛɛ.<verse eid="1KI 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 8:6"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-minazeɠe kesui laani, ʋɛ ná ɓɛtɛai bɛ, ʋoluzu ʋele ʋɛlɛ ɠoozuʋɛ GALA sei ʋɛlɛ wu, ná laa ga ada ɲadega wolai, seeluɓɛinti koʋegiti bu. <verse eid="1KI 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 8:7"/>Tɔɔzei seeluɓɛinti koʋegiti suviega ɠɛni de minazeɠe kesui zeizuʋɛ maazu, nii a kɛ ti ʋɛɛ kesui ta seɠe wulu zɔkpɔiti ma. <verse eid="1KI 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 8:8"/>Ʋelei ti gulu zɔkpɔi naati koozani la, nu ɠɛni yɛsu ada ɲadegai wu, ʋɛ ná ada ɲadega wolai ɠakalaʋɛ, nu ɗa ti-zokpaiti ka, kɛlɛ nu la ɠɛni ti ɠaazu ga etea ʋelei. Miná ɠa ti yɛgai ná eyɛsu za. <verse eid="1KI 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 8:9"/>Ani ɠili ge la ɠɛni minazeɠe kesui zu, kɛni kɔtu ɠokolo felegɔiti Moize ti laani su Wolɛɓe,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:9 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Wolɛɓe</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Sinayi ɠizei laaseigi taɠili be.</char></note> siɛgi zu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI minazeɠegi ɠɛni la ti yɔɠɔzu ta Izilayɛle nuiti, ti ɠulazuʋɛ Ezipete. <verse eid="1KI 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 8:10"/>Siɛgi zu zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ti ɠulani la ada ɲadegai, tonaɓiingi Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi wuulaaveni. <verse eid="1KI 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 8:11"/>Tonaɓiingi maaʋele ma, zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ti la ɠɛni zooni ti ʋa yɛ ná ga ti ʋa ta-wotii ɠɛ. Mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-lɛbiyai ná-pɛlɛi wuulaaveni.<verse eid="1KI 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 8:12"/>Salomɔn ɠɛni ma názu: «Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛ, toɠa zeizu ada ɓidiai zu. <verse eid="1KI 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 8:13"/>Nɔ̀un, gè pɛlɛ maayiki toga è ʋɛ, ʋɛ ɗa zei ná eyɛsu ɠɔ!»<verse eid="1KI 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ɠalivaazuʋɛ ɓɔɛi <optbreak/> Salomɔn boni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 6:3-11">2 Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛi 6:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 8:14"/>Naa ʋoluma masagi latini, é tuya loo Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti pɛ bɛ, ti ɠɛni loni. <verse eid="1KI 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 8:15"/>É ɠɛni ma: «Mamagi ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI! É ná-minazeɠegi laazeelia, nii é kɛɛni kɛ̀ɛ Davide ʋɛ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="1KI 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 8:16"/>‹É zo foloi naa ma, yeei gè nà-nuɓusɛiti Izilayɛle nuiti kulani la Ezipete yooi zu, é zeeli za ma, gè la yiimazeɠeni ga taa wolai tanɔpɛ Izilayɛle wolodamaiti saama, ʋɛ pɛlɛ ɠa lo ná nɔ̀un bɛ, gè zei ná. Kɛlɛ gè yiimazeɠea ga Davide, nii a kɛ é lo nà-nuɓusɛiti Izilayɛle nuiti untuɠɔ.› <verse eid="1KI 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 8:17"/>Wɔin ɠɛni kɛ̀ɛ Davide ma ga é pɛlɛ lo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI lɔɠɔi wɔɔlɔ vaa ma, Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI. <verse eid="1KI 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 8:18"/>Kɛlɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni ma: ‹Pɛlɛ lo devei è bo ga nɔ̀un tɔɠɔi wɔɔlɔ vaa ma, naa ɠa ga faa ʋagɔ, è kɛɛʋɛ ga pagɔ è ɠisiɛ naa zu. <verse eid="1KI 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 8:19"/>Naa pɛ ge ɠɛ ʋa, ɗa lɛi è ʋa ɠɛ pɛlɛi naa losu, è-loun zunui ɠa é pɛlɛi naa losu bɛ̀.› <verse eid="1KI 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 8:20"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-minazeɠegi laazeelia. Gè kɛ̀ɛ Davide maavaliboga, nà zeini za Izilayɛle masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI boni la, ta gè pɛlɛi loga Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI lɔɠɔi wɔɔlɔ vaa ma. <verse eid="1KI 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 8:21"/>Gè ada yɛgɛ ná, ʋɛ minazeɠe kesui ɠa la ná, nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-minazeɠe gooi laani su, nii é kɛɛni ti yɔɠɔzu ta ade-mɛmɛwolani, siɛgi zu é ti ɠulani la Ezipete.»<verse eid="1KI 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Salomɔn ná-GALA maanɛɛnɛi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 6:12-40">2 Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛi 6:12-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 8:22"/>Naa ʋoluma Salomɔn loni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ laawu, Izilayɛle ɓɔgi pɛ gaazu. É yeelɛɛni geezu, <verse eid="1KI 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 8:23"/>é ɠɛ ma: «Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI, gala kili ge la ná ga è ɠɛʋele, geeɠɔlɔgi zu ta zooi ma. Ɗa ga wooɠɛɠila nu ɗa-minazeɠegi zu, ɗa ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai makɛsu ɗa-wotiɠɛ nuiti bɛ, niiti ti ziɛzu ga è-yiimai ga ti-yiimaʋɛ pɛ. <verse eid="1KI 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 8:24"/>Ʋele ɠana è ɗa-minazeɠegi laazeeliai la, nii è kɛɛni ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui kɛ̀ɛ Davide ʋɛ. Ungo, è naa ɠɛɛʋɛ za, nii a kɛ naa laazeeli, nii kulaai ɗa ɓɔɠɔi è-la, è bo. <verse eid="1KI 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 8:25"/>Niizu niina, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI, soma è zɔɔma minazeɠegi laazeeli, nii è kɛɛni, siɛgi zu è ɠɛni la ma: ‹Ni è-mavofodaiti ta ziɛ ʋele ɓɛtɛna, ti ziɛ gàazu ga pagɔ eɠɛʋelei ɗa ɓɔɠɔi è ziaai la, gè bo è ma ga gaamai, è la ʋalaga nu ma ti zaama, nii a zei Izilayɛle masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa nɔ̀un gaazu.› <verse eid="1KI 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 8:26"/>Naama minazeɠegi è kɛai ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui kɛ̀ɛ Davide ʋɛ, sona ma mu kae, Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI, è daazeeli.<verse eid="1KI 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 8:27"/>«Kɛlɛ GALA ka zoo nɛi é zei zooi ma? Geeɠɔlɔgi mu ta ná-suwɔɔlɔi é la vɔnini miná, de ʋa ɠɛ ma pɛlɛi nii gè togai. <verse eid="1KI 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 8:28"/>Naa pɛ ge ɠɛɛʋa, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà-GALAGI, soma è woilo nà-GALA falii ta nà-maanɛɛnɛi ma, woilo toligi ma gè bosu ga ɗe za, nɛ̀i gè ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui. <verse eid="1KI 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 8:29"/>Ɠaazu yɛ pɛlɛi nii ʋa kpidi ʋɛɛ folo ʋa, ʋɛ ɗa ɓɔɠɔi è kulaa la, è ɠɛ ma: ‹Ʋɛ ɠa gè ɠɛɛzu ná.› Woilo GALA falii ma gè daazeelizu è ma náʋɛ. <verse eid="1KI 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 8:30"/>Soma è woilo nà-maanɛɛnɛi ma, ta toligi ɗa-nuɓusɛiti Izilayɛle nuiti ti daazeelizu è ma, ta ɠaaʋotena adaʋɛ nii ma. Yɛ è-zeizuʋɛ geeɠɔlɔgi zu, è gá-ƓALA falii mɛni, è gi zuvaayɛ.<verse eid="1KI 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 8:31"/>«Ni nui ta a koto ɠɛɛna seiɲɔɠɔi laalɔɠɔma, ti ɠɛ ma kɛni é ɠona, ni konai naa ɠa wona ɗa-zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɠakalaʋɛ pɛlɛi nii ɠakalaʋɛ, <verse eid="1KI 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 8:32"/>yɛ geeɠɔlɔgi zu, è woilo, lɔ ti yɔɠɔzu, è ɗa-wotiɠɛ nuiti tukpɔɠaaleʋe, è sɔba nui ʋeelala, é sɔgi zulɔnɔgi zɔlɔɔ, è sɔbalala nui ná-sɔbalalai ɠula kɛlɛma, è so ʋelei ná-telebogi la.<verse eid="1KI 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 8:33"/>«Ni ɗa-nuɓusɛiti Izilayɛle nuiti ti zili nuiti ta vɔnina ti ma, tɔɔzei ti kotoi ɠɛa è laalɔɠɔma, ni ta ɠalena ma è ʋɔ, ti è maamusɛ, ni ta-maanɛɛnɛ wooi a zeelina è ma niima ʋɛlɛi wu, <verse eid="1KI 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 8:34"/>ti woomɛni geeɠɔlɔgi zu, ɗa-nuɓusɛiti Izilayɛle nuiti suvaayɛ ga ta-ɠotoi, ʋa ga tiye ʋolu zooi nii zu è feai ti-mɛmɛwolani bɛ.<verse eid="1KI 8:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 8:35"/>«Ni geeɠɔlɔgi laa ɠa ɠuluna, tona la ʋuuzu tɔɔzei ti kotoi ɠɛɛʋɛ è laalɔɠɔma, ni ta ɠaaʋotena ʋɛ ma ga ti è maanɛɛnɛ, ti è maamusɛ, ti zeɠe ta-ɠotoiti polu, mazɔlɔɔ è ti unmaayeiɗa, <verse eid="1KI 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 8:36"/>woilo ti-woo ma geeɠɔlɔgi zu, ɗa-wotiɠɛ nuiti ta ɗa-nuɓusɛiti Izilayɛle nuiti suvaayɛ ga ta-ɠotoi. Pele ʋagɔi lɛ ga tiye, nii ta ziɛ la, yeeɓe tonai ʋa, é ʋu zooi naa ma, é ga ɗɔnɔi, nii è feai ti ya ga tɔnɔ.<verse eid="1KI 8:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 8:37"/>«Siɛgi zu pului loozu la zooi zu, ɓaa ɗɔfɔi ɠɛ zooi zu, siɛgi zu siinziin ganiiti ti zeeɓɛzu la, siɛgi zu kotogiti ɓaa kotokɔliiti ti ʋaazu la ga mɔinɗa, siɛgi zu ɓalaa Izilayɛle zili nuiti ti ʋaazu la zooi zu, ti zeeli ta-laa wolaiti su, niiti siɠigiti ti ma, ni seeɓɛi ta ɓaa faaɓaagi tanɔpɛ ka ʋaana ti ma, <verse eid="1KI 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 8:38"/>ni naama vaaɓaagi ɠa nui tanɔpɛ ziiɓɔlɔna ɗa-nuɓusɛiti saama Izilayɛle nuiti, ma nui ɠa yeemaalena pɛlɛi nii ʋɔ pelei, é è maanɛɛnɛ, ɓaa é è vali, <verse eid="1KI 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 8:39"/>gooɠaaʋote geeɠɔlɔgi zu, ʋɛ è zeini ná, ti zuvaayɛ, lɔ ná yɔɠɔzu, è ɛsɛ gilagilagi zo é zoloo sɔgi ma, mazɔlɔɔ è zii ɠwɛɛ. Tɔɔzei ɗa ɠila kpe ka è nuiti kpein zii ɠwɛɛ. <verse eid="1KI 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 8:40"/>Ɗa naa ɠɛna, ta è lɛbi yeeɠɛɠalai pɛ daawu ta kɛ vulua zooi ná zu, è feai gi-mɛmɛwolani zea.<verse eid="1KI 8:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 8:41"/>«Ni wɛɛin ta a ɠɛna ná, é la ga ɗa-nuɓusɛiti Izilayɛle nuiti ti ta, tama é è-maawoo mɛnigai, é zeɠe ɠoozama you zu, é ʋa, <verse eid="1KI 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 8:42"/>mazɔlɔɔ wɛɛinti ta mɛni ga ɗa ga GALA golai, nii é sɛbɛi ɠulazu kɛlɛma, ni a ʋaana pɛlɛi nii ʋɔ pelei é maanɛɛnɛi wo, <verse eid="1KI 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 8:43"/>soma kae è gooɠaaʋote geeɠɔlɔgi zu, ʋɛ è zeini ná. Nii é falia è ma, naa ve zea, naa ɠa a kɛ etea nuɓusɛiti pɛ ti è ɠwɛɛ, ti lua è-ɠaazu ʋa, ga ɗa-nuɓusɛiti Izilayɛle ɠɛʋele, ta kwɛɛ ɓalaa ga pɛlɛi nii gè togai, ɗa ɠa ɗɔnɔ ʋe.<verse eid="1KI 8:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 8:44"/>«Siɛgi zu ɗa-nuɓusɛiti Izilayɛle nuiti ti liizu la kɔɔɠɔzuʋɛ, ʋɛ è ti leʋesu ná, ti zili nuiti daalɔɠɔma, ni ta è valina, ɗɛi è ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ti ɠaaʋotegai taai ta pɛlɛi nii ma gè togai ɗa-lɛbiyai vaa ma, <verse eid="1KI 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 8:45"/>ti woomɛni geeɠɔlɔgi zu, ta-ƓALA falii ta ta-maanɛɛnɛi ɠaaʋote, ti maalobo.<verse eid="1KI 8:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 8:46"/>«Siɛgi zu Izilayɛle nuiti ti kotoi ɠɛɛzu la è laalɔɠɔma, mazɔlɔɔ nu nɔpɛ ge la ná, nii é la koto ɠɛa, ni ɗa yiiɠaawanana, è ti lɔ ti zili nuiti zeezu, naati ti li ga tiye ɓuɠama ɓaa ɠoozama you zu, duɔlai zu, <verse eid="1KI 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 8:47"/>ni ta yɛna duɔla yooi naa zu, ti ʋa ɠima, ti ɠale ma è ʋɔ, ti è maanɛɛnɛ, ti ɠɛ è ma: ‹Gi kotoi ɠɛa, gi ziɛ ʋele ɲɔuɗa, gá ga sɔba nuiti,› <verse eid="1KI 8:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 8:48"/>ni ta ɠalena ma è ʋɔ ga ti-yii pɛ, ta ti-yɛnvui pɛ, ni ta yɛna ti zili nuiti ta-yooi zu, ʋɛ ti ná duɔlai zu, ti è maanɛɛnɛ, ti ɠaaʋotegai zooi naa ma è feai ti-ɠɛɛni zea, ta taai nii ma è yiimazeɠeai la, ta pɛlɛi nii ma gè togai ɗa-lɛbiyai vaa ma, <verse eid="1KI 8:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 8:49"/>ti woomɛni è-zeizuʋɛ geeɠɔlɔgi zu, ta-ƓALA fali ta ta-maanɛɛnɛi ɠaaʋote, è ti maalobo. <verse eid="1KI 8:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 8:50"/>Ɗa-nuɓusɛiti suvaayɛ ga kotoi ti kɛai è laalɔɠɔma, ta tɔ koloɠologiti kpein ti ti ɠɛai, va bu ti zili nuiti ti ti maawɔinɠa. <verse eid="1KI 8:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 8:51"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ta ga ɗa-nuɓusɛiti, ta ga ɗɔnɔi, é lɔɔzei ti ɠula yeei ma è ʋɛ Ezipete yooi ʋa, kɔlu ɠaawuun abuzulugi tɔna su.<verse eid="1KI 8:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 8:52"/>«Ɠaazuʋɛ zeɠe ma, è woilo gá-maanɛɛnɛi ma gi kɛɛzu, nà-o, ɗa-nuɓusɛi Izilayɛle nuiti-yo, siɛnɔpɛ su gi wooɠulazu la è ma. <verse eid="1KI 8:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 8:53"/>Mazɔlɔɔ, Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa ɠa è yiimazeɠea ga giye zɔɔma ziiti saama, ga gi ɠɛ ga ɗɔnɔ, eɠɛʋelei è puuni la ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui Moize la, é bo, siɛgi zu è gi-ɠɛɛni kulani la Ezipete yooi zu.»<verse eid="1KI 8:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tuyai Salomɔn tooni nuɓusɛiti bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="1KI 8:54"/>Salomɔn ɓegai ma ga naama ƓALA falii ta naama maanɛɛnɛiti bo, é wuzeɠeni ʋolu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɠakalaʋɛ, ʋɛ é ʋilɛni ná ɲiibiɠa, é yeelɛ geezu. <verse eid="1KI 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1KI 8:55"/>É wuzeɠeni ʋolu, é tuya loo Izilayɛle ʋɛbɛi ʋɛ ga woo wola, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="1KI 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="1KI 8:56"/>«Mamagi ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, tɛigi é dooɠogi veai ná-nuɓusɛiti Izilayɛle nuiti bɛ, eɠɛʋelei é minazeɠeni la, mazɔlɔɔ minazeɠe goo ʋagɔi kpein é puuni ná-botiɠɛ nui Moize laaʋɛ, tanɔpɛ ge la yɛni ʋoluzu, nii daa la zeelini. <verse eid="1KI 8:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1KI 8:57"/>Ada-ƓALAGI Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zoo é yɛ ade ʋa niizu, eɠɛʋelei é ɠɛni la ade-mɛmɛwolani ba, é mina ɠɛlɛ ade ʋa, é mina looɠo ɓɔsu ade ʋa. <verse eid="1KI 8:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1KI 8:58"/>Kɛlɛ é ade-yiiti tati ɓɔɠɔ ma, nii a kɛ ade ziɛ ga ziima ʋelei, ade ná-deveiti ta ná-kalagiti ta ná-tɔgiti so, niiti é ti veeni ade-mɛmɛwolani zea. <verse eid="1KI 8:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="1KI 8:59"/>Maanɛɛnɛ wooi niiti gè ti laazeeliai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma, naati ti yɛ kae ada-ƓALAGI, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠi su folo ʋɛɛ kpidi ʋa, é ná-botiɠɛ nui maalobo, ta é ná-nuɓusɛi Izilayɛle nuiti maalobo folo-o-folo. <verse eid="1KI 8:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="1KI 8:60"/>Naazu, etea nuɓusɛiti pɛ ta kwɛɛ ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠila kpe nɔ ɠa é ga GALA, é ɠula tɔun polu, taɠili ge la ná. <verse eid="1KI 8:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="1KI 8:61"/>Wa ma, wo-yiiti ti ɠili ada-ƓALAGI, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠila kpe nɔ ʋa, nii a kɛ wo ɠolo ná-tɔgiti ta ná-deveiti bɛ, eɠɛʋelei é ɠɛɛzu la za.»<verse eid="1KI 8:61"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zalaɠai niiti ti ɠulani Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 7:4-10">2 Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛi 7:4-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="1KI 8:62"/>Masagi Salomɔn ta Izilayɛle nuiti kpein ti ɠaalɛa ɠɛni de ba, ti zalaɠaiti kulani Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI lɛbi vaa ma. <verse eid="1KI 8:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="1KI 8:63"/>Salomɔn nikɛ waaʋuufelegɔ maazu felegɔ (22.000) ta baala waaungila waaʋuufelegɔ (120.000) ɠulani ga ziilɛi zalaɠai. Ʋele ɠana masagi ta Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti pɛ ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi laalaoni da. <verse eid="1KI 8:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="1KI 8:64"/>Naama voloi nɔ masagi Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ ma ɠoi ɠoozuʋɛ pɛ feeni GALA bɛ, mazɔlɔɔ zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ nii é ɠɛni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi ɠakalaʋɛ, kpɛtɛai ga kɔlu ɓɔigi, miná wola lɔini zalaɠaiti faa ma naama voloi, tɔ ɠa é kɛɛni Salomɔn koi ɠoozuʋɛ pɛ seɠeni, ga ti ɗa gala zalaɠaiti gala ná, ta vebɛ zalaɠaiti, naa ʋɛɛ ziilɛi zalaɠaiti ma wulɔiti ba.<verse eid="1KI 8:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="1KI 8:65"/>Naama ziɛgi nɔ zu Salomɔnni ta Izilayɛle nuiti pɛ ti fɛtii ɠulani. Bɛbɛ wolai ɠa é zeɠeni Izilayɛle yooi zu ná pɛ, é zo Leɓo-Ɠamate yooi zu, é zeeli Ezipete kɔtuɗɛi ma, ti ʋaani ti lo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu folo lɔfela laawu, naa ʋoluma ti folo lɔfela ɠili kɛ, ti pɛ kpɔga ɠɛ ga folo puugɔ maazu naanigɔ (14). <verse eid="1KI 8:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="1KI 8:66"/>Poluma zobui Salomɔn nuɓusɛiti gaaɠaleni ma. Ti tuya looni masagi ʋɛ, ti ɠale ma ta-ʋɛlɛiti bu ga koozunɛɛi, ti ɠoozunɛɛni tɔɔzei faanɛɛi kpein faa zu nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI kɛɛni ná-botiɠɛ nui Davide ʋɛ, ta ná-nuɓusɛi Izilayɛle ʋɛ.<verse eid="1KI 8:66"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1KI 9"/>
  <para style="s">Gooɠaaʋotegi Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI feeni <optbreak/> Salomɔn ya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 7:11-22">2 Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛi 7:11-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 9:1"/>Salomɔn ɓegai ma ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi lo, ta masa pɛlɛi, ta nii kpein é ɠɛni pɔ ga é to, <verse eid="1KI 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 9:2"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠulani bɛ kɛlɛma ná zeizu velesiɛi zu, eɠɛʋelei é ɠulani la bɛ kɛlɛma Gaɓaɠɔn. <verse eid="1KI 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 9:3"/>É ɠɛni ma: «Gè woiloga ɗa-ƓALA falii ta ɗa-maanɛɛnɛ wooi ma, nii è daazeeliai mà. Pɛlɛi nii è togai bɛ̀, gè kɛa ga ada ɲadegai, ʋɛ nà yɛ ná eyɛsu ɠɔ. Nà wɛlɛ ma yeenɔpɛ, ta zìi ɠa ɠɛ ná. <verse eid="1KI 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 9:4"/>Ɗa ma, ni ɗa ziɛna gàazu, eɠɛʋelei è-ɠɛɛ Davide ziɛni la ladalai ta sɔledai zu, è naati pɛ kɛ, niiti gè è levea ti ma, ni ɗa ɠolona nà-deveiti ta nà-tɔgiti bɛ, gè ti veai è ya, <verse eid="1KI 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 9:5"/>nà ɗa-masa kpɔkpɔgi zei kpɛ Izilayɛle unda eyɛsu ɠɔ, eɠɛʋelei gè minazeɠeni la è-ɠɛɛ Davide ʋɛ, siɛgi zu gè ɠɛɛni la ma: ‹Nu ɠa ɠɛ zɔlɔɔsu nɔ ɠɔ è-mavofodaiti saama, nii a ɠɛ zeizu Izilayɛle masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa.› <verse eid="1KI 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 9:6"/>Kɛlɛ ni wa ʋoluavena bà, wa wo-mavofodaiti, ni wo la ɠoloni nà-tɔgiti ta nà-deveiti bɛ, gè ti zeiɗai wo ma, ni wa liina, wo gala kiligaa lɛbi, wo nɔkɔ ti wu, <verse eid="1KI 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 9:7"/>nà Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti kula zooi naa ʋa, nii gè feai ti ya, pɛlɛi nii gè kɛai ga ada ɲadegai, dàaseigi yɛ fai zu ná, nà pili ya poun, é zeɠe gàazu, Izilayɛle ɠa ɠɛ ga ɲɛɛɠulasu ani ta bɛlɛlala ani etea nuɓusɛiti pɛ bɛ. <verse eid="1KI 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 9:8"/>Nuiti ta ɠɛna leʋega Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi nii ɠoba, koloɠologai, daa ɠa vɔ, é ɗa foei vɛ. Nuiti ta ɗa ɠɛ ɓɔɠɔ ɠaazaɠasu, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: ‹Leeni vaa zu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zooi nii ta pɛlɛi nii zogai ɠani?› <verse eid="1KI 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 9:9"/>Gooɠaaʋotegi ɠa ɠɛ ga: ‹Mazɔlɔɔ ti ɠɛlɛa ta-ƓALAGI, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa, nii é ti-mɛmɛwolani kulani Ezipete yooi ʋa, mazɔlɔɔ ti ʋilɛga gala kiligiti polu, ti nɔkɔ ti wu, ti ti lɛbi, naa ɠa é kɛai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI niima maanɔɠɔiti pɛ seiɗai la ti ma.› »<verse eid="1KI 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Salomɔn ná-boti wolaiti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 8:1-18">2 Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛi 8:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 9:10"/>Salomɔn kɛɛni ga kona ʋuufelegɔ (20) pɛlɛ felegɔiti to fai ma: Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi ta masa pɛlɛi. <verse eid="1KI 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 9:11"/>Tɛi Tiil masagi Yilame ɠa é sɛdele guluiti, ta sipɛlɛ guluiti, ta zanugiti feeni Salomɔn ʋɛ, eɠɛʋelei Salomɔn ɠɛni pɔ la, masagi Salomɔn ɓalaa taa wola ʋuufelegɔ (20) veeni Yilame ʋɛ, Galilé yooi zu. <verse eid="1KI 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 9:12"/>Yilame zeɠeni Tiil ga é taaiti ka, niiti Salomɔn ti veai bɛ. Kɛlɛ taai naati ti la ɠɛni ɛnɛkɛni. <verse eid="1KI 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 9:13"/>É ɠɛni ma: «Taai ma zii ɓɛgeleni ka è ti veai bɛ̀ ɠani, nɛ̀ɛɲɔɠɔi Salomɔn?» É ti laasei pɛɛni ga Kaɓule yooi (nii poluʋɛ ga «tosu la ba»), daaseigi naa ɠa é ti ʋa zaaɠaza. <verse eid="1KI 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 9:14"/>Kilo waasaʋagɔ undɔɔlugɔ (3.500) ɠa Yilame teʋeni Salomɔn ma zanugi zu.<verse eid="1KI 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 9:15"/>Masagi Salomɔn duɔla wotii zeini kpasu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi lo fai zu ta masa pɛlɛi, ta pɛtugi laave fai, nii daa ga Milo, naa ʋɛɛ Zeluzalɛme ziɠigi ʋa, ta Ɠasɔɔl, naa ʋolu Megido, é ʋɛɛ Gezɛɛl ʋa. <verse eid="1KI 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 9:16"/>Ezipete masagi Falaɠɔn liini Gezɛɛl zosu, é abui loni taai ʋa, é Kanaan nuiti paa, niiti ti ɠɛni zeini taai naa zu. É taai naa veeni ná-doun anzanui ʋɛ ga vulu ɠɛɛzu vaanɛɛi, siɛgi zu naa zeini la Salomɔn ʋɛ ga anza. <verse eid="1KI 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 9:17"/>Naa ɠa é kɛɛni Salomɔn taai naa loni ʋolu, é Ɓɛte-Ɠolon buu ʋelei loni ʋolu ɓalaa, <verse eid="1KI 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 9:18"/>é Ɓaalate ta Tamaal loni ɓalaa, teʋebai ma you zɛʋɛi ma, zooi zu. <verse eid="1KI 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 9:19"/>É taai naati kpein toni, ti ɠɛni bɛ ga ani makɛsuʋɛti, ta taai niiti ná-kɔɔɠɔ wotoloiti ti ɠɛni ti zu, naa ʋɛɛ ná-soo ɓizɛ zalaʋusuiti ɲiizu laaiti ba. Nii kpein é ɠɛni pɔ ga é to ga pɛlɛ, é ti loni Zeluzalɛme taazuʋɛ, ta Liɓan ɠizei ma, ta ʋɛ kpein é ɠɛni zeini naa unda.<verse eid="1KI 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 9:20"/>Zii ɠiligi tanigaa ti ɠɛni dɛ zooi zu naama ziɛgi zu: Amool nuiti, Ɠɛte nuiti, Felɛze nuiti, Ɠeve nuiti, ta Yeɓuse nuiti, ti tanɔpɛ ti la ɠɛni ga Izilayɛle nu, <verse eid="1KI 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 9:21"/>niiti ti-mavofodaiti ti yɛni zooi zu mazɔlɔɔ Izilayɛle nuiti ti la ɠɛni zooni ti ʋa ti zuwuɠaaleʋe, tiya ɠa Salomɔn duɔla wotii niiti daani ti ma, zaaɠaza naa ɠa ti daawu. <verse eid="1KI 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 9:22"/>Kɛlɛ Salomɔn la ɠɛni Izilayɛle nu nɔpɛ seɠeni ga duɔ, é ti ɠɛɛni ga salaʋusuiti, ta ná-botiɠɛ nu wolaiti, ta salaʋusu ɠundiɠiiti, ta ná-kɔɔɠuluɓaiti, naa ʋɛɛ kɔɔɠɔ wotolo ɓizɛ nuiti ta ná-soo ɓizɛ zalaʋusuiti ba. <verse eid="1KI 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 9:23"/>Nu undɔɔlugɔ puulɔɔlugɔ (550) ɠa Salomɔn toni ná-botiɠɛ nuiti untuɠɔ, niiti ti ɠɛni botii ɠɛɛzu.<verse eid="1KI 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 9:24"/>Siɛgi zu Falaɠɔn ná-doun anzanui ɠulani la Davide ná-taa wolai zu, é lati ná-pɛlɛ wolai wu nii Salomɔn toni bɛ, názu ɠa Salomɔn pɛtugi laaveni da, nii daa ga Milo.<verse eid="1KI 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 9:25"/>Salomɔn ɠɛni gala zalaɠaiti ta ziilɛi zalaɠaiti kulazu ná zeizu ɠɛ saʋa konagi zu, zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ é naa ɓɛtɛni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, é ɠɛni ansansegiti galazu zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ, nii é ɠɛni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu. Ʋele ɠana botii ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu la GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu.<verse eid="1KI 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 9:26"/>Masagi Salomɔn keingiti kpɛtɛni Ɛsiyon-Geeɓɛɛl, Elate ɠobaʋɛ, Seeli Kpoloɗɛi ɠa Edɔme yooi zu. <verse eid="1KI 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 9:27"/>Fenisi nuiti ti ga kpoloɗɛ ɠa wotiɠɛ nuiti, ta ti kpoloɗɛi ɠwɛɛ gola, Masagi Yilame naati teʋeni, ga ti ɓɔ Salomɔn ná-botiɠɛ nuiti ba. <verse eid="1KI 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 9:28"/>Ti liini Wofiil, ti ʋa ga zanugi, nii a la leʋe kilo waapuugɔ maazu felegɔ (12.000) ʋa.<verse eid="1KI 9:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1KI 10"/>
  <para style="s">Saɓa masa anzanui ʋaa vai laaliizu <optbreak/> Salomɔn ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 9:1-12">2 Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛi 9:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 10:1"/>É woni Saɓa yooi zu masa anzanui ma ga Salomɔn lɔɠɔ ʋagɔ zɔlɔɔgɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ya. É ʋaani Salomɔn ʋoluɠulazu ga gaazaɠa kpaaɓaagiti. <verse eid="1KI 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 10:2"/>Bɛbɛ wola yɛni polu, ti ʋa Zeluzalɛme, é ʋaani ga ɲɔmɛiti ti ɠasɔɠiliai ga tufa maku nɛɛnɛgiti, ta zanu mɔinmɔingiti, ta kɔtu zɔngɔ ɓaaɓaagiti. É kisu vai pɛ boni naa ma. <verse eid="1KI 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 10:3"/>Salomɔn ná-gaazaɠagiti pɛ gaaʋoteni, tanɔpɛ ge la ɠɛni ɓaani masagi ya, ta la yɛni ʋoluzu, nii é la ɠɛni zooga é ʋa gaaʋote. <verse eid="1KI 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 10:4"/>Saɓa masa anzanui Salomɔn ná-ɠimalai pɛ kaani, ta pɛlɛi é togai, <verse eid="1KI 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 10:5"/>é ná-daamianigiti ka, ta ná-botiɠɛ nu wolaiti ɲiizuʋɛti, ta ná-botiɠɛ nuiti tosuʋɛti, ta ti maaɠili zɔɔlaiti, ta niiti ti ɠɛni daamianigi ta dɔɔi veezu zea, é wɛlɛ, é gala zalaɠaiti ka, naa ɠɛni ti ɠulazu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi ma ɠoizuʋɛ. Naati kaai ma, daavɔɔni, zɛnvu maaleʋe.<verse eid="1KI 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 10:6"/>É ɠɛni masagi ma: «Nii kpein ti bogai mà nà-zooi zu, é lo è-laawooiti ta ɗa-ɠimalai ʋa, ti pɛ ka ga gaama. <verse eid="1KI 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 10:7"/>Gè ʋa ɠɛ gè zeeli ʋɛ, gè ka ga ɠaazu, gè la ɠɛa laani da, kɛlɛ ti la vɔlɔ ma lukpɛ ɓalaa boni mà, è ɓɛtɛʋɛ, ɠigi ɠɛ è ya gola, é leʋe naa ʋa, nii ti boga mà ɗa-lɔɠɔɠulagi zu. <verse eid="1KI 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 10:8"/>Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga ɗa-nuiti, ta ɗa-wotiɠɛ nu wolaiti, ti è ʋa folo-o-folo, ti ɗa tɔnɔ zɔlɔɔ ɗa-ɠimalai zu. <verse eid="1KI 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 10:9"/>Mamagi ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, ɗa-ƓALAGI nii é faaɓɔɠɔ ɠɛai è ʋɛ, ga é è zei Izilayɛle masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa. Ná-nɛɛbɛi nii é zii ma ɠɔ Izilayɛle ʋɛ, naa maaʋele ɠa é kɛa è zeiɗai ga masagi, nii a kɛ è sɔledai ta telebodai ɠɛ.» <verse eid="1KI 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 10:10"/>Naa ʋoluma, é zanugi kilo waasaʋagɔ undɔɔlugɔ (3.500) veeni masagi ʋɛ, ta é tufa maku nɛɛnɛgi ma mɔinmɔin feeni, ta kɔtu zɔngɔ ɓaaɓaagiti. Kaipa nu nɔpɛ ge la mɔ ɠɛni ʋaani ga tufa maku nɛɛnɛgi naa ma zii ta, é ʋa mɔin ga naa ɠɛʋele, Saɓa masa anzanui ʋaani la Salomɔn ʋɔ.<verse eid="1KI 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 10:11"/>Ɓatoi niiti ti ɠɛni ʋaazu ga zanugi, é zeɠezu Wofiil, naati ti ɠɛni ʋaazu ga santale gului ga mɔinɗa, ta kɔtu zɔngɔ ɓaaɓaagiti. <verse eid="1KI 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 10:12"/>Masagi santale gului naa tanigaa ɠɛni ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi ta masagi ná-pɛlɛi ma wuuzeigiti, é kɔnigiti ta papaiti kpɛtɛ ga ta guye loo nuiti bɛ. Santale gului ta la mɔ ɠɛni ʋaani pɛ, nu la mɔ ɠɛni ta ɠaani pɛ, eyɛsu za zeeli.<verse eid="1KI 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 10:13"/>Nii kpein wɔin ɠɛni Saɓa masa anzanui ma, ta nii kpein é falini masagi Salomɔn ma, naa ti pɛ feeni zea, naa ʋoluma é vebɛani ɠiligaa veeni bɛ, nii a zoo masa tɔɠɔɠulazu, eɠɛʋelei Salomɔn la. Masa anzanui ɠaleni ma ná-zooi zu, ta ná-botiɠɛ nuiti.<verse eid="1KI 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Salomɔn ná-kpɛtɛi zu aniiti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 1:14-17">2 Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛi 1:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:13-28">9:13-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 10:14"/>Kona-o-kona kilo waaʋuufelegɔ (20.000) ɠa Salomɔn ɠɛni sɔlɔɔsu zanugi zu, <verse eid="1KI 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 10:15"/>naa la ʋɛɛni sɛʋɛ zalaiti ba niiti ti ɠɛni ɠulazu zou ʋolu zɔɔlaiti ta yaaɠo zɔɔlaiti ma, naa ʋɛɛ mului ʋa nii zou ʋolu masagiti ta ná-zou zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠiiti ti ɠɛni feezu.<verse eid="1KI 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 10:16"/>Masagi Salomɔn kɔɔɠɔ zɛpɛ gola unfelegɔ (200) ɓɛtɛni ga zanu doɠaai, kilo lɔzita ɠa é dɔɔni ga zanugi ti ɠilagilagi pɛ kpɛtɛ vai zu, <verse eid="1KI 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 10:17"/>é kɔɔɠɔ zɛpɛ koiti unsaʋagɔ (300) ɓɛtɛ ga zanu doɠaai, kilo ɠila ta tukpɛ (1,5) ka é dɔɔni ga zanugi ti ɠilagilagi pɛ kpɛtɛ vai zu. Masagi ti pɛ daani pɛlɛi naa wu daa ga «Liɓan lɔɓɔi».<verse eid="1KI 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 10:18"/>Masagi masa kpɔkpɔ gola ɓɛtɛni ga see ɲiigai, é maaʋu ga zanu kitei. <verse eid="1KI 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 10:19"/>Kɔɠɔ losu lɔzita ɠa é ɠɛni nu laazeelizu masa kpɔkpɔgi naa ɠa, tiɓisui ɠiliɠilini, zeelokoi ɠɛ ba kakama felegɔiti, zalai ʋaaɠulaba felegɔ ɠɛ zeeloko felegɔiti koba, <verse eid="1KI 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 10:20"/>zalai ʋaaɠulaba puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12) ɠɛ kɔɠɔ losu lɔzitaiti su, kakama felegɔiti pɛ su. Kɛɠala nɔpɛ ge la dɛ ɓɛtɛni masadai tanɔpɛ bɛ.<verse eid="1KI 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 10:21"/>Masagi Salomɔn ná-ziawɔi pɛ ge ɠɛni ga zanugi, daami aniɲakai niiti kpein ti ɠɛni pɛlɛi wu daa ga «Liɓan lɔɓɔi», naati pɛ ti ɠɛni ga zanu kitei. Tanɔpɛ ge la ɠɛni ga walii, mazɔlɔɔ Salomɔn ná-siɛgi zu, nu la vɔlɔ ɠɛni walii levezu ga ani ɓii. <verse eid="1KI 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 10:22"/>Tɔɔzei ɓatoiti ti ɠɛni masagi ya ti ɗa leʋeteʋe kpoloɗɛi ɠa ta Yilame nɔnɔiti, kona saʋagɔ-o-kona saʋagɔ ɓatoiti ti ɠɛni ʋaazu ga zanugi ta walii, ta see ɲiigai, ta koyaiti, ta waso wɔniiti.<verse eid="1KI 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 10:23"/>Masagi Salomɔn leʋeni etea masagiti pɛ ba, kpɛtɛi ta ɠimalai zu. <verse eid="1KI 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 10:24"/>GALA ge ɠimalai wola veeni Salomɔn ya, naa maaʋele ma ɛsɛ pɛ ge ɠɛni ʋaazu ga ti goomɛni. <verse eid="1KI 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 10:25"/>Ɛsɛ ge ɗa ʋa ga vebɛaniiti pɔ, ga walii zɔɔlaiti ta zanu sɔɔlaiti, seɠeiti ta kɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlaiti, é tufa maku nɛɛnɛgiti feezu, ta sooiti, naa ʋɛɛ soovale fuuluiti ba. Ʋele ɠana é ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu la kona-o-kona.<verse eid="1KI 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 10:26"/>Wotolo waagila unnaanigɔ (1.400) ɠa é ɠɛni Salomɔn ya, ta soo ɓizɛ zalaʋusu waapuugɔ maazu felegɔ (12.000), é ti ɠaaɠwɛ taaiti su, ʋɛti ná-sooiti ti ɠɛni ná, ta Zeluzalɛme tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ɠobaʋɛ. <verse eid="1KI 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 10:27"/>Masagi zaalai zu, walii mɔinni Zeluzalɛme eɠɛ kɔtui, sɛdele gului mɔin eɠɛ sikɔmɔɔl gului, nii é ʋɔnɔsu ziɛlaʋɛ ma nɛmɛi zu. <verse eid="1KI 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 10:28"/>Ezipete ta Silisi ɠa Salomɔn ná-sooiti ti ɠɛni zeɠezu ná, masagi ná-yaaɠo ʋɛbɛi ɠɛni liizu ná, ti sooiti geya ga naama zɔngɔi nii deveai. <verse eid="1KI 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 10:29"/>Wotoloi ɠilagilagi kpein é ɠɛni zeɠezu Ezipete, sɔngɔi ɠɛni ga wali ɠae undɔzita (600), sooi ɠilagilagi zɔngɔi ɠɛ ga wali ɠae ungila puulɔɔlugɔ (150). Yaaɠo ɠilagi naati nɔ ɠa ti ɠɛni liizu ga wotoloiti ta sooiti Ɠɛte masagiti ta Siili masagiti pɔ.<verse eid="1KI 10:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1KI 11"/>
  <para style="s">Salomɔn ʋoluave fai ná-GALAGI ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 11:1"/>Salomɔn wɛɛn anzanu mɔinmɔin nɛɛni ʋɛ, é ɠula Falaɠɔn ná-doun anzanui ʋolu, tanigaa ti ɠɛni ga: Moaɓe nu, Amɔn nu, Edɔme nu, Sidɔn nu, ta Ɠɛte nuiti, <verse eid="1KI 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 11:2"/>ti ɠulani zii naati su, niiti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Izilayɛle nuiti ma ta-vaa zu: «À mina ɠili ti ʋa, ti mina ɠili wo ʋa, mazɔlɔɔ ta wo-yiiti tati ta-ɠalagiti pɔ pelei.» Naama ziiti ka Salomɔn gilini ti ʋa ga nɛɛbɛi. <verse eid="1KI 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 11:3"/>É masa doun undɔfela (700) vuluni, ti ɠɛ ga anzaiti, é anzanu unsaʋagɔ (300) ɠiligaa zei, niiti ti la vuluni ga zɔiti kɛʋele. Anzaiti ti zii latini. <verse eid="1KI 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 11:4"/>Salomɔn wɔlɔzaɠa siɛgi zu, anzaiti ti zii latini gala kiligiti ma, zii la mɔ ɠɛni ná-GALAGI Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠila nɔ ʋa, eɠɛʋelei kɛɛɠɛ Davide yii ɠɛni la. <verse eid="1KI 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 11:5"/>Salomɔn Asetaate lɛbini, Sidɔn nuiti ta-ɠalagi, é Milikɔme lɛbi, Amɔn nuiti ta-ɠɔzɔba ɠɔɔɠɔ gani. <verse eid="1KI 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 11:6"/>Salomɔn Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wanama vai ɠɛɛni, é la ziɛni ga naa yiima ʋelei pɛ, eɠɛʋelei kɛɛɠɛ Davide ziɛni la. <verse eid="1KI 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 11:7"/>Naama ziɛgi zu, Salomɔn zalaɠa ɠula adaʋɛ ɓɛtɛni gizei ma é Zeluzalɛme folo ɠulazu ʋelei, Kemɔse ʋɛ, Moaɓe nuiti ta-ɠɔzɔba ɠɔɔɠɔ gani, é ta ɓɛtɛ Mɔlɔke ʋɛ, Amɔn nuiti ta-ɠɔzɔba ɠɔɔɠɔ gani. <verse eid="1KI 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 11:8"/>Ʋele ɠana é kɛɛni la anzaiti kpein ta-ɠalagiti bɛ, wɛɛn anzanui niiti ti ɠɛni zea, nii a kɛ naati ti ɗa zalaɠaiti kula ga ansansegiti ta toganiiti.<verse eid="1KI 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 11:9"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI yiiɠaawanani Salomɔn ma, mazɔlɔɔ é ʋoluaveni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa, nii é ɠulani ba ga seizu felegɔ. <verse eid="1KI 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 11:10"/>Naama ge devei veeni zea, é lo niima vai ga é mina gala kili dɛbi, kɛlɛ Salomɔn la ɠɛni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-deveiti soni. <verse eid="1KI 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 11:11"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Salomɔn ma: «Tɛi ʋele ɠana è ziɛzu la, è la nà-minazeɠegi ta nà-deveiti makɛni, niiti gè ti veeni è ya, nà masadai ɠulazu è ya, gè fe naa ya, nii é è yeeɠɔɠɔwu. <verse eid="1KI 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 11:12"/>Kɛlɛ gè la naa ɠɛɛzu siɛgi zu è vulua la dɛ, è-ɠɛɛ Davide maaʋele ma. È-loun zunui ɠa gè ʋaazu masadai ɠulazu zeezu. <verse eid="1KI 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 11:13"/>Gè la ɓalaa masadai pɛ kulazu zeezu, nà boloda ɠila zɛsu è-loun zunui ya, nà-botiɠɛ nui Davide maaʋele ma, ta Zeluzalɛme, ʋɛ gè yiimazeɠeai ga ná.»<verse eid="1KI 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Salomɔn ziliɲɔɠɔiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 11:14"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI Salomɔn zakpeɲɔɠɔ ɠila buzeɠeni, Edɔme nui Ɠadade, é ɠɛni ga masa pɛlɛi wu nui ta. <verse eid="1KI 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 11:15"/>Siɛgi zu Davide kɔɔi ʋɛɛni la Edɔme yooi ʋa, ná-kɔɔɠuluɓai Zoaɓe lɛɛni ná poomaiti maaɠuluzu, názu ɠa é Edɔme zunuiti pɛ paani la ti ɠɛni Edɔme, <verse eid="1KI 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 11:16"/>é yɛni ná alu dɔzita laawu ta Izilayɛle ɠɔɔʋɛbɛiti pɛ, eyɛsu ti zunuiti pɛ pa. <verse eid="1KI 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 11:17"/>Názu ɠa Ɠadade ʋelani la, ti li Ezipete ta Edɔme nuiti, niiti ti ɠɛni ga kɛɛɠɛ ná-botiɠɛ nuiti. Naama ziɛgi zu Ɠadade ɠɛni dɛ ga zunu loungo. <verse eid="1KI 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 11:18"/>Ti zeɠeai ma Madiyan, ti zeelini Palan, ti Palan nuiti seɠe ya, ti zeeli Ezipete, Ezipete masagi Falaɠɔn ʋɔ bɛ. Falaɠɔn pɛlɛ ta zou veeni Ɠadade ʋɛ, é ɗa kɔnɔkula. <verse eid="1KI 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 11:19"/>Ɠadade undaanɛɛ zɔlɔɔni Falaɠɔn ya, eyɛsu Falaɠɔn ná-nimɔɠɔi ve bɛ ga anza, masagi anzai Taapanɛse ná-seelai. <verse eid="1KI 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 11:20"/>Taapanɛse ná-seelai doun zunu ɠila sɔlɔɔni Ɠadade ʋɛ, é daasei pɛɛ ga Genuɓate. Taapanɛse doungoi naa ɠulani su Falaɠɔn ná-pɛlɛi wu, Falaɠɔn ná-dointi saama.<verse eid="1KI 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 11:21"/>Siɛgi zu Ɠadade yɛni da Ezipete, é mɛni ga Davide zaa, ná-kɔɔɠuluɓai Zoaɓe ɓalaa ge zaa, é ɠɛni Falaɠɔn ma: «Ɓena bà, gè ɠale ma nà-zooi zu.» <verse eid="1KI 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 11:22"/>Falaɠɔn gaazaɠani, é ɠɛ ma: «Leeni ɠa è ʋalagai ma kòbaʋɛ? Toɠa ɠale è pɔ ga è ɠale ma ɗa-yooi zu?» É naa wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Gè la ʋalani ani nɔpɛ ma, kɛlɛ ɓɛ gè li.»<verse eid="1KI 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 11:23"/>GALA ge Salomɔn zakpeɲɔɠɔi taɠili buzeɠeni, Eliada ná-doun zunui Lezon, é ʋelani, é zeɠe Ɠadadezɛɛl ʋɔ bɛ, Soɓa masagi. <verse eid="1KI 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 11:24"/>É nui tanigaa ɠaalɛɛni ba ɠoba, siɛgi zu Davide Ɠadadezɛɛl ná-kɔɔʋɛbɛiti paa la, naazu é ɓɔɠɔ ɠɛni ga kɔɔɓɔ kundiɠi, ti liini, ti zei Damase, é ɗa masadai ɠɛ miná. <verse eid="1KI 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 11:25"/>É ɠɛni ga Izilayɛle ziliɲɔɠɔ Salomɔn zii ma voloi pɛ su, naama vaa ɲɔi kpein koba, nii Ɠadade ɠɛni kɛɛzu la, é zilini ga Izilayɛle, é ɗa masadai ɠɛ Siili yooi unda.<verse eid="1KI 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zeloɓoame ɓaka fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 11:26"/>Zeloɓoame ɠɛni ga Neɓate ná-doun zunui, Efelayime nui nii ná-taazuʋɛ ɠɛni ga Seleda, dee ɠɛni ga poanzai ta, daa ga Selua. Zeloɓoame ɠɛni ga Salomɔn ná-botiɠɛ nu wolai ta. Tɔ ɓalaa é wuzeɠeni masagi laalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="1KI 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 11:27"/>Pɛtɛ ʋelei é wuzeɠeni la naa laalɔɠɔma. Salomɔn ɠɛai ma pɛtugi laave fai ma nii daa ga Milo, ta é zeɠei laaɠulu, nii é ɠɛni siɠigi ʋa kɛɛɠɛ Davide ná-taa wolai ma. <verse eid="1KI 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 11:28"/>Zeloɓoame ɠa gaaɓaa nu. Salomɔn kaai ma ga toɠa botii ɠɛɛzu ga pagɔ, é toni Zozɛfe ná-pɛlɛyeɠei wu ɠasɔ zeɠe nuiti pɛ unda.<verse eid="1KI 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 11:29"/>Naama ziɛgi zu Zeloɓoame ɠulaai ma Zeluzalɛme ʋa, ti ɠomini pelei zu ta GALA goo wo nui Ayiya, Silo nui, seɠe niinɛi kɔba. Ti nu felegɔ nɔ ɠa ti ɠɛni dɔɓɔi zu. <verse eid="1KI 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 11:30"/>Ayiya ná-seɠe niinɛi ɠulani ɠɔba, é baliʋali su ga puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12). <verse eid="1KI 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 11:31"/>É ɠɛni Zeloɓoame ma: «Puugɔi zeɠe ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ, mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹Pɛtɛ, nà ʋaazu masadai ɠulazu Salomɔn ya, gè boloda puugɔi ve è ʋɛ. <verse eid="1KI 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 11:32"/>Kɛlɛ boloda ɠila ka yɛsu zea nà-botiɠɛ nui Davide maaʋele ma, ta Zeluzalɛme, taai nii gè yiimazeɠeai la Izilayɛle wolodaiti kpein saama. <verse eid="1KI 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 11:33"/>Nà naa ɠɛɛzu tɔɔzei ti ʋoluavega nɔ̀un ba, ti nɔkɔ Sidɔn nuiti ta-ɠalagi Asetaate wu, ti nɔkɔ ɓalaa Moaɓe nuiti ta-ɠalagi Kemɔse wu, ta Amɔn nuiti ta-ɠalagi Milikɔme wu, naa ʋoluma ti la kɛɛni ti ʋa ziɛ ga zìimai, ti la zìima vaa ɠɛɛni, ti la nà-deveiti ta nà-tɔgiti soni, Salomɔn kɛɛɠɛ Davide ɠɛʋele. <verse eid="1KI 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 11:34"/>Gè la masadai pɛ kulazu zea, mazɔlɔɔ nà seɠezu ga masagi sii ma voloi pɛ su, nà-botiɠɛ nui Davide maaʋele ma, nii gè yiimazeɠeai la, ta é nà-deveiti ta nà-tɔgiti sogai. <verse eid="1KI 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 11:35"/>Kɛlɛ nà masadai ɠulazu ná-doun zunui yeezu, gè boloda puugɔ ve è ya, <verse eid="1KI 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 11:36"/>nà boloda ɠila zɛsu zea, naa ɠa a kɛ nà-botiɠɛ nui Davide mina ʋala mavofoda ma, nii a ɠɛ masadai ɠɛɛzu nɔ̀un gaazu Zeluzalɛme taazuʋɛ, ʋɛ gè yiimazeɠeai ga ná ga gè dàaseigi ʋɛɛ ná ʋa. <verse eid="1KI 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 11:37"/>Nà è zeɠezu, è masadai ɠɛ naa kpein unda, nii a nɛɛ è-yii ʋɛ, ɗa ɠɛ ga Izilayɛle masagi. <verse eid="1KI 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 11:38"/>Ni ɗa woilona nii kpein ma gè è levezu ma, ɗa ziɛna ga zìimai, nii pagai gàazu, ɗa naa ɠɛna, è nà-deveiti ta nà-tɔgiti so, eɠɛʋelei nà-botiɠɛ nui Davide kɛai la, nà yɛ è ʋa, gè masa pɛlɛyeɠe lo è ʋɛ, nii é la ɲiikpiga eyɛsu pɛ, eɠɛʋelei gè ta logai la Davide ʋɛ, nà Izilayɛle ve è ʋɛ. <verse eid="1KI 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 11:39"/>Nà Davide mavofodaiti unmaayeizu ga naa, kɛlɛ naa lɛi é ʋa ɠɛ yɛsu ma ɠɔ.› »<verse eid="1KI 11:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 11:40"/>Salomɔn ɠɛni pɔ ga é Zeloɓoame ʋaa, kɛlɛ Zeloɓoame ʋelani, é li Ezipete, masagi Sisake ɠoba, é yɛni Ezipete eyɛsu Salomɔn za.<verse eid="1KI 11:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Salomɔn ná-masadai ɠaaɓela pelei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 9:29-31">2 Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛi 9:29-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 11:41"/>Salomɔn ná-kɛɛwotii mɔtaiti, ta nii kpein é kɛɛni, ta ná-ɠimalai, naati sɛʋɛʋɛ Salomɔn ná-kɛɛwotiiti ma zɛʋɛi zu. <verse eid="1KI 11:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 11:42"/>Salomɔn kɛɛni masadai zu Zeluzalɛme ta Izilayɛle pɛ unda ga kona ʋuunaanigɔ (40). <verse eid="1KI 11:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 11:43"/>Naa ʋoluma, Salomɔn zaani. Ti maaɠuluni kɛɛɠɛ Davide ná-taa wolai zu. Ná-doun zunui Loɓoame ɠa é masadai ɠɛɛni potogi zu.<verse eid="1KI 11:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1KI 12"/>
  <para style="ms1">Zuda ta Izilayɛle Masagiti, É Lɔɔzei Balimai Ma, Eyɛsu Izilayɛle Masadai Ɓe</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="1KI 12:1-22:54">12:1—22:54</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">Balimai: Zuda masagi Loɓoame <optbreak/> ta Izilayɛle masagi Zeloɓoame</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 10:1-15">2 Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛi 10:1-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 12:1"/>Loɓoame liini Sikɛme, mazɔlɔɔ Izilayɛle nuiti pɛ ti ɠaalɛɛni ba ná ga ti sei ga masagi. <verse eid="1KI 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 12:2"/>Neɓate ná-doun zunui Zeloɓoame ɠɛni dɛ Ezipete, ʋɛ é ʋelani ná, é lɔɔɠu Salomɔn ʋa, É niima maaɓɔgi ma woo mɛnigai ma, é deveni ga é yɛ Ezipete. <verse eid="1KI 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 12:3"/>Ti numaa leʋeni daaɠomisu, Zeloɓoame ʋaani naazu, tɔ-o, Izilayɛle nuiti-yo, ti ɓɔɛni Loɓoame ʋɔ ɠani: <verse eid="1KI 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 12:4"/>«È-ɠɛɛ gi unma ɠasɔi wola wuiɗa, ɗɔun ta ɠulana duɔla ɠasɔi naa ná-buii ma, nii è-ɠɛɛ daai gi unma, gá botii ɠɛ è ʋɛ.» <verse eid="1KI 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 12:5"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «À li, wa ɠale ma ʋolu, wo ʋa pɔ̀ bɛ folo saʋagɔ ʋoluma.» Nuɓusɛi liini.<verse eid="1KI 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 12:6"/>Masagi Loɓoame kɛwolaiti gaazaɠani, niiti ti ɠɛni kɛɛɠɛ Salomɔn lɛnɛsu, kɛai ma vulua, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Tɛnɛ kpɛgele ɠa wo feezu, gè nuɓusɛi wooɠaaʋote da?» <verse eid="1KI 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 12:7"/>Naati ti gooɠaaʋoteni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Ni ɗa dɛɛ za ga è ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛʋɛ ga è botii ɠɛ nuɓusɛi ʋɛ, ni ɗa ti wooɠaaʋotena ga woo ʋagɔiti, ta ɠɛɛzu ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nuiti eyɛsu ɠɔ.»<verse eid="1KI 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 12:8"/>Kɛlɛ Loɓoame la ɠɛni kɛwolaiti ta-lɛnɛgi zoni, nii ti feeni zea. É zinipoiti gaazaɠani, niiti ti ɠɛni loni koba, ta niiti ti ɓaɠoni ʋɔɔma. <verse eid="1KI 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 12:9"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «Tɛnɛ kpɛgele ɠa wo feezu, gè nuɓusɛi wooɠaaʋote da, é ɠɛɛzu mà: ‹Ta ɠula kasɔi nii ná-buii ma, nii è-ɠɛɛ daai gi unma›?» <verse eid="1KI 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 12:10"/>Kɛɠala zunu loungoiti ti ɠɛni ma: «Nuɓusɛi niiti ti ɠɛ: ‹È-ɠɛɛ kasɔ wuii daa gi unma, naa maaʋele ma è ta ɠula ma,› ɗa ti wooɠaaʋote ɠani: ‹Zèeɓeɠa goi wɔɔlɔʋɛ kɛ̀ɛ zaamalɔkaeiti ba. <verse eid="1KI 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 12:11"/>Kɛ̀ɛ kasɔ wuigi laaʋɛ wo unma, nɔ̀un nà ta ʋɛɛzu ná-buii ʋa. Kɛ̀ɛ ɠɛa wo ʋolu ga kpakɔi, nɔ̀un nà ʋilɛsu wo ʋolu ga kpakɔi nii maayikiai.› »<verse eid="1KI 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 12:12"/>Foloi zaʋasiɛi Zeloɓoame ta nuɓusɛi pɛ ti ʋaani, ti Loɓoame ɠa, eɠɛʋelei é boni la ti ma. <verse eid="1KI 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 12:13"/>Masagi la ɠɛni ziɛni ga kɛwolaiti ta-lɛnɛgi, é ɓɔɛni nuɓusɛi ʋɔ ga ɲɔuɗa, <verse eid="1KI 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 12:14"/>eɠɛʋelei nɔ bɔɔla zunu loungoiti ti tɛnɛni la, é ɠɛni ma: «Kɛ̀ɛ kasɔ wuigi laaʋɛ wo unma, nɔ̀un nà ta ʋɛɛzu ná-buii ʋa. Kɛ̀ɛ ɠɛa wo ʋolu ga kpakɔi, nɔ̀un nà ʋilɛsu wo ʋolu ga kpakɔi nii maayikiai.» <verse eid="1KI 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 12:15"/>Ʋele ɠana masagi ɠɛlɛni la nuɓusɛi wooi ʋa, mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɠɔi ɠa é loni faiti tuɠɔ ɠana, nii a kɛ é ná-minazeɠegi laazeeli, nii é kɛɛni Neɓate ná-doun zunui Zeloɓoame ʋɛ, é ɠula GALA goo wo nui Ayiya la, Silo nui.<verse eid="1KI 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Masadai ɠaaɠwɛ vai su fele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 10:16-11:4">2 Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛi 10:16—11:4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 12:16"/>Siɛgi zu lɛkpɛma maazu ʋele nuiti ti kaani la ga masagi la woilosu ti-woo ma, ti ɠɛni ma: «Lee ɠili ka ade ɓɔgai ma, ada Davide? Ade la ɓɔni pogani ma, ada Izayi ná-doun zunui. Ade ɠale ma ada-laazuʋɛti. Ɗɛi ma è ga Davide mavofodai, ɠaaɓa ɗa-ʋɛlɛi ma.» Nuɓusɛi zeɠeni koba, ti li. <verse eid="1KI 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 12:17"/>Loɓoame masadai ɠɛɛni nuɓusɛiti unda, niiti ti ɠɛni zeini Zuda laa wolaiti nɔ zu.<verse eid="1KI 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 12:18"/>Naa pɛ poluma, é Adolame leʋeni, nii é ɠɛni duɔla wotii unda, naa li Izilayɛle nuiti pɔ bɛ, ti lɛkpɛma maazu ʋelei. Kɛlɛ naati ti sɔɔni ga kɔtui, é za. Masagi ɓɔɠɔi zooni nɔ, é lɛ ná-soo wotoloi zu, é ʋela, é li Zeluzalɛme. <verse eid="1KI 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 12:19"/>Ʋele ɠana Izilayɛle nui niiti ti ɠɛni lɛkpɛma maazu ʋelei ti ɠɛlɛni la Davide ná-pɛlɛyeɠei ná-masadai ʋa, eyɛsu za zeeli.<verse eid="1KI 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 12:20"/>Siɛgi zu ti pɛ ti suɠwɛɛni la ga Zeloɓoame ɠalega ma, ti ɓɔɠɔ ɠaalɛba ɠɛɛni, ti toli ná, ti sei ga Izilayɛle masagi. Zuda wolodai ɠila nɔ ɠa é yɛni Davide ná-pɛlɛyeɠei ʋa.<verse eid="1KI 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 12:21"/>Loɓoame zeelini nɔ feya Zeluzalɛme, é kɔɔɠɔ nu waaungila waaʋuulɔsaʋa (180.000) ɠaalɛɛni ba Zuda ta Ɓɛnzamɛn wolodamaiti saama, niiti ti zoogai gola, ga ti li, ti kɔɔi ʋɛɛ Izilayɛle nuiti ba, ti lɛkpɛma maazu ʋelei, nii a kɛ é zei naati unda ga maaɓaai, tɛigi é ga Salomɔn ná-doun zunui. <verse eid="1KI 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 12:22"/>Kɛlɛ GALA ge ɓɔɛni GALA goo wo nui Semaya ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="1KI 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 12:23"/>«Ɓɔɛ Salomɔn ná-doun zunui Loɓoame ʋɔ, Zuda masagi, ta Zuda ta Ɓɛnzamɛn ma wolodamaiti su nuiti pɛ pɔ, naa ʋɛɛ nuɓusɛi mɔtai pɛ ba, è ɠɛ ti ma: <verse eid="1KI 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 12:24"/>‹Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: À mina lɛ, wo ʋa vala wo-ɠɛɛlointi ba, Izilayɛle nuiti ti lɛkpɛma maazu ʋelei. Wo ɠilagilagi pɛ ge ɠale ma ná-pɛlɛi wu, mazɔlɔɔ nà ɠa niima vaiti seɠeai pɔ̀.› » Ti ɠoloni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ʋɛ. Ti ɠaleni ma, ʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI boni la ti ma.<verse eid="1KI 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zeloɓoame ná-kotoi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 12:25"/>Zeloɓoame siɠigi loni Sikɛme taai ma, Efelayime ɠize yooi zu, é zei ná. É zeɠeni miná, é siɠigi lo Penuwele taai ma.<verse eid="1KI 12:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 12:26"/>Zeloɓoame ɠisiɛni, é ɠɛ ma: «Masadai ɠa dɛ a ɠɛ ga Davide ná-pɛlɛyeɠei nɔnɔ. <verse eid="1KI 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 12:27"/>Ni nuɓusɛi niiti ta lɛɛzu Zeluzalɛme, zalaɠa ɠula vai ma Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi ma ɠoizuʋɛ, ti-yii ɠa lati ti-maliɠii Loɓoame ma ʋolu, Zuda masagi, ta nɔ̀un paa, ti ɠale ma ʋolu Zuda masagi Loɓoame ʋɔ.»<verse eid="1KI 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 12:28"/>Masagi ɠobaɠaazaɠani, é nikɛ yiʋoi ʋaaɠulaba felegɔ ɓɛtɛ ga zanugi, é ɠɛ nuɓusɛiti ma: «Wo wola ziaa Zeluzalɛme. Izilayɛle nuiti, à wɛlɛ wa-ɠalagiti ba, ti wo ɠulaai Ezipete yooi ʋa.» <verse eid="1KI 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 12:29"/>É ta ʋilɛni Ɓetɛle, é zɔi ʋilɛ Dan. <verse eid="1KI 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 12:30"/>É nuɓusɛiti diini ɠana kotoi ɠɛɛ vai ma, nuɓusɛi ʋilɛni nikɛi ʋaaɠulabai ɠilagi ʋolu, ti zeeli Dan. <verse eid="1KI 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 12:31"/>Zeloɓoame kɔɔɠɔ gani kɔɔ ʋɛlɛiti toni zalaɠa ɠula adaʋɛti koba, é zalaɠa ɠula nuiti sei, niiti ti ɠɛni nuɓusɛiti saama, ti la ga Levi mavofodai zu nui ta. <verse eid="1KI 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 12:32"/>Zeloɓoame fɛti voloi ma ɠui loni alugi lɔsaʋasiɛi ma volo puugɔ maazu lɔɔlugɔi (15) ma, eɠɛʋelei nɔ ti ɠɛni kɛɠala vɛtii ɠulazu la Zuda. Tɔ ɓɔɠɔi é zalaɠaiti kulani zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ. Pɛtɛ nii ɠa é kɛɛni Ɓetɛle, é zalaɠai ɠulani nikɛ yiʋoi ʋaaɠulabaiti bɛ niiti é ti ɓɛtɛni, zalaɠa ɠula nui niiti é yiimazeɠeni ga tiye, é naa tanigaa zei zalaɠa ɠula adaʋɛti koba. <verse eid="1KI 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 12:33"/>Alugi lɔsaʋasiɛi ma volo puugɔ maazu lɔɔlugɔi (15), kui nii tɔ ɓɔɠɔi é toni, Zeloɓoame fɛti ɠila daani ga Ɓetɛle ta Izilayɛle nuiti bɛ, fɛti naa ɠulazuʋɛ, tɔ ɓɔɠɔ ɠa é ansansegiti galani zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ, ʋɛ é ná ɓɛtɛni.<verse eid="1KI 12:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1KI 13"/>
  <para style="s">GALA goo wo nui ta ʋaa vai Ɓetɛle</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 13:1"/>GALA goo wo nui ta devei zɔlɔɔni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ya ga é zeɠe Zuda yooi zu, é li Ɓetɛle. É zeelini kpein nɔ, Zeloɓoame ɗa ansansegiti gala zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ. <verse eid="1KI 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 13:2"/>É Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laawooi nii woni zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ laalɔɠɔma, é ɠɛ ma: «Zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ! Zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ! Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹Zunu loun ɠa zɔlɔɔsu Davide ná-pɛlɛyeɠei wu, daaseigi ɠa ɠɛ ga Zoziase, nii é ʋaazu zalaɠa ɠula adaʋɛti ma zalaɠa ɠula nuiti kulazu ga zalaɠai è ma, niiti ti ansansegiti galazu è ma, ta nu ɠaeiti gala vɔlɔ è ma.› » <verse eid="1KI 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 13:3"/>Naama voloi nɔ é poogi veeni ti ya, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Wɛlɛ poogi ʋa nii é dɛɛzu ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa kpɔɛai: Zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɠa ʋaazu ʋalizu su, zuʋui nii é ʋuuni ga, naa ɠa vazasu.»<verse eid="1KI 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 13:4"/>Siɛgi zu masagi naama wooi mɛnini la, nii GALA goo wo nui boni zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ laalɔɠɔma nii é Ɓetɛle, é yeemaaleni, é ɠɛ ma: «À so!» Kɛlɛ zeei nii é maaleni GALA goo wo nui laalɔɠɔma, naa zaani ma, é la mɔ ɠɛni zooni é ʋa tɛ ba. <verse eid="1KI 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 13:5"/>Zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ʋalini su, zuʋui é ɠɛni ga, naa vazani, é zoloo poogi ma nii GALA goo wo nui feeni ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maaʋele. <verse eid="1KI 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 13:6"/>Masagi kpɔɛi zeɠeni, é ɠɛ GALA goo wo nui ma: «Ɗa-ƓALAGI, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maanɛɛnɛ bɛ̀, nii a kɛ gè zo gè zèei lɛ ba.» GALA goo wo nui Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maanɛɛnɛni, masagi zooni é zeei lɛ ba, é ʋilɛ kɛʋele wɔlɔmai zu.<verse eid="1KI 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 13:7"/>Masagi GALA goo wo nui lolini, é ɠɛ ma: «Ʋa, de li nà-pɛlɛi wu, de daami wo, naa ʋoluma nà faanɛɛ ɠɛ è ʋɛ niina.» <verse eid="1KI 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 13:8"/>Kɛlɛ GALA goo wo nui ɠɛni ma: «Anɛɛ ɓalaa ɗa ɗa-naavoloi ma ʋalisaamai pɛ feezu zèa, gè la liizu ɗa-ʋɛlɛi wu, gè la daamiani nɔpɛ mia, gè la ɓalaa ziɛ nɔpɛ kpɔlea. <verse eid="1KI 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 13:9"/>Mazɔlɔɔ gè niima levei zɔlɔɔgɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ya, é ɠɛ mà: ‹Mina daamii ta kpɔle wo, mina ɓalaa ɠale ma ga pelei nii è liai la.› » <verse eid="1KI 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 13:10"/>É liini ga pele ɠili, é la ɠɛni ɠaleni ma ga pelei nii é liini la Ɓetɛle.<verse eid="1KI 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA goo wo nui woozotalai ɠɛɛ vai <optbreak/> ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 13:11"/>Naama ziɛgi zu GALA goo wo nu wɔlɔzaɠagi ta ɠɛni Ɓetɛle. Ná-doun zunuiti ti naa kpein boni ma, nii pɛ GALA goo wo nui kɛɛni, nii seɠeai Zuda, é ʋa Ɓetɛle naama voloi, ta nii kpein é boni masagi ma. Ná-doun zunuiti ti naa pɛ suɠulaai ma ma. <verse eid="1KI 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 13:12"/>É ɠɛɛni ti ma: «Mini ʋele ɠa diai la?» Ná-doun zunuiti ti GALA goo wo nui lii ʋelei ɠaani, nii é zeɠeni Zuda. <verse eid="1KI 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 13:13"/>É ɠɛ ma: «À soovalegi maaɠili bɛ̀.» Ti soovalegi maaɠilini, é lɛ kɔma.<verse eid="1KI 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 13:14"/>É ʋilɛni GALA goo wo nui ʋolu, é li, é naa ɠa zeini sɛne gului ta wu, é ɠɛ naa ma: «Ɗa ɠa è ga GALA goo wo nui seɠeai Zuda?» Naa gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Eyei, nà ʋe de.» <verse eid="1KI 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 13:15"/>É ɠɛni ma naazu: «Ʋa, de li pɛlɛi wu, de daami wo.» <verse eid="1KI 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 13:16"/>Kɛlɛ GALA goo wo nui gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Gè la ɠalega ma è ʋɔ, gè ʋa lɛ ɗa-ʋɛlɛi wu. De la daamiani mia ʋɔɔma, de la ɓɔɔlea ʋɔɔma pɛ adaʋɛ tɛi, <verse eid="1KI 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 13:17"/>mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛɛʋɛ mà: ‹Mina daamii ta kpɔle wo ná, mina ɓalaa ɠale ma ga pelei nii è liai la.› »<verse eid="1KI 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 13:18"/>GALA goo wo nu ɠɛwolai ɠɛni ma: «Nà ɓalaa, nà ga GALA goo wo nui ta ga è ɠɛʋele. Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-geezuɠeelai gila teʋegɛ mà, é ɠɛ mà: ‹Li, è gaaɠale ma, wo ʋa ɗa-ʋɛlɛi wu, é laami, ta é ɓɔɔle.› » Zɛɛi ɠa é ɠɛni bosu naa ma. <verse eid="1KI 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 13:19"/>GALA goo wo nui ʋilɛni polu, ti ɠale ma, é daamii woni, é ɓɔɔle ná-pɛlɛi wu.<verse eid="1KI 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 13:20"/>Ti ɠɛai ma daamii wosu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni GALA goo wo kɛwolai ʋɔ, nii é gaaɠaleni ma. <verse eid="1KI 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 13:21"/>É ɓɔɛni GALA goo wo nui ʋɔ nii é ʋaani, é zeɠe Zuda, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹Tɛi è kololalai ɠɛa ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, è la tɔgi zoni nii ɗa-ƓALAGI Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI feai è ya, <verse eid="1KI 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 13:22"/>tɛi è ɠalega ma, è laami ta è ɓɔɔle naama adaʋɛ, ʋɛ kɛai è ma: Mina daamii ta kpɔle wo ná, è-ma ʋoomai la laa è-ɠɛɛni ta-ɠabaiti su.› »<verse eid="1KI 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 13:23"/>Ti ɓegai ma ga daamii wo, ti ɓɔɔle, GALA goo wo nui nii é gaaɠaleni ma, é naa ná-soovalegi maaɠilini. <verse eid="1KI 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 13:24"/>Naa ɗa li, é ɠulani zala ɠila ma pelei zu, naa paa, é ma ʋoomai yɛni laani pelei zu, soovalegiti ta zalai ti loni koba. <verse eid="1KI 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 13:25"/>Teʋe nuiti ti poomai naa ɠaani laani pelei zu, zalai loni koba. Ti liini, ti bo taazuʋɛ, ʋɛ GALA goo wo kɛwolai ná.<verse eid="1KI 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 13:26"/>GALA goo wo kɛwolai nii é gaaɠaleni ma naama wooi mɛnini, é ɠɛ ma: «GALA goo wo nui ʋe, nii é kololalai ɠɛai ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-devei, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI fea zalai ya, naa bali ga, é paa, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI boni la ma.» <verse eid="1KI 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 13:27"/>É ɠɛni ná-doun zunuiti ma: «À soovalegi maaɠili bɛ̀.» Ti soovalegi maaɠilini. <verse eid="1KI 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 13:28"/>É liini, é poomai ɠa pelei zu, soovalegiti ta zalai ti loni koba. Zalai la ɠɛni poomai miini, ta é la ɠɛni soovalegi ʋalini ga. <verse eid="1KI 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 13:29"/>GALA goo wo kɛwolai GALA goo wo nui ma ʋoomai wuzeɠeni, é da soovalegi ɠɔma, é ɠale ma la taazuʋɛ, nii a kɛ é ná-saa wɔlɔi wo, é maaɠulu. <verse eid="1KI 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 13:30"/>É naa laani tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ná-kabai zu, nuiti ti ɠɛni saa wɔlɔ wuyei loozu ma, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Maawɔin vaa ʋe, kɛ̀ɛloin zaa.»<verse eid="1KI 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 13:31"/>Maaɠulugi ɓegai ma, GALA goo wo kɛwolai ɠɛni ná-doun zunuiti ma: «Yeei gè zaazu la, à màaɠulu kabai nii nɔ zu, nii GALA goo wo nui maaɠulugai su, wa mà ʋoomai la ma ʋoomai ɠoba. <verse eid="1KI 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 13:32"/>Mazɔlɔɔ wooi nii é bogai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laaseigi zu Ɓetɛle zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ laalɔɠɔma, ta zalaɠa ɠula adaʋɛti ma ʋɛlɛiti kpein daalɔɠɔma ti Samali yooi zu, ma wooi zu vaiti daa ɠa zeeli.»<verse eid="1KI 13:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 13:33"/>Niima vai pɛ poluma, Zeloɓoame la ɠɛni valiboni, é ʋa zeɠe kɛɛwoti ɲɔiti polu. É ɠɛni ba nɔ, é ɗa nuiti seɠe nuɓusɛiti saama, é ti ɠɛ ga zalaɠa ɠula nuiti, zalaɠa ɠula adaʋɛti unda. Nu nɔpɛ nɔ ma wɔin a la ɠɛ naa ma, é ɠɛni naa zeizu ga ta. <verse eid="1KI 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 13:34"/>Naa ɠɛɛni ga kotoi ɠɛ zaɓui Zeloɓoame ná-pɛlɛyeɠei ʋɛ, naa ɠa é kɛɛni é ɠoloɠoloni, é ɲɛɛlɛ zooi ɠa.<verse eid="1KI 13:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1KI 14"/>
  <para style="s">Zeloɓoame ná-masadai ɓelagi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 14:1"/>Naama ziɛgi zu, Zeloɓoame ná-doun zunui Aɓiya zeeɓɛni. <verse eid="1KI 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 14:2"/>Zeloɓoame ɠɛni anzai ma: «Ʋote, nii a kɛ nu nɔpɛ ge mina kwɛɛ ga ànzai ɠa ga ɗe, li Silo. Miná ɠa GALA goo wo nui Ayiya ná, tɔ ɠa é dɛɛni ga ze ga nà ɠɛɛzu ga masagi nuɓusɛi niiti unda. <verse eid="1KI 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 14:3"/>Ɗa ɓulu puugɔ zeɠezu, ta ɓuluiti, naa ʋɛɛ kɔin gulɔ woole ɠila ba, ɗa zeelina pɔ bɛ, toɠa naa wo è ma, nii é ɠɛɛzu ga doungoi.»<verse eid="1KI 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 14:4"/>Ʋele ɠana Zeloɓoame anzai kɛɛni la. É liini Silo, é lɛ GALA goo wo nui Ayiya naa ná-pɛlɛi wu. Ayiya la mɔ ɠɛni wozaɠaazu, gaazuʋɛ maaɓidini niina ga pɔlɔzaɠagi. <verse eid="1KI 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 14:5"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Ayiya ma: «Zeloɓoame anzai ɠana, é ʋaazu è ʋɔ bɛ ga é è ɠaazaɠa ná-doun zunui vaa zu, mazɔlɔɔ naa la ɠɛdɛni, ɗa gooɠaaʋote ɠani ta nii. Siɛgi zu é ʋaazu la, toɠa ɓɔɠɔ ɠulazu ga nu ɠili.»<verse eid="1KI 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 14:6"/>Siɛgi zu Ayiya kɔɠɔ lugi mɛnini la, kɛai ma kpofalagi maaɓudɛzu, é ɠɛni ma: «Lɛ, Zeloɓoame anzai, lee vaa zu è ɓɔɠɔ ɠulazu ga nu ɠili? Tèʋegɛ ga gè ziizoolɛ ɠeela woo wo è ma. <verse eid="1KI 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 14:7"/>Li, è ɠɛ Zeloɓoame ma: ‹Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Gè è zeɠeʋɛ nuɓusɛiti saama, gè è ɠɛ ga masagi ná-nuɓusɛiti Izilayɛle nuiti unda. <verse eid="1KI 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 14:8"/>Gè masadai ɠulaʋɛ Davide ná-pɛlɛyeɠei ya, gè fe è ya. Kɛlɛ è la kɛɛni ga nà-botiɠɛ nui Davide ɠɛʋele, nii é nà-deveiti soni, ta é ɠili nɔ̀un ba ga zii pɛ, ga é naa nɔ ɠɛ nii pagai gàazu. <verse eid="1KI 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 14:9"/>È-ziɛ ʋele ɲɔuɗa, é leʋe naati kpein ba ti leʋegai è luɠɔ, è lia, è gala kiligaa ɓɛtɛ ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ, ta kɔɔɠɔ ganigiti, ga kɔlui puai, nii a kɛ è zìiɠaawana, é ʋoluave nɔ̀un ba. <verse eid="1KI 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 14:10"/>Naa ɠa é ba, nà maanɔɠɔi zeizu ɗa-ʋɛlɛyeɠei ma, gè zunuiti pɛ undaaʋili è-ʋaalobaiti saama, doungo ʋɛɛ kpakolo ba, gè ɗa-ʋɛlɛyeɠei ɓale ná tɛtɛ, eɠɛʋelei nu ɠa ɗa kaʋai ɓale da ga kpalegi. <verse eid="1KI 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 14:11"/>Ɗa-ʋɛlɛyeɠei wu nui nɔpɛ é zaazu taazuʋɛ, gilɛiti ka ta ma ʋoomai mi, zɔi ma é zaazu dɔɓɔi zu, wɔniiti ka ta naama ʋoomai mi. Naa ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI bogai.›<verse eid="1KI 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 14:12"/>«Ɗɛi ma è ga Zeloɓoame anzai, ɠale ma, è li ɗa-laazu, kɛlɛ ɗa lɛɛzu nɔ feya taazuʋɛ, doungoi za. <verse eid="1KI 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 14:13"/>Izilayɛle kpein ka ná-saa wɔlɔi wo. Tɔ ɠila kpe ka Zeloɓoame ná-pɛlɛyeɠei wu maaɠuluzu kabai zu, tɔɔzei tɔ ɠila kpe ka sɔ pagɔ ɠaai su, Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, Zeloɓoame ná-pɛlɛyeɠei wu. <verse eid="1KI 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 14:14"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa masa sei Izilayɛle unda naama voloi, nii a Zeloɓoame ná-pɛlɛyeɠei wu nuiti kpein undaaʋili. Naama voloi ɠa pele ma, é ɗa ʋa, é zeelia vɔlɔ. <verse eid="1KI 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 14:15"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa Izilayɛle nuiti doɠa, tɛiti ti ɠɛai eɠɛ seeligi é ziɛlaʋɛ, toɠa ti lɔɔɠula zou ʋagɔi naazu é feeni ti-ɠɛɛni bɛ, é ti vaza ziɛ wolai Efelate ʋoluʋele yooi zu. Naa ɠa ɠɛɛzu ga tiye mazɔlɔɔ ti sale wuluiti kpadɔa, nii a kɛ ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yiiɠaawana. <verse eid="1KI 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 14:16"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ʋaazu ɠɛlɛzu Izilayɛle ʋa, tɔɔzei kotoiti ba Zeloɓoame ti ɠɛai, ta niiti é nuɓusɛiti diai ti ɠɛɛ vai ma.»<verse eid="1KI 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 14:17"/>Zeloɓoame anzai wuzeɠeni, é ɠale ma Tiilesa. Kɛai ma kpofalagi maaɓudɛzu, é ʋa lɛ pɛlɛi wu, doungoi ɗa za. <verse eid="1KI 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 14:18"/>Ti maaɠuluni, Izilayɛle nuiti pɛ ti ná-saa wɔlɔi wo, eɠɛʋelei nɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI boni la, é ɠula ná-botiɠɛ nui, GALA goo wo nui Ayiya la.<verse eid="1KI 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 14:19"/>Zeloɓoame ná-kɛɛwotii mɔtaiti, ʋelei é kɔɔi ɠɔɔni la, ta ʋelei é masadai ɠɛɛni la, naati sɛʋɛʋɛ Izilayɛle masagiti ta-ɠɛɛwoti zɛʋɛi zu. <verse eid="1KI 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 14:20"/>É kɛɛni masadai zu ga kona ʋuufelegɔ maazu felegɔ (22). Zeloɓoame zaani. Ná-doun zunui Nadaɓe ɠa é masadai ɠɛɛni potogi zu.<verse eid="1KI 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zuda masagi Loɓoame</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 12:1-16">2 Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛi 12:1-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 14:21"/>Salomɔn ná-doun zunui Loɓoame masadai ɠɛɛni Zuda unda. Ná-konagi ɠɛni ga puunaani maazu ɠila (41), siɛgi zu é zeini la ga masagi. Kona puugɔ maazu lɔfela (17) ɠa é kɛɛni masadai zu Zeluzalɛme, taai nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yiimazeɠeni la Izilayɛle wolodamaiti pɛ saama, ga tɔɠɔi ʋɛɛ ná ʋa. Loɓoame dee laa ɠɛni ga Naama, Amɔn nu ɠɛni de. <verse eid="1KI 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 14:22"/>Zuda wolodamai zu nuiti ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wanama vai ɠɛɛni, ti ná-toloi wuzeɠe ga ta-ɠotoiti, é leʋe ti-ɠɛɛni tɔnɔi ʋa ti kɛɛni. <verse eid="1KI 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 14:23"/>Tiya ɓalaa ti zalaɠa ɠula adaʋɛti kpɛtɛni ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ, ti sale ɠɔtuiti ta sale wuluiti to gizeiti kpein ungaʋɛti, ta gulu wunduiti bu. <verse eid="1KI 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 14:24"/>Koloɠolo nuiti ti ɠɛ ti ya ta-zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛti, ti ɠɛni ʋokɔɠɔsu zii naati ta-ɠɔzɔba ɠɛɛwotiiti ma, niiti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ti ɓɛɛni Izilayɛle nuiti tuɠɔ.<verse eid="1KI 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 14:25"/>Loɓoame ná-konagi lɔɔlusiɛi ma masadai zu, Ezipete masagi Sisake lɛɛni Zeluzalɛme laalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="1KI 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 14:26"/>É Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi wu naavolo makɛsuʋɛ anii pɛ seɠeni ta masa pɛlɛi wu geleiti, é anii pɛ seɠeni. É lati, é zanu kɔɔɠɔ zɛpɛgiti pɛ seɠe, niiti Salomɔn ti ɓɛtɛni. <verse eid="1KI 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 14:27"/>Masagi Loɓoame naati maavalibogi ɠɛɛni ga kɔlu ɓɔi kɔɔɠɔ zɛpɛgiti, é ti ve salaʋusui niiti ti ɠɛni masa pɛlɛi laaʋɛ makɛsu, naati ta-ɠundiɠiiti zea. <verse eid="1KI 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 14:28"/>Masagi li laa ɠilagila Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi ma ɠoizuʋɛ, salaʋusuiti ti ɓena kɔɔɠɔ zɛpɛgiti seɠe, naa ʋoluma ti ɠale ma ga tiye, ti ti la ma ʋɛlɛi wu.<verse eid="1KI 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 14:29"/>Loɓoame ná-kɛɛwotii mɔtaiti, ta nii kpein é kɛɛni, naati sɛʋɛʋɛ Zuda masagiti ta-ɠɛɛwoti zɛʋɛi zu. <verse eid="1KI 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 14:30"/>Kɔɔi yɛni nɔ ɠɔ Loɓoameni zɔɠɔzu ta Zeloɓoame. <verse eid="1KI 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 14:31"/>Loɓoame zaani. Ti maaɠuluni mɛmɛwolani ta-ɠabamaʋɛ Davide ná-taa wolai zu. Loɓoame dee laa ɠɛni ga Naama, Amɔn nu ɠɛni de. Ná-doun zunui Aɓiyame ɠa é masadai ɠɛɛni potogi zu.<verse eid="1KI 14:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1KI 15"/>
  <para style="s">Zuda masagi Aɓiyame</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 13:1-3">2 Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛi 13:1-3</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 13:22-23">22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 15:1"/>Neɓate ná-doun zunui Zeloɓoame ná-kona puugɔ maazu lɔsaʋasiɛi (18) ma masadai zu Izilayɛle unda, Aɓiyame zeini Zuda unda ga masagi. <verse eid="1KI 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 15:2"/>Kona saʋagɔ ɠa é kɛɛni masadai zu Zeluzalɛme. Dee laa ɠɛni ga Maaka, Aɓisalɔme ná-doun anzanui ɠɛni de.<verse eid="1KI 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 15:3"/>Aɓiyame kotoi naati kɛɛni, niiti kɛɛɠɛ ti ɠɛɛni tɔun tuɠɔ, é la ɠɛni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI nɛɛni ʋɛ ga zii pɛ ga mɛmɛwola Davide ɠɛʋele. <verse eid="1KI 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 15:4"/>Kɛlɛ Davide maaʋele ma, ná-GALAGI, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI doun zunu ɠila feeni bɛ, naa ʋa zei potogi zu, nii a kɛ pɛlɛyeɠei ɠaa mina leʋe, ta Zeluzalɛme yɛ ga masa taa wolai. <verse eid="1KI 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 15:5"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Davide ziɛni telebodai zu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, é la kololala nɔpɛ kɛɛni ga naa, é ɠula Ɠɛte nui Ilii ná-fai ʋolu.<verse eid="1KI 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 15:6"/>Kɔɔi yɛni nɔ ɠɔ Loɓoameni zɔɠɔzu ta Zeloɓoame, sii ma voloi pɛ su. <verse eid="1KI 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 15:7"/>Aɓiyame ná-kɛɛwotii mɔtaiti, ta nii kpein é kɛɛni, naati sɛʋɛʋɛ Zuda masagiti ta-ɠɛɛwoti zɛʋɛi zu. Kɔɔi ɠɛni Aɓiyameni zɔɠɔzu ta Zeloɓoame. <verse eid="1KI 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 15:8"/>Aɓiyame zaani. Ti maaɠuluni Davide ná-taa wolai zu. Ná-doun zunui Aza ɠa é masadai ɠɛɛni potogi zu.<verse eid="1KI 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zuda masagi Aza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 14:1-2">2 Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛi 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 15:16-19">15:16-19</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 16:1-6">16:1-6</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 16:11-14">11-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 15:9"/>Zeloɓoame ná-kona ʋuufelesiɛi (20) ma masadai zu Izilayɛle unda, Aza zeini Zuda unda ga masagi. <verse eid="1KI 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 15:10"/>Kona ʋuunaanigɔ maazu ɠila (41) ɠa é kɛɛni masadai zu Zeluzalɛme. Deewola laa ɠɛni ga Maaka, Aɓisalɔme ná-doun anzanui ɠɛni de.<verse eid="1KI 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 15:11"/>Aza Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yiima vai ɠɛɛni, eɠɛʋelei nɔ mɛmɛwola Davide kɛɛni la. <verse eid="1KI 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 15:12"/>É koloɠolo nuiti kpein kulani zooi ʋa, niiti ti ɠɛni zalaɠa ɠula adaʋɛti, é kɔɔɠɔ ganigiti kpein koloɠolo, nii mɛmɛwolani ti ti ɓɛtɛni. <verse eid="1KI 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 15:13"/>É lɛbiya laaseigi zeɠeni deewola Maaka ʋa, nii é ɠɛni lolisu ga «Masa mama wolai», mazɔlɔɔ naa kɔɔɠɔ gani ɲɔi ta ɓɛtɛni anzanu ɠalagi Asela ʋɛ. Aza kɔɔɠɔ ganigi naa leʋeni ga, é gala Sedelɔn pɛtugi zu. <verse eid="1KI 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 15:14"/>Kɛlɛ anɛɛ Aza zii ma voloi pɛ su, é Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI nɛɛni ʋɛ ga zii pɛ, é la ɠɛni zalaɠa ɠula adaʋɛti kpeni. <verse eid="1KI 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 15:15"/>É ʋaani ga anii naati Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi ma ɠoizuʋɛ, niiti ta kɛɛɠɛ ti ti veeni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ: walii, zanugi, ta sɔɔla ɠiligiti.<verse eid="1KI 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 15:16"/>Kɔɔi ɠɛni nɔ Aza yɔɠɔzu ta Izilayɛle masagi Ɓaasa, ti-zii voloi pɛ daawu. <verse eid="1KI 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 15:17"/>Ɓaasa ʋaani yeeta, é kɔɔi ʋɛɛ Zuda yooi ʋa, é siɠigi lo Lama taa goi ma, nii a kɛ é pelei leʋe Zuda masagi Aza luɠɔ ta ná-zooi zu nuiti, ti mina ɗa ga lɔ, ti ʋa ɗa ɠula ga miná ʋele. <verse eid="1KI 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 15:18"/>Aza walii ta zanugi pɛ seɠeni, niiti ti ɠɛni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi ma naavolo makɛsuʋɛ, ta masagi ná-pɛlɛi wu, é ti ve ná-botiɠɛ nu wolaiti zea. Naa ʋoluma é ti leʋe Siili masagi Ɓɛne-Ɠadade ma, nii é ɠɛni zeini Damase, Taɓalimon ná-doun zunui, é ɠɛ mɔnɔ ga Ɠeziyon ná-dounloin, é ɠɛni naa ma, <verse eid="1KI 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 15:19"/>«De minazeɠe yɔɠɔzu, eɠɛʋelei de-ɠɛɛni felegɔ ti kɛɛni la. Pɛtɛ, gè walii ta zanugiti teʋega è ma. Li, è ɗa-minazeɠegi ɠoloɠolo nii é wo yɔɠɔzu wa Izilayɛle masagi Ɓaasa, nii a kɛ é zeɠe nà-zooi ma.»<verse eid="1KI 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 15:20"/>Ɓɛne-Ɠadade yeezeini masagi Aza ná-kpɔɛi wu, é ná-salaʋusu ɠundiɠiiti teʋeni, ti li ti kɔɔi ʋɛɛ Izilayɛle laa wolaiti ba. Ti tɔɔzeini Iyon, ti li Dan ta Aɓɛle-Ɓɛte-Maaka, ti Kinelɔte ɠoʋi zo, naa ʋɛɛ Nɛfɛtali yooi mɔtai pɛ ba. <verse eid="1KI 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 15:21"/>Ɓaasa naa mɛnigai ma, é looɠoni siɠigi lo fai ʋa Lama ma, é zeini Tiilesa. <verse eid="1KI 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 15:22"/>Masagi Aza ɠɛni Zuda nuiti kpein ma, kula ba la ba, ti kɔtuiti ta guluiti mɛɛn, niiti Ɓaasa ɠɛni botii ɠɛɛzu ga tiye Lama ziɠigi losuʋɛ. Masagi Aza ti zeɠeni, é siɠigi lo da Geɓa ta Misepa ma Ɓɛnzamɛn yooi zu.<verse eid="1KI 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 15:23"/>Aza ná-kɛɛwotii mɔtaiti, ta nii kpein é kɛɛni, ná-tɔɠɔɠula faiti, ta taai niiti é siɠigi loni ti ma, naati sɛʋɛʋɛ Zuda masagiti ta-ɠɛɛwoti zɛʋɛi zu. Pɔlɔzaɠa siɛgi zu kɔɠɔ wanai ɠa é soni. <verse eid="1KI 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 15:24"/>Aza zaani. Ti maaɠuluni mɛmɛwolani ta-ɠabamaʋɛ, mɛmɛwola Davide ná-taa wolai zu. Ná-doun zunui Zozafate ɠa é masadai ɠɛɛni potogi zu.<verse eid="1KI 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Izilayɛle masagi Nadaɓe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 15:25"/>Aza ná-kona felesiɛi ma masadai zu Zuda unda, Zeloɓoame ná-doun zunui Nadaɓe zeini Izilayɛle unda ga masagi. Kona felegɔ ɠa é kɛɛni masadai zu Izilayɛle unda. <verse eid="1KI 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 15:26"/>É Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wanama vai ɠɛɛni, é ziɛ ʋele ɲɔuni ga kɛɛɠɛ ɠɛʋele, nii é nuiti diini kotoi ɠɛɛ vai ma.<verse eid="1KI 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 15:27"/>Isakaal wolodamai zu nui daa ga Ayiya, naa ná-doun zunui Ɓaasa yaava ɠilini Nadaɓe ma, siɛgi zu Nadaɓe ta Izilayɛle ɠɔɔʋɛbɛi pɛ ti Filisiti nuiti ta-laa wolai Giɓeton zeini la kɛlɛ su. Ɓaasa masagi Nadaɓe ʋaani. <verse eid="1KI 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 15:28"/>Ɓaasa paani Zuda masagi Aza ná-konagi zaʋasiɛi ma masadai zu, é masadai ɠɛ potogi zu. <verse eid="1KI 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 15:29"/>É ɠɛɛni nɔ feya ga masagi, é Zeloɓoame ná-pɛlɛyeɠei wu nuiti pɛ paani, é la ɠɛni naa mavofodai zu nui gila kpalaa zɛni vulua, é ti zuwuɠaaleʋeni, eɠɛʋelei nɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI boni la, é ɠula Silo ƓALA goo wo nui Ayiya la. <verse eid="1KI 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 15:30"/>Naa kpein ge ɠɛɛni tɔɔzei kotoi ʋa Zeloɓoame kɛɛni, ta nii é nuɓusɛiti diini kɛɛ vai ma, naa ɠa é Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI yiiɠaawanani.<verse eid="1KI 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 15:31"/>Nadaɓe ná-kɛɛwotii mɔtaiti, ta nii kpein é kɛɛni, naati sɛʋɛʋɛ Izilayɛle masagiti ta-ɠɛɛwoti zɛʋɛi zu. <verse eid="1KI 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 15:32"/>Kɔɔi ɠɛni nɔ Aza yɔɠɔzu ta Izilayɛle masagi Ɓaasa ti-zii voloi pɛ daawu.<verse eid="1KI 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Izilayɛle masagi Ɓaasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 15:33"/>Aza ná-kona saʋasiɛi ma masadai zu Zuda unda, Ayiya ná-doun zunui Ɓaasa zeini Izilayɛle unda ga masagi Tiilesa. Kona ʋuufelegɔ maazu naanigɔ (24) ɠa é kɛɛni masadai zu. <verse eid="1KI 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 15:34"/>É Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wanama vai ɠɛɛni, é ziɛ ʋele ɲɔu ga Zeloɓoame ɠɛʋele, nii é Izilayɛle nuiti diini kotoi ɠɛɛ vai ma.<verse eid="1KI 15:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1KI 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 16:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni GALA goo wo nui Zewu ʋɔ, Ɠanani ná-doun zunui, ga é keela wooi nii laazeeli Ɓaasa ma: <verse eid="1KI 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 16:2"/>«Gè è zeɠeni fufiligi zu, gè è ɠɛ ga nà-nuɓusɛi Izilayɛle nuiti ta-lotuɠɔi, kɛlɛ è ʋilɛga Zeloɓoame ná-kɛʋelei ʋolu, è nà-nuɓusɛiti Izilayɛle nuiti dia kotoi ɠɛɛ vai ma, naa maaʋele ma, è nɔ̀un ziiɠaawana. <verse eid="1KI 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 16:3"/>Naa ɠa é ba, nà è ɓalesu ná, ɗa-o, ɗa-ʋɛlɛyeɠei-yo, nà wo zosu eɠɛʋelei gè Zeloɓoame ná-pɛlɛyeɠei zoni la, Neɓate ná-doun zunui. <verse eid="1KI 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 16:4"/>Ɓaasa ná-pɛlɛyeɠei wu, nui nɔpɛ é zaazu taazuʋɛ, gilɛiti ka ta ma ʋoomai mi, zɔi ma é zaazu dɔɓɔi zu, wɔniiti ka ta naama ʋoomai mi.»<verse eid="1KI 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 16:5"/>Ɓaasa ná-kɛɛwotii mɔtaiti, ta ná-tɔɠɔɠula faiti, naati sɛʋɛʋɛ Izilayɛle masagiti ta-ɠɛɛwoti zɛʋɛi zu. <verse eid="1KI 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 16:6"/>Ɓaasa zaani. Ti maaɠuluni Tiilesa. Ná-doun zunui Ela ɠa é masadai ɠɛɛni potogi zu. <verse eid="1KI 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 16:7"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Ɓaasa ta ná-pɛlɛyeɠei ʋɔ, é ɠula GALA goo wo nui Zewu la, Ɠanani ná-doun zunui, tɔɔzei faa felegɔ: mɔunpa, kotoi é kɛɛni, é Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yiiɠaawana ga ná-kɛɛwotiiti, eɠɛʋelei Zeloɓoame ta ná-pɛlɛyeɠei ti kɛɛni la, naa ʋoluma Ɓaasa Zeloɓoame mavofodaiti paa vai.<verse eid="1KI 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Izilayɛle masagi Ela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 16:8"/>Aza ná-kona ʋuufelegɔ maazu lɔzitai (26) ma masadai zu Zuda unda, Ɓaasa ná-doun zunui Ela zeini Izilayɛle unda ga masagi Tiilesa. Kona felegɔ ɠa é kɛɛni masadai zu. <verse eid="1KI 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 16:9"/>Ná-kɔɔɠuluɓai Zimili, nii é ɠɛni kɔɔɠɔ wotoloi ɠilazuʋɛ kpein unda, naa yaavai ɠilini ma. Siɛgi zu Ela ɠɛni la Tiilesa, Aalasa ná-pɛlɛi wu, masa pɛlɛi ma ɠundiɠii, é ɗa dɔɔi ɓɔle eɠɛ nui dɔɔi sogai, <verse eid="1KI 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 16:10"/>Zimili lɛɛni, é paa, é masadai ɠɛɛ naa ʋotogi zu. Naa ɠɛɛni Zuda masagi Aza ná-kona ʋuufelegɔ maazu lɔfelai (27) ma masadai zu.<verse eid="1KI 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 16:11"/>É ɠɛɛni nɔ feya ga masagi, é Ɓaasa ná-pɛlɛyeɠei pɛ undaaʋili, é la zunu ɠila kpalaa zɛni vulua doungo zu, ɓaa kpakolo su ná-pɛlɛwu nuiti saama, ta nui niiti ti ɠɛni polu. <verse eid="1KI 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 16:12"/>Ʋele ɠana Zimili Ɓaasa ná-pɛlɛyeɠei pɛ undaaʋilini la, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni la tɔun daalɔɠɔma, é ɠula GALA goo wo nui Zewu la. <verse eid="1KI 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 16:13"/>Naa pɛ ge ɠɛɛni tɔɔzei Ɓaasa ta ná-doun zunui Ela ta-ɠotoiti ba ti ti ɠɛɛni, ta niiti ti Izilayɛle nuiti diini kɛɛ vai ma, ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI yiiɠaawana ga ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ ganigiti.<verse eid="1KI 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 16:14"/>Ela ná-kɛɛwotii mɔtaiti, ta nii kpein é kɛɛni, naati sɛʋɛʋɛ Izilayɛle masagiti ta-ɠɛɛwoti zɛʋɛi zu.<verse eid="1KI 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Izilayɛle masagi Zimili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 16:15"/>Aza ná-kona ʋuufelegɔ maazu lɔfelai (27) ma masadai zu Zuda unda, Zimili kɛɛni masadai zu ga dɔɔɠɔ ɠila Tiilesa, názu Izilayɛle ɠɔɔʋɛbɛi ɗa Filisiti nuiti ta-laa wolai Giɓeton maaɠaku. <verse eid="1KI 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 16:16"/>Kɔɔɠɔ nuiti ti mɛnigai ma ga Zimili masagi maaɓɔteʋea, é paa, naama volo na nɔ ti yɛni kɔɔlaaɠai zu, ti ta-ɠɔɔɠuluɓai Womeli ɠɛ ga Izilayɛle masagi. <verse eid="1KI 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 16:17"/>Womeli ta ná-kɔɔʋɛbɛi pɛ ti zeɠeni Giɓeton, ti li, ti Tiilesa zei kɛlɛ su. <verse eid="1KI 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 16:18"/>Zimili kaai ma ga taai zoga, é liini, é lɛ dɔɔɠu wosuʋɛ naa ɠɛni masa pɛlɛi wu, é abui ʋili masa pɛlɛi ʋa, é za abui zu. <verse eid="1KI 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 16:19"/>É zaani tɔɔzei kotoiti ba é ti ɠɛɛni, é Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wanama vai ɠɛ, é ziɛ ʋele ɲɔu ga Zeloɓoame ɠɛʋele, nii é Izilayɛle nuiti diini kotoi ɠɛɛ vai ma. <verse eid="1KI 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 16:20"/>Zimili ná-kɛɛwotii mɔtaiti, ta yaavai é gilini, naati sɛʋɛʋɛ Izilayɛle masagiti ta-ɠɛɛwoti zɛʋɛi zu.<verse eid="1KI 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 16:21"/>Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti ti ɠɛɛni su fele, gilazuʋɛ ʋilɛni Ginate ná-doun zunui Tiɓini ʋolu ga ti kɛ ga masagi, gilazuʋɛ ʋilɛ Womeli ʋolu. <verse eid="1KI 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 16:22"/>Niiti ti ɠɛni Womeli ʋolu, naati ti zobo sɔlɔɔni zɔiti ma ti ɠɛni Ginate ná-doun zunui Tiɓini ʋolu. Tiɓini zaani niina, Womeli zei masadai zu.<verse eid="1KI 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Izilayɛle masagi Womeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 16:23"/>Aza ná-kona ʋuusaʋagɔ maazu ɠilagi (31) ma masadai zu Zuda unda, Womeli zeini Izilayɛle unda ga masagi. Kona puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12) ɠa é kɛɛni masadai zu. Naama ɠona puugɔ maazu felegɔi (12) zu, é kɛɛni ga kona dɔzita Tiilesa. <verse eid="1KI 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 16:24"/>Naa ʋoluma é liini Semɛɛl ʋɔ bɛ, é Samali ɠizei ɠeya ma ga walii waadɔzita (6.000), é taa wolai lo gizei naa ma, é taai naa laaseigi ʋɛɛ ga Samali. Naama laaseigi ɠulani Seemeel laaseigi zu, nii é zooi ɠeyani ma.<verse eid="1KI 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 16:25"/>Womeli Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wanama vai ɠɛɛni, siɛ ʋelei ɲɔi é leʋe masagiti pɛ ba, ti leʋeni tɔun tuɠɔ. <verse eid="1KI 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 16:26"/>É ziɛ ʋele ɲɔuni ga Neɓate ná-doun zunui Zeloɓoame ɠɛʋele, nii é Izilayɛle nuiti diini kotoi ɠɛɛ vai ma, ta ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI yiiɠaawana ga kɔɔɠɔ gani kɔɔ vai ti ɠɛni kɛɛzu. <verse eid="1KI 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 16:27"/>Womeli ná-kɛɛwotii mɔtaiti, ta ná-tɔɠɔɠula faiti é ti lɛɛni, naati sɛʋɛʋɛ Izilayɛle masagiti ta-ɠɛɛwoti zɛʋɛi zu. <verse eid="1KI 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 16:28"/>Womeli zaani. Ti maaɠuluni Samali. Ná-doun zunui Akaɓe ɠa é masadai ɠɛɛni potogi zu.<verse eid="1KI 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Izilayɛle masagi Akaɓe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 16:29"/>Aza ná-kona ʋuusaʋagɔ maazu lɔsaʋai (38) ma masadai zu Zuda unda, Womeli ná-doun zunui Akaɓe zeini Izilayɛle unda ga masagi Samali. Kona ʋuufelegɔ maazu felegɔ (22) ɠa é kɛɛni masadai zu. <verse eid="1KI 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 16:30"/>Womeli ná-doun zunui Akaɓe Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wanama vai ɠɛɛni, é ɲɔu é leʋe masagiti pɛ ba, ti leʋegai tuɠɔ. <verse eid="1KI 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 16:31"/>É Neɓate ná-doun zunui Zeloɓoame ná-kotoiti pɛ kɛɛni, naa la ziilɛini, é li, é Sidɔn masagi Eteɓaale ná-doun anzanui Zezaɓɛle vulu, é li vɔlɔ é kɔɔɠɔ ganigi Ɓaale lɛbi, é nɔkɔ bu. <verse eid="1KI 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 16:32"/>É pɛlɛ loni kɔɔɠɔ ganigi Ɓaale ʋɛ Samali, é zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɓɛtɛ ná. <verse eid="1KI 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 16:33"/>É sale wului ɓadɔni. Naama ɠɛɛwotiiti kpein maaʋele ma, Akaɓe Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI yiiɠaawanani, é leʋe Izilayɛle masagiti kpein ba, ti leʋeni tɔun tuɠɔ.<verse eid="1KI 16:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 16:34"/>Akaɓe ná-siɛgi zu ɠa Ɓetɛle nui Yiyɛle Zeliko taai loni da ʋolu. Kɔtu mɔungi é daani, naa zu anii ɠɛni ga ná-doun zunu mɔungi Aɓilame, kpegai ma ga pɛlɛla ɓogiti pilɛ, naa zu anii ɠɛ ga ná-doun zunui loungo gelei Seguɓe. Naama vai pɛ ge ɠɛɛni é zoloo wooi naa ma, nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI boni, é ɠula Nun ná-doun zunui Zozuwe la.<verse eid="1KI 16:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1KI 17"/>
  <para style="s">GALA goo wo nui Eli <optbreak/> foɠo ɓaankpaangi ma vai wo fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 17:1"/>Tiseɓé nui Eli, nii é ɠɛni ga Galaade yooi zu nui ta, naa ɠɛni Akaɓe ma: «Gè ɠonaa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma, nii é vulua, Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI gè botii ɠɛɛzu bɛ, konagi niiti ti ʋaazu, duɓu la ʋua, tona la ʋua, kɛni ni nà falina.»<verse eid="1KI 17:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 17:2"/>Naama wooi ʋoluma, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Eli ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="1KI 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 17:3"/>«Zeɠe ʋɛ, è li folo ɠulazu ʋelei. Lɔɔɠu Kelite kɔtuɗɛi ma ʋɛtugi zu, nii é folo ɠulazu ʋelei ziɛ wolai Zuludɛn ɠobaʋɛ. <verse eid="1KI 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 17:4"/>Kɔtuɗɛi naa ɠa é ɠɛɛzu ga ɗa-ɓɔɔle ɗɛi, gè devei vea kalawɔniiti zea ga ti ɗa è ɠɔnɔkula ná.»<verse eid="1KI 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 17:5"/>Eli liini, é naa ɠɛ, nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI boni ma. É liini, é zei Kelite kɔtuɗɛi ɠobaʋɛ, nii é folo ɠulazu ʋelei ziɛ wolai Zuludɛn ɠobaʋɛ. <verse eid="1KI 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 17:6"/>Kalawɔniiti ti ɠɛni liizu pɔ ga ɓului ta suai sobui ta kpɔkɔ, é ɠɛni ɓɔɔlezu ga kɔtuɗɛi. <verse eid="1KI 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 17:7"/>Kɛlɛ yeeɠɛɠalai tanigaa laawu, kɔtuɗɛi vɔɔni, mazɔlɔɔ tona la mɔ ɠɛni ʋuuzu zooi zu.<verse eid="1KI 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Eli lii vai poanzai ʋɔ bɛ Salɛpɛta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 17:8"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ naazu, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="1KI 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 17:9"/>«Wuzeɠe, è li Salɛpɛta, Sidɔn yooi zu, è zei ná. Gè devei veeʋɛ poanzai ta ya, ga é ɗa è ɠɔnɔkula miná.»<verse eid="1KI 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 17:10"/>Eli wuzeɠeni, é li Salɛpɛta. Taa ziɠidaʋɛ, é poanzai ta ɠaani, é ɗa koʋii yɛʋɛ. Eli tolini, é ɠɛ ma: «Ni ɗa kɛɛna, li kae, è ʋa bɛ̀ ga ziɛi tago ziɛ liɠii zu, gè ɓɔɔle.» <verse eid="1KI 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 17:11"/>Naa liizuʋɛ ʋaazu ga ziɛi, é naa lolini ʋolu, é ɠɛ ma: «Ni ɗa kɛɛna, è ʋa ɓalaa ga ɓulu ɓuɠa ɠila pɔ̀.»<verse eid="1KI 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 17:12"/>Kɛlɛ poanzai ɠɛni ma: «Gè ɠonaa ɗa-ƓALAGI, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma, nii é vulua, ga ɓulu ɓuɠa ɠila kpalaa ge la zèa pɛlɛi wu. Zee zakpa ɲɛ gila nɔ ɠa é zèa aniɲakai zu ga ɓulu vukɔi, ta gulɔi tago nɔ ɠa é zèa gulɔ woolei zu. Gè ɠɛa ʋaani koʋi ɓuɠa felegɔ yɛʋɛzu, gè li, gè naa mɔta goi ɓɛtɛ dòun zunui ʋɛ. Gá miina, ani ɠili ge la mɔ gi ya, kɛni niina nɔ gi zei, gi ɗa saai maaɓɔun.»<verse eid="1KI 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 17:13"/>Eli ɠɛni ma: «Mina lua. Li, è naa ɠɛ, nii è bogai, kɛlɛ nii é è yeewu, ɓulu ɠila kpɛtɛ dɛ ga naa nɔ̀un bɛ, è ʋaa la pɔ̀, ɗa li niina, è ta ɓɛtɛ wo ʋɛ, wa è-loun zunui. <verse eid="1KI 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 17:14"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹Ɓulu vukɔi ma aniɲakai zu la ʋalaga pɛ, ta gulɔ woolei zu la ʋalaga pɛ, eyɛsu naama voloi zeeli, yeei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI tonai ʋuuzu la zooi ma.› »<verse eid="1KI 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 17:15"/>É liini, é naa ɠɛ, nii Eli boni ma. Tama, daamianigi ɠɛni zea yeeɠɛɠala zuɠooza daawu, tɔ-o, ná-pɛlɛyeɠei-yo, naa ʋɛɛ Eli ʋa. <verse eid="1KI 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 17:16"/>Ɓulu vukɔi la ʋalani aniɲakai zu, gulɔi la ʋalani goolei zu, eɠɛʋelei nɔ Eli Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laawooi woni da ma.<verse eid="1KI 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Eli poanzai ná-doun zunui <optbreak/> yɛnvui ʋuu vai su ʋolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 17:17"/>Niima vaiti pɛ poluma, poanzai é yeezeini Eli wu, naa ná-doun zunui zeeɓɛni, seeɓɛi ɓɔi, é za. <verse eid="1KI 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 17:18"/>Dee ɠɛni ma: «GALA goo wo nui, leeni ɠa é de yɔɠɔzu? È ʋaaʋɛ ga è kì too nà-faaɠaaza golaiti, ta è ɠɛ ga dòun zunui zaa zaɓui ɓaa?» <verse eid="1KI 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 17:19"/>Eli ɠɛni ma: «È-loun zunui ve zèa.» É naa ɠulani anzanui yeeloko zu, é lɛɛ la geezu ʋɛlɛi wu, ʋɛ ti daazuʋɛɛni ná, é da ná-betei zu. <verse eid="1KI 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 17:20"/>Naa ʋoluma é Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maanɛɛnɛni ɠani: «Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗɛi è ga nà-GALAGI, poanzai nii ɓalaa é yeezeiɗai bù ná-pɛlɛi wu, ɗa pɔ è ma ɲɔi zei ma, ga è ná-doun zunui ʋaa?» <verse eid="1KI 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 17:21"/>É zakpa maalɛɛ daa ɠɛɛni doungoi ma ga saʋagɔ, é ɗa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maanɛɛnɛ ɠani: «Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà-GALAGI, nà è maanɛɛnɛzu, doungoi nii yɛnvui ʋu su ʋolu!» <verse eid="1KI 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 17:22"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI Eli woomɛnini, é doungoi yɛnvui ʋuuni su ʋolu, naa tɔɔzei mɔnɔ ga yɛnvua.<verse eid="1KI 17:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 17:23"/>Eli doungoi zeɠeni, é yei la buu ʋele ʋɛlɛi wu, é fe dee ya, é ɠɛ ma: «Wɛlɛ, è-loin ɠa vulua!» <verse eid="1KI 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 17:24"/>Anzanui ɠɛni Eli ma: «Gè kwɛɛga niizu ga ɗa ga GALA goo wo nu ɓɔɠɔɓɔɠɔ, ta ɗa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laawooi laazeelizu ga ɠite.»<verse eid="1KI 17:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1KI 18"/>
  <para style="s">Eli ɠale fai ma Akaɓe ʋɔ bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 18:1"/>Folo mɔinmɔin ge leʋeni. Foɠo ɓaankpaangi ma ɠona saʋasiɛi ma, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Eli ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: «Li, è ɓɔɠɔ lɛ ga Akaɓe, nà ɓe tonai ʋa niina, é ʋu zooi ma.» <verse eid="1KI 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 18:2"/>Eli liini ɓɔɠɔ lɛɛzu ga Akaɓe. Pului wola ɓɔini Samali. <verse eid="1KI 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 18:3"/>Akaɓe Aɓediyase lolini, masa pɛlɛi wu ɠundiɠii. (Aɓediyase ɠɛni ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazuluaba nu wola. <verse eid="1KI 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 18:4"/>Siɛgi zu Zezaɓɛle ɠɛni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laawoo wo nuiti paazu la, Aɓediyase nu ungila (100) seɠeni ti zaama, é ti lɔɔɠu pugiti su ga nu ʋuulɔɔludɔɔlu, é ɗa ti ɠɔnɔkula ga ɓului ta ziɛi.) <verse eid="1KI 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 18:5"/>Akaɓe ɠɛni Aɓediyase ma: «Leʋena zooi zu ná pɛ ziɛungiti ta kɔtuɗɛiti pɔ bɛ ti, ɓafɔ ɗa tufa wundu ɠaa, nii a kɛ sooiti ta soovale fuuluiti zɛnvu yɛ ti zu, ade mina ʋili togani ʋaa vaa zu.» <verse eid="1KI 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 18:6"/>Ti zooi ɠaaɠwɛɛni ɓɔɠɔ ʋa ga ti suɓizɛ, Akaɓe ɠila ge li ga ná-pele, Aɓediyase ɓalaa tɔ ɠila ge li ga ná-pele.<verse eid="1KI 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 18:7"/>Aɓediyase ɠila kɛai ma pelei zu, é Eli ɠaani, é ɗa ʋa pɔ pelei. Aɓediyase ɠwɛɛsu ɠaani ba, é loo kɔɠɔwu, é laaʋɛ zooi ma, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa ɠa nɛi, màliɠii Eli?» <verse eid="1KI 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 18:8"/>Eli ɠɛ ma: «Nà ɠa. Li, è ɠɛ è-maliɠii ma: ‹Eli ɠa é ʋaazu.› » <verse eid="1KI 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 18:9"/>Aɓediyase ɠɛni Eli ma: «Kotoi ɓɛgele ɠa gè kɛai, nɛ̀i gè ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui, è tèʋesu Akaɓe ʋɔ ga é pàa? <verse eid="1KI 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 18:10"/>Gè ɠonaa ɗa-ƓALAGI Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma, nii é vulua, ga zou la yɛni ta masa zooi ta la yɛni, ʋɛ màliɠii la nu leʋeni ná è ɠaiziɛzu. Ni naama yooi zu nuiti ta la ɠɛna ma: ‹É la ʋaani gi ʋɔ bɛ,› kɛni naati ti ɠona mɔnɔ ga ti la è ɠaani. <verse eid="1KI 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 18:11"/>Ɗa ma ka, è ɠɛ gè li, gè ɠɛ màliɠii ma: ‹Eli ɠa é ʋaazu.› <verse eid="1KI 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 18:12"/>Naa ʋoluma nà zeɠena è ɠoba, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-Zɛnvui ɠa ʋaazu é è zeɠe, é li ga ɗe, gè la kwɛɛ mini, gè zɛba gè li, gè ʋoluvaawo Akaɓe ma, a ʋaana, é la è ɠaani, toɠa pàa. Nà ma, ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui, nà luazu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa kaite mà loungo yee. <verse eid="1KI 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 18:13"/>Màliɠii, ti la naa woni è ma ɓaa, nii gè kɛɛni, siɛgi zu Zezaɓɛle ɠɛni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laawoo wo nuiti paazu la? Gè GALA goo wo nu ungila (100) dɔɔɠuni ti zaama pugiti su ga nu ʋuulɔɔludɔɔlu, gè ɗa ti ɠɔnɔgi ɠula ga ɓului ta ziɛi. <verse eid="1KI 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 18:14"/>Ɗa ɠa, è ɠɛ gè li, gè ɠɛ maliɠii ma: ‹Eli ɠa é ʋaazu.› Toɠa pàa.»<verse eid="1KI 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 18:15"/>Kɛlɛ Eli ɠɛni ma: «Gè ɠonaa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii ma, nii é vulua, nii gè botii ɠɛɛzu bɛ, gaamazu za kɛni gè ɓɔɠɔ lɛ ga Akaɓe.»<verse eid="1KI 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 18:16"/>Aɓediyase liini, é Akaɓe laaɠomi, é ʋoluvaawo naa ma. Akaɓe ɓalaa liini naazu Eli ʋɔ pelei. <verse eid="1KI 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 18:17"/>É Eli ɠaai ma, é ɠɛni ma: «Wɛlɛ ɗa ʋa, ɗɛi è ʋaazu ga maanɔɠɔi Izilayɛle yooi zu!» <verse eid="1KI 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 18:18"/>Eli gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Nà laade, gè ʋa ʋa ga maanɔɠɔi Izilayɛle ma, kɛlɛ wa ʋe, ɗa-o, è-ɠɛɛ ná-pɛlɛyeɠei-yo, mazɔlɔɔ wo ɠɛlɛa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-deveiti ba, wo ɗa lɛbiyai ve Ɓaaleni bɛ. <verse eid="1KI 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 18:19"/>Keela leʋena, é Izilayɛle nuiti pɛ gaalɛ ba kòba Kaalamɛle gizei ma, naa ʋɛɛ Ɓaale ná-gala goo wo nu unnaani puulɔɔlugɔiti (450) ba, ta anzanu ɠalagi Asela ná-gala goo wo nu unnaanigɔiti (400), niiti Zezaɓɛle ti ɠɔnɔkulazu.»<verse eid="1KI 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Eli ta Ɓaale ɠala goo wo nuiti Kaalamɛle</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 18:20"/>Akaɓe keelaiti teʋeni, ti Izilayɛle nuiti kpein gaalɛ ba, ta gala goo wo nuiti, Kaalamɛle gizei ma. <verse eid="1KI 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 18:21"/>Eli maaɓuɠani nuɓusɛiti ba, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Wa yɛsu ada felegɔiti zɔɠɔzu, eyɛsu yeelɛ? Ni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa é ga GALA, à ʋilɛ polu, ni tama Ɓaale ʋe, à ʋilɛ polu!» Nuɓusɛiti ti la gooɠaaʋoteni ga woo ɠila kpalaa.<verse eid="1KI 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 18:22"/>Eli ɠɛni ti ma: «Nà ɠila ka zɛ̀gai ná ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-GALA goo wo nui, Ɓaale nɔnɔiti ta ga nu unnaanigɔ puulɔɔlugɔ (450). <verse eid="1KI 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 18:23"/>Ti nikɛ zinɛ felegɔ ve gi ya. Ɓaale ná-nuiti ti yiimazeɠe, ti teʋeleʋe, ti da koʋii maazu, ti mina abu lo ba. Nà ɓalaagi, gè nikɛ zinɛi ɠilagi ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛ, gè da koʋii maazu, gè mina abu lo ba. <verse eid="1KI 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 18:24"/>Naa ʋoluma à wa-ɠalagi vali, nɔ̀un gè Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI vali. Zɔi é ga GALA kitei, naa ɠa é gooɠaaʋotegi veezu ga é abui ɠaazo.» Nuɓusɛiti pɛ ti ɠɛ ma: «Gi vaa naa wu.»<verse eid="1KI 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 18:25"/>Eli ɠɛni Ɓaale ná-gala goo wo nuiti ma: «À yiimazeɠe nikɛ zinɛiti su, wa mɔunpa, mazɔlɔɔ wa ɠa wo mɔinɗai. Naa ʋoluma à wa-ɠalagi vali, kɛlɛ à mina abu ɠaazo.» <verse eid="1KI 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 18:26"/>Ti nikɛ zinɛi zeɠeni, nii ti feeni ti ya, ti zalaɠai ɓɛtɛ, ti tɔɔzei ga Ɓaale maanɛɛnɛa, é zo sobui ma, é zeeli folo gaalɔgai ma, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Ɓaale, gi wooɠaaʋote!» Ti ɗa kua wo zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɠobaʋɛ, kɛlɛ ti la gooɠaaʋote nɔpɛ sɔlɔɔni.<verse eid="1KI 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 18:27"/>Foloi gaalɔgai ma, Eli tɔɔzeini ga é ɲɛɛɠulaa ti zu, é ɗa ɠɛ ti ma: «À wola wooɠula, mazɔlɔɔ galagi ʋe. Tanisu toɠa ɠisiɛzu fai ta zu, ɓaa ti toli ga gaazuvilɛ adɛ ta, ɓaa toɠa ɠɛ lia siɛ ma, ni naa laade, toɠa ɠɛ ɲiizu, à maaloɠa.» <verse eid="1KI 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 18:28"/>Ti wola ɓainni, ti ɗa gaaɠili ma, ti ɗa ɓɔɠɔ maawana ga boɠa zɔkpɔiti ta kpɛɛinti, eɠɛʋelei ti-ɠɛɛwoti wɔlɔmaiti ti la, ti yɛ su, ɲamai ɗa ɠula ti ʋa. <verse eid="1KI 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 18:29"/>Folo gaalɔgai leʋegai ma, ti ɠɛni Ɓaale lolisu mɔnɔ ga zea laalitaaligi ma mɔinmɔin, eyɛsu kpɔkɔ volo zalaɠa ɠula yeeɠɛɠalai zeeli, kɛlɛ ti la gooɠaaʋote gila kpalaa sɔlɔɔni ga woo ɲɛ gila ɓaa poo gila kpalaa.<verse eid="1KI 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 18:30"/>Eli nuɓusɛiti tolini ga ti ɠaalɛ ba koba. Ti ʋaai ma, Eli tɔɔzeini ga é ɗa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɓɛtɛ ʋolu, ʋɛ ná ɠoloɠologa ɠɛni de niina. <verse eid="1KI 18:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 18:31"/>Eli kɔtu puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12) zeɠeni, é zoloo Zakɔɓe mavofodaiti ma wolodamaiti tiegɔi ma. Zakɔɓei naa ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ, é ɠɛ ma: «È-laaseigi ɠa ɠɛ niina ga Izilayɛle.» <verse eid="1KI 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 18:32"/>Kɔtui naati ka é zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɓɛtɛni ga tiye Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laaseigi zu, é zeɠei leʋe, é kaku zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma, nii litɛlɛ ʋuusaʋagɔ (30) a zoo ʋuuzu su. <verse eid="1KI 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 18:33"/>É koʋiiti daani ga pagɔ, é nikɛ zinɛi leʋeleʋe, é da koʋiiti maazu. <verse eid="1KI 18:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 18:34"/>Naa ʋoluma é ɠɛni ti ma: «À ziɛ zaɠa, ɓɔni naanigɔ laave ga ziɛi, wo ti ʋu zalaɠai ta koʋiiti ma.» Ti naa ɠɛɛni. Eli ɠɛni ti ma: «À felesiɛi ɠɛ.» Ti naa ɠɛɛni. É ɠɛni ti ma: «À saʋasiɛi ɠɛ.» Ti naa ɓalaa kɛɛni. <verse eid="1KI 18:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 18:35"/>Ziɛi yeini, é ɠakuni zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma, é zeɠei laave.<verse eid="1KI 18:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 18:36"/>Yeeɠɛɠalai kpɔkɔ volo zalaɠai ɠa ɗa ɠula la GALA bɛ, GALA goo wo nui Eli maaɓuɠani zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ʋa, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Abalaame, ta Izaake, ta Izilayɛle ta-ƓALAGI, ɛsɛ pɛ ge kwɛɛ za ga ɗa ɠa è ga Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI, nɔ̀un nà ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui, ti kwɛɛ ɓalaa ga nii kpein gè kɛa, ɗa ɠa è naama levei veai zèa. <verse eid="1KI 18:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 18:37"/>Gòoɠaaʋote, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, gòoɠaaʋote, nii a kɛ niima nuiti ti kwɛɛ ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa ɠa è ga GALA kitei, ta ɗa ɠa è ti-yiiti gaaɠalesu ma è ma ga mɔungi ɠɛʋele.»<verse eid="1KI 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 18:38"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yeeɓeni abui ʋa, é yei, é zalaɠai ta koʋiiti ta kɔtuiti gala, naa ʋɛɛ fufiligi ʋa, é ziɛi vɔ, nii é ɠɛni zeɠei zu. <verse eid="1KI 18:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 18:39"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ti miná ɠaai ma, ti looni, ti laaʋɛ zooi ma, ti ɗa ɓain, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa é ga GALA kitei! Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa é ga GALA kitei!»<verse eid="1KI 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 18:40"/>Eli zɛba é ɠɛ ti ma: «À Ɓaale ná-gala goo wo nuiti so, gila kpalaa ge mina ʋela.» Ti ti pɛ soni, Eli yei ga tiye Kison kɔtuɗɛi laaʋɛ, miná ɠa ti ti ɠɔdaaleʋeni ná.<verse eid="1KI 18:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Foɠo ɓaankpaangi ɠaaɓelagi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 18:41"/>Naa ʋoluma Eli ɠɛni Akaɓe ma: «Li, è daami wo, è ɓɔɔle, mazɔlɔɔ nà tonai woomɛnisu, é ɗa kpunɛ.» <verse eid="1KI 18:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 18:42"/>Akaɓe liini ga é daamii wo, é ɓɔɔle. Eli ma ge lɛ Kaalamɛle gizei ma, é ʋilɛ ɲiibiɠa zooi ma, é nɔungi ʋilɛ ɲiibiiti zɔɠɔzu. <verse eid="1KI 18:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 18:43"/>É ɠɛni ná-botiɠɛ nui ma: «Lɛ, é wɛlɛ kpoloɗɛi laa ʋelei.» Naa lɛɛni, é wɛlɛ, é ɠale ma, é ɠɛ ma: «Ani nɔpɛ ge la ná.» Eli teʋe daa ɠɛɛni lɔfela. <verse eid="1KI 18:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 18:44"/>Dɔfelasiɛi botiɠɛ nui ɠɛni ma: «Tonaɓiin ko ɠa zeɠezu kpoloɗɛi ɠaa ʋelei, é ɗa lɛ. Kɛlɛ é la wɔɔlɔni nu yee zapalagi ʋa.» Eli devei veeni zea, é ɠɛ ma: «Li, è bo Akaɓe ma, é ná-sooiti kɛʋele ɓɛtɛ, é yei fala, tonai mina ʋa pele leʋesu tuɠɔ.»<verse eid="1KI 18:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 18:45"/>Geei ɠaa ɠɛni liizu ga ɓidia, tɔɔzei tonaɓiingiti ba, fiilɛi ɠɛni ʋaazu la, tona wolai tɔɔzeini ga ʋua, naazu masagi Akaɓe ɠɛni ná-wotoloi zu, é ɗa lɛ Zizeleyɛle taazuʋɛ. <verse eid="1KI 18:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 18:46"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zɛbɛi veeni Eli ʋɛ, é zaamaɠili dii vai zu, é yɛni ɓizɛzu Akaɓe ná-wotoloi ɠakala, ti zeeli Zizeleyɛle taa loaʋɛ.<verse eid="1KI 18:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1KI 19"/>
  <para style="s">Eli ʋela vai Zezaɓɛle ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 19:1"/>Akaɓe liini, é naa kpein suɠula Zezaɓɛle ma, nii Eli kɛɛni, ʋelei ti Ɓaale ná-gala goo wo nuiti paani la ga boɠa zɔkpɔi. <verse eid="1KI 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 19:2"/>Zezaɓɛle keela leʋeni Eli ma, é ɠɛ ma: «Lina, ni gè la è ʋaani, ʋelei è gala goo wo nui niiti paai la, naa a ɠɛɛna, galagiti ti sò ta-yiiɠaawanai pɛ su.»<verse eid="1KI 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 19:3"/>Eli luani, é ʋela ga é zɛnvui ɠizo. Seeliai ma Ɓeel-Seɓa, Zuda yooi zu, é ná-botiɠɛ nui yɛni miná. <verse eid="1KI 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 19:4"/>É folo ɠila kɛɛni, é ɗa ziɛ teʋebai zu, é li, é zei gului ta wu, daa ga zenɛ. Saa wɔin soni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, zɛ̀nvui zeɠe niina, kpɔlɔi kula ɠɛa ga ze, mazɔlɔɔ gè la vizɔni mɛ̀mɛwolani ba.» <verse eid="1KI 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 19:5"/>É laani gului wu, é ɲi. Gaamago geezuɠeelai gila ge ʋaani, é maaloɠa, é ɠɛ ma: «Wuzeɠe, è daamii wo.» <verse eid="1KI 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 19:6"/>É wuzeɠeni, é wɛlɛ, é ɓulu laalii ɠaa, nii mɔgai kɔtu ɓadii ma, naa unbuaʋɛ, ta ziawɔ ɠila, ziɛi fegɔ. É daamii wogai ma, é ɓɔɔle, é laani ʋolu gului wu. <verse eid="1KI 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 19:7"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-geezuɠeelai ʋaani ʋolu, é maaloɠa, é ɠɛ ma: «Wuzeɠe, è daamii wo, mazɔlɔɔ siɛ ɠooza ka è ya.» <verse eid="1KI 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 19:8"/>É wuzeɠeni, é daamii wo, é ɓɔɔle. Zɛbɛi nii daamianigi naa feeni zea, naa yɛni ba, é kɛ ga folo ʋuunaanigɔ (40), kpidi ʋuunaanigɔ (40) siɛi ɠa, eyɛsu é zeeli GALA ná-gizei ma, Wolɛɓe.<verse eid="1KI 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA ge iɲɔdɔɔi vee vai ʋolu Eli ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 19:9"/>Eli lɔɔni miná pugi zu, é ɲi ná piin. Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ miná, é ɠɛ ma: «Lee ɠa è kɛɛzu ʋɛ, Eli?» <verse eid="1KI 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 19:10"/>Eli gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Gè sùvikɛi pɛ kula Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii, mazɔlɔɔ Izilayɛle nuiti ti ɠɛlɛa ɗa-minazeɠegi ʋa, ti ɗa-zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛti koloɠologa, ti è-laawoo wo nuiti paa ga boɠa zɔkpɔi. Nà ɠila ka niina zɛ̀gai ʋoluzu, nà ɓalaagi ta pɔ ga ti pàa.»<verse eid="1KI 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 19:11"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni ma: «Ɠula, è lo gizei ma nɔ̀un gaazu.» Gaamago nɔ, fiilɛ wolai lokoleʋeni, é ɗa ʋa ga zeeɠaaɓaai, sɛbɛ wɔɔlɔ ʋelei ma é ɠɛni gizeiti ta fasaiti golozu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI luɠɔ, kɛlɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI la ɠɛni fiilɛi zu. Fiilɛi leʋegai ma, zou ɓalii ɠɛni, kɛlɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI la ɠɛni zou ɓalii zu. <verse eid="1KI 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 19:12"/>Zou ɓalii ʋoluma, abui ʋa, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI la ɠɛni abui zu. Abui ʋoluma, fiilɛ lɛilɛi ko lugi ɠulani fɛɛ, gaanɛai.<verse eid="1KI 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 19:13"/>Eli tugi mɛnigai ma, é ɠaazuʋɛ maaveleveleni ga ná-seɠe wolai, é ɠulani pugi zu, é lo daaʋɛ. É woo mɛnini, é ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Lee ɠa è kɛɛzu ʋɛ, Eli?» <verse eid="1KI 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 19:14"/>Eli gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Gè sùvikɛi pɛ kula Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii, mazɔlɔɔ Izilayɛle nuiti ti ɠɛlɛa ɗa-minazeɠegi ʋa, ti ɗa-zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛti koloɠologa, ti è-laawoo wo nuiti paa ga boɠa zɔkpɔi. Nà ɠila ka niina zɛ̀gai ʋoluzu, nà ɓalaagi ta pɔ ga ti pàa.»<verse eid="1KI 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 19:15"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni ma: «Ɠale ma ga teʋebai zu ʋelei nii nɔ è ʋaai la. Li Damase, è gulɔi ziɛ Ɠazayɛle ma, é ɠɛ ga Siili masagi. <verse eid="1KI 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 19:16"/>È gulɔi ziɛ Nimesi ná-doun zunui Zewu ma, é ɠɛ ga Izilayɛle masagi, è gulɔi ziɛ Aɓɛle-Meɠola nui Safate ná-doun zunui Elizé ma, é ɠɛ ga GALA goo wo nui è-ʋotogi zu. <verse eid="1KI 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 19:17"/>Naazu zɔi Ɠazayɛle ná-boɠa zɔkpɔi a ʋoola ba, Zewu ɠa naama nui ʋaa, nii Zewu ná-boɠa zɔkpɔi a ʋoola ba, Elizé ɠa naama nui ʋaa. <verse eid="1KI 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 19:18"/>Kɛlɛ nà nu waadɔfela (7.000) makɛsu Izilayɛle nuiti saama, niiti ti la ʋilɛni ɲiibiɠa Ɓaale ʋɛ, ta ti la laaʋɛɛni komaga, ti ʋa nɛɛnɛ.»<verse eid="1KI 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Elizé loli fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 19:19"/>Eli zeɠeni miná, é li, é Safate ná-doun zunui Elizé ɠaa, naa ɗa wozai ʋili, woza ʋili nikɛ velefelegi ɠɛni kakala ga puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12), puugɔ maazu velesiɛi (12) ɠa é ɠɛni zea. Eli leʋeni Elizé ɠoba, é ná-seɠe ɠula ɠɔba, é pili Elizé ma. <verse eid="1KI 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 19:20"/>Elizé ná-nikɛiti zɛni ná, é ɓizɛ Eli ʋolu, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɓɛ gè kɛ̀ɛni ta dèe nɛɛnɛ, gè vali ti ma. Naa ʋoluma nà ʋa niina, gè ʋilɛ è ʋolu.» Eli gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Li, è ʋa, ɠizɛ naa zu, nii gè kɛai ga ɗe.» <verse eid="1KI 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 19:21"/>Ta Eli ti baligai ma ma, é liini ga ʋoluʋelei, é nikɛ felegɔ zo, é kɛ ga zalaɠai, é ma unbawului ɠɛ ga koʋii, ti suai ɠili la, é fe nuɓusɛiti zea, ti mi, é wuzeɠe, é ʋilɛ Eli ʋolu, é ɠɛ ga naa ná-botiɠɛ nui.<verse eid="1KI 19:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1KI 20"/>
  <para style="s">Akaɓe vɔni fai <optbreak/> Siili masagi Ɓɛne-Ɠadade ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 20:1"/>Siili masagi Ɓɛne-Ɠadade ná-kɔɔʋɛbɛi pɛ gaalɛɛni ba, é ʋɛɛ masa puusaʋagɔ maazu felegɔ (32) ʋa, naa ʋɛɛ sooiti, ta kɔɔɠɔ wotoloiti. Ti ʋaani, ti Samali zei kɛlɛ su ga ti kɔɔi vala ba. <verse eid="1KI 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 20:2"/>É keelaiti teʋeni taazuʋɛ Izilayɛle masagi Akaɓe ma, <verse eid="1KI 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 20:3"/>ti ɠɛ ma: «Ɓɛne-Ɠadade ɠɛ: ‹Ɗa-wali ta ɗa-zanugiti fe zèa, è-anzaiti ta è-loun zunui zɛbɛsu geleiti fe zèa.› » <verse eid="1KI 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 20:4"/>Izilayɛle masagi gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Màliɠii, nii è boga, zèe ɠa bu, nà-o, zeaɠɔli kpein, gá ga ɗɔnɔ.»<verse eid="1KI 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 20:5"/>Ɓɛne-Ɠadade ná-keelaiti teʋeni ʋolu, ti ɠɛ Akaɓe ma: «Ɓɛne-Ɠadade ɠɛ: ‹Gè woo leʋega è ma ga è ɗa-waliiti ta ɗa-zanugiti fe zèa, naa ʋɛɛ è-anzaiti ta è-loun zunuiti ba. <verse eid="1KI 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 20:6"/>Lina niima yeeɠɛɠalai ma, nà nà-botiɠɛ nu wolaiti teʋesu, ti ʋa, ti wɛlɛ ɗa-ʋɛlɛi ta ɗa-wotiɠɛ nuiti ta-ʋɛlɛiti bu, ti naa kpein seɠe, nii pagai è ɠaazu.› »<verse eid="1KI 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 20:7"/>Izilayɛle masagi zooi ma ɠundiɠiiti pɛ gaalɛɛni ba, é ɠɛ ti ma: «À suɠwɛɛ, wo gaaɠa ga zunui nii ɠa ade ɠaiziɛzu ga faa ɲɔu. É keela leʋega mà ga gè nà-waliiti ta nà-zanugiti fe zea, naa ʋɛɛ ànzaiti ta dòun zunuiti ba, gè la ɠɛlɛni naa tanɔpɛ ba.» <verse eid="1KI 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 20:8"/>Kundiɠiiti ta nuɓusɛiti pɛ ti ɠɛni Akaɓe ma: «Mina woilo goo ma, mina yeezei ná-faa nɔpɛ bu.»<verse eid="1KI 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 20:9"/>É ɠɛni naazu Ɓɛne-Ɠadade ná-keelaiti ma: «À li, wo ɠɛ màliɠii masagi ma: ‹Nii kpein è boga mà mɔungi, nà naati kɛ, kɛlɛ gaaɓela kelei nii è boga, gè la zooga kɛɛzu.› » Keelaiti ti liini, ti naa wo Ɓɛne-Ɠadade ma. <verse eid="1KI 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 20:10"/>Ɓɛne-Ɠadade wooleʋeni mɔnɔ Akaɓe ma, é ɠɛ ma: «Ni Samali vufiligi ɠa kula ɠɛɛna ga é kɔɔɠɔ nui niiti zeaʋɛ laave pòlu, naa ɠa ɠɛɛna galagiti ti sò ta-yiiɠaawanai pɛ su.» <verse eid="1KI 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 20:11"/>Kɛlɛ Izilayɛle masagi ɠɛni ti ma: «À li, wo ɠɛ ma: ‹Zɔi é liizu kɔɔmaʋɛ, naa maa la nɛɛni, é ʋa ɓɔɠɔ lɛ su eɠɛ zɔi é zobo sɔlɔɔgai, é ɗa zeɠe kɔɔɠɔzuʋɛ.› »<verse eid="1KI 20:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 20:12"/>Siɛgi zu Ɓɛne-Ɠadade naama wooi mɛnini da, é ɠɛni dɔɔi ɓɔlezu ta zɔɔma masagiti seɠe ɠotaiti bu. É ɠɛni ná-kɔɔɠɔ nuiti ma: «Ɛsɛ ge lo tosu.» Ti loni ti-losuʋɛti taai zo fai zu.<verse eid="1KI 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA goo wo nui ta ʋaa vai <optbreak/> é ɓɔɛ masagi Akaɓe ʋɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 20:13"/>Naama ziɛgi zu GALA goo wo nui gila ge ʋaani, é Izilayɛle masagi Akaɓe ʋɛtɛ, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹È kɔɔʋɛbɛ wolai nii ʋɛtɛga? Nà dɔɔzu za è yeezu, ɗa suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.› » <verse eid="1KI 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 20:14"/>Akaɓe gaazaɠagi woni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa leʋesu ga ɓɛ maaʋele, é dɔ zèezu?» Naa gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹Nà dɔɔzu è yeezu ga nu niinɛiti maaʋele, ti lɔai salaʋusu vai zu ga niinɛ zou zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠiiti bɛ.› » Akaɓe gaazaɠani ʋolu ga: «Ɓɛ ɠa é kɔɔi lɔɔzeizu?» GALA goo wo nui gooɠaaʋote, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa ʋe.»<verse eid="1KI 20:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 20:15"/>Akaɓe salaʋusu loungoiti gaalɛɛni ba niiti zou zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠiiti, ti ti-laaseigiti sɛʋɛni, naati ti ɠɛni ga nu unfelegɔ puusaʋa maazu fele (232), é Izilayɛle ɠɔɔʋɛbɛi mɔtaiti gaalu, ti ɠɛ ga nu waadɔfela (7.000). <verse eid="1KI 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 20:16"/>Ti ɠulani ga folo gaalɔgai. Naazu Ɓɛne-Ɠadade ta masa ʋuusaʋagɔ maazu felegɔi (32), niiti ti ʋaani ɓɔsu ba, ti ɗa dɔɔi ɓɔle, é ɗa ti zo seɠe ɠotaiti bu. <verse eid="1KI 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 20:17"/>Zou zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠiiti ta-zalaʋusuiti ka ti ɠulani mɔunpa. Ɓɛne-Ɠadade nuiti teʋeni ná, ga é kwɛɛ nii é ɠɛɛzu ná. Ti ʋaani, ti ɠɛ ma: «Nuiti kulaʋɛ Samali.» <verse eid="1KI 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 20:18"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «É ɠɛni ga ziilɛigi zuvali vai ʋe, ɓaa ti ʋa kɔɔi ʋɛɛzu ade ʋa, à ti ma vuluiti so, wo ʋa ga tiye.»<verse eid="1KI 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 20:19"/>Salaʋusu niinɛiti ta kɔɔʋɛbɛi nii é ɠɛni ti ʋolu, ti ɠulani taai ʋa. <verse eid="1KI 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 20:20"/>Ɛsɛ ge valani kɔɔɲɔɠɔi ʋa, é paa, Siili nuiti ti ʋela, Izilayɛle nuiti ti ʋilɛ ti ʋolu. Siili masagi Ɓɛne-Ɠadade ʋelani sooi gila kɔma, ta soo ɓizɛ zalaʋusuiti. <verse eid="1KI 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 20:21"/>Izilayɛle masagi ná-kɔɔʋɛbɛi leʋeni, ti ti zili nuiti ta-zooiti ta kɔɔɠɔ wotoloiti suɠoloɠolo, ti Siili nuiti too bu ga gola.<verse eid="1KI 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 20:22"/>Naa ʋoluma GALA goo wo nui ʋaani, é ɠɛ Izilayɛle masagi ma: «Zɛbɛzeɠe, è ɠisiɛ naa zu, nii ɗa kɛ, mazɔlɔɔ ɲɔmɔ zu niima ziɛgi nɔ ma, Siili nuiti ta ʋaazu, ti kɔɔi vala è ʋa.»<verse eid="1KI 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Izilayɛle nuiti ti vɔni fai mɔnɔ <optbreak/> Siili nuiti ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 20:23"/>Siili masagi ná-botiɠɛ nu wolaiti ti ɠɛni ma: «Ta-ƓALAGI ɠa ga gize maazu ƓALAGI, naa ɠa é kɛa ti vɔniga ade ma. Ade vala ti ʋa nɛmɛi zu, naazu ada vɔni ti ma. <verse eid="1KI 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 20:24"/>Pɛtɛ nii ɗa kɛ, masagi niiti kpein kula ti-losuʋɛti, è ti maavalibo ga zou zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠiiti. <verse eid="1KI 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 20:25"/>Naa ʋoluma salaʋusuiti daaseigiti sɛʋɛ, ti mɔin eɠɛʋelei zɔiti ti ɠɛa mɔinni la, è ʋalagai ti ma, sooiti ti mɔin ta kɔɔɠɔ wotoloiti. Ade zɛba ade vala ti ʋa nɛmɛi zu, ada vɔni nɔ ti ma.» Ɓɛne-Ɠadade ziɛni ga ta-lɛnɛ gooi, é naa pɛ kɛɛni, nii ti boni ma.<verse eid="1KI 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 20:26"/>Poluma ɠonagi ma yeeɠɛɠalai nɔ, é Siili ɠɔɔʋɛbɛiti pɛ gaalɛɛni ba, ti ʋa Afɛke taazuʋɛ kɔɔi vala vai zu Izilayɛle yooi ʋa. <verse eid="1KI 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 20:27"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ɓalaa ti ta-ɠɔɔʋɛbɛiti gaalɛɛni ba, ti daamianigiti fe ti ya. Ti liini, ti ti laaɠomi ga kɔɔi. Izilayɛle nuiti ti loni ti ɠaazu, ti ɠɛ nɔ eɠɛ boli ɓulu felegɔ. Siili nuiti ma, ti ma ʋɛbɛi ʋuuni zooi zu ná pɛ. <verse eid="1KI 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 20:28"/>GALA goo wo nui ʋaani, é ɠɛ Izilayɛle masagi ma: «Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹Tɛi Siili nuiti ti ɠɛ nɔ̀un nà ga gize maazu ƓALA, gè la ga pɛtu su ƓALA, naa maaʋele ma, nà niima ʋɛbɛ wolai lɔɔzu è yeezu. Wa suɠwɛɛ naazu ga nà ɠa gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI› » <verse eid="1KI 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 20:29"/>Kɔɔʋɛbɛ felegɔiti ti yɛni loni ɓɔɠɔ laawu, é yɛsu folo lɔfela, foloi lɔfelasiɛi kɔɔi ɗa tɔɔzei, Izilayɛle nuiti Siili zalaʋusu waaungila (100.000) paa folo ɠilagi.<verse eid="1KI 20:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Akaɓe Siili masagi yɛnvui yɛ fai zea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 20:30"/>Mɔtaiti ti ʋelani, ti li Afɛke taazuʋɛ. Niiti ti yɛni ʋoluzu, nu waaʋuufelegɔ maazu lɔfela (27.000) ʋelani, ti li Afɛke taa wolai zu, kɛlɛ taai ma siɠigi ɠoloni ti ma. Ɓɛne-Ɠadade ʋelani, é li taazuʋɛ, é ɗa leʋeteʋe pɛlɛiti bu. <verse eid="1KI 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 20:31"/>Ná-botiɠɛ nu wolaiti ti ɠɛni ma: «Woilo, gi mɛnigɛ ga Izilayɛle masagiti ta ga gaazumaawɔinɠaa nuiti. Ɓɛ gi saa wɔlɔ wo seɠeiti gili zaama, gi galuiti gili gɔungiti ba, gi li masagi ʋɔ bɛ, ɓafɔ toɠa è yɛ vulua.» <verse eid="1KI 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 20:32"/>Ti saa wɔlɔ wo seɠeiti gilini zaama, ti galuiti gili tɔungiti ba, ti li masagi ʋɔ bɛ, ti ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui Ɓɛne-Ɠadade wooi ɠaa: ‹Zɛ̀nvui yɛ zèa.› » Akaɓe ɠɛni ti ma: «Tɔun ka dɛ vulua kɛlɛ? Toɠa ga kɛ̀ɛloin.» <verse eid="1KI 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 20:33"/>Naati ti ziilɛi faa ɠaani naama wooi zu, ti zuvilɛ ga ti so ga gooi, ti ɠɛ ma: «Ungo, toɠa ga è-ɠɛɛloin.» Akaɓe ɠɛni ti ma: «À li, wo ʋaa la!» Ɓɛne-Ɠadade ɠulani ná-dɔɔɠu ʋelei zu, é ʋa, é ɓɔɠɔ lɛ ga Akaɓe. Akaɓe tɛɛni, é sei ná-wotoloi zu. <verse eid="1KI 20:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 20:34"/>Ɓɛne-Ɠadade ɠɛni Akaɓe ma: «Nà taaiti pɛ gaaɠale ma è ma, niiti kɛ̀ɛ ti ɠulani è-ɠɛɛ ya, ɗa zoo pɔdi loozuʋɛti daalaosu Damase, eɠɛʋelei kɛ̀ɛ ti laalaoni la Samali.» Akaɓe ɠɛ ma: «Nà ma, nà wɔɔlɔyai ve è ya, de minazeɠe kɛ yɔɠɔzu.» Ti minazeɠegi ɠɛɛni yɔɠɔzu, é ɓe naa ʋa, é li ɓɔɠɔ yeema.<verse eid="1KI 20:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Akaɓe ná-minazeɠegi ʋeelala vai GALA goo wo nui ta ʋɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 20:35"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni GALA goo wo nu ɓɔgi ma nu ɠila pɔ, é ɠɛ bɔɔlai ma: «Dòɠa!» Kɛlɛ naa la ɠɛni kɛɛni, é ʋa doɠa. <verse eid="1KI 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 20:36"/>Ma mɔungi ɗa ɠɛ bɔɔlai ma: «Tɛi è la ɠoloni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-devei ʋɛ, ɗa zeɠena kòba, zalai ta ɠa valazu è ʋa, é è ʋaa.» Tama é zeɠeni nɔ feya bɔɔlai ɠoba, zala ɠila ge ɠula, é vala ba, é paa.<verse eid="1KI 20:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 20:37"/>Ma mɔungi liini mɔnɔ, é taɠili ka, é faa ɠilagi nɔ wo naa ma. Naa doɠani, é maawana. <verse eid="1KI 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 20:38"/>GALA goo wo nui ɓegai ma ga ɠaazuʋɛ maavelevele ga seɠe zakpaiti, nii a kɛ nu mina kwɛɛ, é liini, é lo masagi leʋe pelei zu.<verse eid="1KI 20:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 20:39"/>Masagi leʋesuʋɛ, GALA goo wo nui ɓainni, é ɠɛ ma: «Nà-masagi! Zɛ̀gɛ kɔɔɠɔzuʋɛ, zunu ɠila ge ʋa ga kɔɔ luɔi ta pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: ‹Makɛ bɛ̀ zunui tɛi ma, a ʋelana, ɗa ɠa è yɛsu potogi zu, ni naa laade, è wali ɠae waasaʋagɔ (3.000) ve.› <verse eid="1KI 20:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 20:40"/>Tama nɔ̀un gaazuvilɛi yɛgɛ de, gè ɗa lɔ, gè ɗa ɠula, kɔɔ luɔi ʋela.» Izilayɛle masagi ɠɛ ma: «È tukpɔɠaaleʋea ɗa ɓɔɠɔi!»<verse eid="1KI 20:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 20:41"/>Gaamago, GALA goo wo nui seɠe zakpaiti kulani ɠaazu, masagi ɠwɛɛsu ɠa ba ga GALA goo wo nui ta ʋe. <verse eid="1KI 20:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 20:42"/>É ɠɛni masagi ma: «Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹É yeeɓega zunui naa ʋa, é li, nii gè ɠɛa daa veeni saai ʋɛ. Naa ɠa é ba, ɗa ɠa è ga potogi, ɗa-nuɓusɛiti ta za ná-nuɓusɛiti potogi zu.› » <verse eid="1KI 20:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 20:43"/>Izilayɛle masagi ɠaleni ma Samali zii ɠoloɠologi ta ziiɠaawanai zu.<verse eid="1KI 20:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1KI 21"/>
  <para style="s">Naɓɔte ʋaa vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 21:1"/>Yeeɠɛɠalai tanigaa ti leʋegai ma niima vaiti poluma, pɛtɛ nii é ɠɛɛni: Zunui ta ɠɛni Zizeleyɛle taazuʋɛ nuiti saama, daa ga Naɓɔte, leezɛn ɓelei ɠɛni zea Zizeleyɛle, Samali masagi Akaɓe ná-masa pɛlɛi ɠobaʋɛ. <verse eid="1KI 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 21:2"/>Akaɓe ɗa ɠɛ Naɓɔte ma: «Ɗa-leezɛn ɓelei ve zèa, gè ná ɠɛ ga guluwulu kpelei, mazɔlɔɔ toɠa nà-masa pɛlɛi ɠoba. Nà maavalibo ga leezɛn ɓelei taɠili, nii pagai tɔun ba, ɓaa ni ɗa pɔ, nà sɔngɔi ɠɛɠalai ve è ya ga walii.» <verse eid="1KI 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 21:3"/>Kɛlɛ Naɓɔte ɠɛni Akaɓe ma: «Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI kìzo naa ma ga gè ʋa zooi naa ve è ya, nii gè sɔlɔɔgai ga pogani kɛ̀ɛni zea.» <verse eid="1KI 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 21:4"/>Akaɓe ɠaleni ma ná-pɛlɛi wu zii ɠoloɠologi ta ziiɠaawanai zu, tɔɔzei naama wooi ʋa, nii Zizeleyɛle nui Naɓɔte boni ma ga: «Gè la mɛ̀mɛwolani ta-ʋoganii veezu è ya.» É laani ná-betei zu, é ɠaaʋote pɛlɛi ma, é la daami woni.<verse eid="1KI 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 21:5"/>Anzai Zezaɓɛle ʋaani koba, é ɠɛ ma: «Lee ma yiizoolɛ ɠa é è ma, è la kɛɛzu è ʋa daami wo?» <verse eid="1KI 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 21:6"/>É ɠɛ naa ma: «Kɛ̀ɛʋɛ Zizeleyɛle nui Naɓɔte ma: ‹Ɗa-leezɛn ɓelei ve zèa, gè geya ga walii, ɓaa gè maavalibo ga leezɛn ɓelei taɠili.› Kɛlɛ kɛɛʋɛ mà: ‹Gè la nà-leezɛn ɓelei veezu è ya.› » <verse eid="1KI 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 21:7"/>Anzai Zezaɓɛle ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa lɛi è ʋa ɠɛ masadai ɠɛɛzu Izilayɛle yooi zu ɓaa? Wuzeɠe, è daami wo, è ɠoozunɛ. Nɔ̀un nà Zizeleyɛle nui Naɓɔte ná-leezɛn ɓelei veezu è ya.»<verse eid="1KI 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 21:8"/>É sɛʋɛiti kɛɛni Akaɓe laaseigi zu, é Akaɓe ná-poogi zei ti ʋa, é ti leʋe kundiɠiiti ta ɠalazogiti ma, ti ɠɛni ɲii wosu taa ɠila su ta Naɓɔteni. <verse eid="1KI 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 21:9"/>Nii ɠa é boni sɛʋɛi naati su: «À zu so foloi leʋe ba, wo Naɓɔte lo nuɓusɛiti untuɠɔ. <verse eid="1KI 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 21:10"/>Wo nu ɲaka felegɔ zei daawu, ti ɗa maalɔ, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: ‹Naɓɔte GALA kotoʋɛ, naa ʋɛɛ masagi ʋa.› Naa ʋoluma à kula taai ʋa, wo yɛ sɔɔzu ga kɔtui, é za.»<verse eid="1KI 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 21:11"/>Kundiɠiiti ta ɠalazogiti ti naa ɠɛɛni, nii Zezaɓɛle boni ti ma ná-sɛʋɛiti su. <verse eid="1KI 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 21:12"/>Ti zu so foloi leʋeni ba, ti ɠɛ Naɓɔte ma, é lo ma ɠaalɛbai luɠɔ. <verse eid="1KI 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 21:13"/>Nu ɲaka felegɔiti ti ʋaani, ti zei daawu, ti tɔɔzei ga maalɔa, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Naɓɔte GALA kotoʋɛ, naa ʋɛɛ masagi ʋa!» Ti kulani naazu taai ʋa, ti yɛ sɔɔzu ga kɔtui, é za. <verse eid="1KI 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 21:14"/>Taa ɠundiɠiiti ti keela leʋeni Zezaɓɛle ma ga Naɓɔte zɔɔʋɛ ga kɔtui, tama é zaa.<verse eid="1KI 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 21:15"/>Zezaɓɛle mɛnigai ma ga ti Naɓɔte zɔɔʋɛ ga kɔtui, é za, é ɠɛni Akaɓe ma: «Wuzeɠe, è Zizeleyɛle nui Naɓɔte ná-leezɛn ɓelei zeɠe ga ɗɔnɔ, nii kɛlɛai feezu è ya ga è geya. Mazɔlɔɔ Naɓɔte la mɔ vulua, é zaa.» <verse eid="1KI 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 21:16"/>Akaɓe mɛnigai ma ga Naɓɔte za, é wuzeɠeni ga é yei Zizeleyɛle nui Naɓɔte ná-leezɛn ɓelei zu, é ʋa seɠe ga nɔnɔ.<verse eid="1KI 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA ge Akaɓe ta Zezaɓɛle ʋeelala vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 21:17"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni naazu Tiseɓé nui Eli ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="1KI 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 21:18"/>«Wuzeɠe, è Akaɓe laaɠomi, Izilayɛle masagi, é Samali, wɛlɛna ba é Naɓɔte ná-leezɛn ɓelei zu, ga é seɠe ga nɔnɔ. <verse eid="1KI 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 21:19"/>Ɗa ɓɔɛ pɔ, è ɠɛ ma: ‹Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Toɠa ɠale, è ɓega ʋoluma ga zunui ʋaa, ɗa ga li mɔnɔ kɔligi zeɠezu ga ɗɔnɔ?› Ɗa ɠɛ ma ʋolu: ‹Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Ʋɛ nɔ gilɛiti ti Naɓɔte ɲamai ɠɔmɔgai ná, miná nɔ ɠa ti è-ɲamai ɠɔmɔsu ná.› »<verse eid="1KI 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 21:20"/>Akaɓe Eli ɠaai ma, é ɠɛni naa ma: «Wɛlɛ, ɗa ʋa! È kàa kɛlɛ, sìli nui?» Eli ɠɛ ma: «Gè è ɠaa, è ɓɔɠɔ ʋɔdia faa ɲɔi ma, è Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wanama vai ɠɛ. <verse eid="1KI 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 21:21"/>Woilo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ma: ‹Nà ʋaazu ga maanɔɠɔi è ma, gè è ɓale ná, gè ɗa-ʋɛlɛyeɠei wu zunuiti pɛ suwuɠaaleʋe, doungo ʋɛɛ kpakolo ba Izilayɛle yooi zu. <verse eid="1KI 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 21:22"/>Nà ɗa-ʋɛlɛyeɠei ɠɛɛzu ga Zeloɓoame ná-pɛlɛyeɠei ɠɛʋele, Neɓate ná-doun zunui, ta Ɓaasa ná-pɛlɛyeɠei ɠɛʋele, Ayiya ná-doun zunui, mazɔlɔɔ è zìiɠaawana, è Izilayɛle lia kotoi ma.› <verse eid="1KI 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 21:23"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛʋɛ é ʋilɛ Zezaɓɛle ɓalaa ba, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Gilɛiti ta Zezaɓɛle ma zuai mi Zizeleyɛle ziɠigi ɠobaʋɛ.› <verse eid="1KI 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 21:24"/>Akaɓe ná-pɛlɛyeɠei wu nui nɔpɛ é zaazu taazuʋɛ, gilɛiti ka ta ma ʋoomai mi, zɔi ma é zaazu dɔɓɔi zu, wɔniiti ka ta naama ʋoomai mi.»<verse eid="1KI 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 21:25"/>(Gaamazu Akaɓe ɠɛɠala nu la zɔlɔɔni, nii a yiimazeɠe ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wanama vai ɠɛai ga tɔun kɛʋele, tama anzai Zezaɓɛle ɠa é ɠɛni diizu ma. <verse eid="1KI 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 21:26"/>É ziɛ ʋelei wola ɲɔu ga é ɓɔɠɔ lɔɔ vai kɔɔɠɔ gani kɔɔ vai zu, eɠɛʋelei nɔ Amool nuiti ti ɠɛni kɛɛzu la, niiti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ti ɓɛɛni Izilayɛle nuiti tuɠɔ, é ti-zeizuʋɛ ve naati zea.)<verse eid="1KI 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Akaɓe ɓɔɠɔmaayei vai <optbreak/> é lɔɔzei siɛ ʋelei ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 21:27"/>Akaɓe naama wooiti mɛnigai ma, niiti Eli ti woni ma, é ná-seɠei ʋalini ga ga ɓɔɠɔmaayeii ma ʋoogi, é saa wɔlɔ wo seɠei loo ɠɔba, é zugi zo, é ɗa ziɛ vaavaa. <verse eid="1KI 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 21:28"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Eli ʋɔ, Tiseɓé nui, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="1KI 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 21:29"/>«È kaa, ʋelei Akaɓe ɓɔɠɔmaayeiɗa la gàazu? Tɛi é ɓɔɠɔmaayeiɗa bɛ̀, gè la mɔ zɛsu vulua, gè ʋa ʋaa ga maanɔɠɔi, nii gè ɠɛa ɠɛɛzu gè ʋaa la. Ná-doun zunui ná-yeeɠɛɠalai zu ɠa, gè ʋaazu la ga maanɔɠɔi naa.»<verse eid="1KI 21:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1KI 22"/>
  <para style="s">Akaɓe ɠa pɔ é Lamɔte taai zeɠe ʋolu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 18:1-3">2 Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛi 18:1-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 22:1"/>Kona saʋagɔ leʋeni, kɔɔ nɔpɛ ge la ɠɛɛni Izilayɛle nuiti ta Siili nuiti zɔɠɔzu. <verse eid="1KI 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 22:2"/>Konagi zaʋasiɛi ma, Zuda masagi Zozafate yeini Izilayɛle masagi ɠoba. <verse eid="1KI 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 22:3"/>Izilayɛle masagi ɠɛni ná-botiɠɛ nu wolaiti ma: «Wo kwɛni ga Lamɔte nii é Galaade yooi zu, toɠa ga adɔnɔ? Tama ada inɛinɛsu ga kula vai Siili masagi ya.» <verse eid="1KI 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 22:4"/>É ɠɛni Zozafate ma: «Da liizu kɔɔɠɔzuʋɛ Lamɔte laalɔɠɔma Galaade yooi zu?» Naa ɠɛ ma: «De felegɔ da liizu, naa ʋɛɛ ɗa-nuiti ta nɔ̀nɔiti ba, ɗa-zooiti ta nɔ̀nɔiti.»<verse eid="1KI 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA goo wo nuiti <optbreak/> ti pilɛ sɔlɔɔ fai wo fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 18:4-11">2 Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛi 18:4-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 22:5"/>Naa ʋoluma Zozafate ɠɛni Izilayɛle masagi ma: «Nà è maanɛɛnɛzu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazaɠa lɛɛ dɛ.» <verse eid="1KI 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 22:6"/>Izilayɛle masagi GALA goo wo nu unnaanigɔ (400) ɠɛɠala ɠaalɛɛni ba, é ti ɠaazaɠa ga: «Nà zoo nɛi gè li, gè kɔɔi ʋɛɛ Lamɔte ʋa Galaade yooi zu, ɓaa gè looɠo?» Ti gooɠaaʋoteni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Lɛ, Maliɠii ɠa dɔ masagi yeezu.»<verse eid="1KI 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 22:7"/>Kɛlɛ Zozafate ɠɛni ma: «Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-GALA goo wo nui ta la mɔ ʋɛ, nu ʋa gaazaɠa ga tɔun maaʋele?» <verse eid="1KI 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 22:8"/>Izilayɛle masagi gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Nu ɠila nɔ ɠa niina é ʋoluzu, nii da zoo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazaɠasu ga maaʋele, daa ɠa ga Misé, Yimila ná-doun zunui. Kɛlɛ wɔinzeɠeʋɛ mà, mazɔlɔɔ é la ɗa ga woo ʋagɔ nɔpɛ bo bɛ̀, kɛni woo ɲɔiti nɔ.» Zozafate ɠɛ ma: «Masagi mina ɓɔɛ ɠana!» <verse eid="1KI 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 22:9"/>Izilayɛle masagi ná-botiɠɛ nu wolai gila tolini, é ɠɛ ma: «Li ɠani nɔ, è ʋa ga Yimila ná-doun zunui Misé.»<verse eid="1KI 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 22:10"/>Izilayɛle masagi ta Zuda masagi Zozafate ɛsɛ maaɠilini ga ná-masa seɠeiti, ti zeini ta-kpɔkpɔgiti ga fiilɛi ɠa, Samali taa ziɠidaʋɛ, GALA goo wo nuiti ti ɗa kulakɛlɛma vaiti bo ti ɠaazu. <verse eid="1KI 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 22:11"/>Kenaana ná-doun zunui Sedesiyase minɛiti kpɛtɛni ga kɔlui, é ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹Minɛi niiti ka è yɛsu Siili nuiti doɠazu ga tiye, eyɛsu è ti zuɠoloɠolo.› » <verse eid="1KI 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 22:12"/>Naa nɔ ɠa GALA goo wo nuiti kpein ti ɠɛni bosu, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Lɛ Lamɔte Galaade yooi zu, ɗa zobo sɔlɔɔ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa dɔ masagi yeezu.»<verse eid="1KI 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA goo wo nui Misé <optbreak/> ta-loobu vai wo fai ti ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 18:12-27">2 Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛi 18:12-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 22:13"/>Keelai é liini Misé lolisu, é ɠɛni Misé ma: «GALA goo wo nuiti pɛ ti zoloogɛ ma ga ti masagi ná-faa ʋagɔi wo, ɗa ɓalaagi è-wooi maanɛɛʋɛ é zoloo tɔnɔi ma, ɗa ná-faa ʋagɔi wo.» <verse eid="1KI 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 22:14"/>Misé gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Gè ɠonaa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma, nii é vulua, ga nii nɔpɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI bosu mà, naa ɠa gè bosu.» <verse eid="1KI 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 22:15"/>Seeliai ma masagi ʋɔ bɛ, naa gaazaɠani, é ɠɛ ma: «Misé, gá zoo nɛi gi li, gi kɔɔi ʋɛɛ Lamɔte ʋa Galaade yooi zu, ɓaa gi looɠo?» Naa ɠɛ ma: «Ungo, li, ɗa zobo sɔlɔɔ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa dɔ masagi yeezu.» <verse eid="1KI 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 22:16"/>Kɛlɛ masagi kpɔɛi zeɠeni, é ɠɛ ma: «Nà yɛsu è maanɛɛnɛzu eyɛsu yeelɛ, è ʋa gaamai wo mà nɔ, é ɠula Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI la?»<verse eid="1KI 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 22:17"/>Misé ɠɛni ma naazu:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 22:17">«Gè Izilayɛle nuiti kpein kaaʋɛ, ti vazagai gizeiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 22:17">ti ɠɛai eɠɛ baalagiti makɛ nu la ti ʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 22:17">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 22:17">‹Totuɠɔ la mɔ niima nuiti bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 22:17">Naa ɠa é ba, ɛsɛ pɛ ge ɠale ma dɔin ná-pɛlɛ wu.› »<verse eid="1KI 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 22:18"/>Izilayɛle masagi zɛba é ɠɛ Zozafate ma: «Kɛbɛ gè bogɛ è ma ga zunui nii la ɗa ga GALA ná-kulakɛlɛma vaa ʋagɔ wo ga bɛ̀, kɛni ma ɲɔiti nɔ.» <verse eid="1KI 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 22:19"/>Misé liini luɠɔ ga kpɔɛi zuɠulaa, é ɠɛ ma: «Woilo mu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ma! Gè Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaaʋɛ zeini ná-masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa, naazu geezu ɠɔɔʋɛbɛiti pɛ ti loni koba, zeezazu ʋelei ta kɔʋɛzu ʋelei. <verse eid="1KI 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 22:20"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ti ɠaazaɠa ga: ‹Ɓɛ ɠa a zoo é Akaɓe yaava, nii a kɛ é li, é kɔɔi vala Lamɔte ʋa, Galaade yooi zu, é za kɔɔɠɔzuʋɛ?› Ɛsɛ ge ɗa ná-gooɠaaʋote fe. <verse eid="1KI 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 22:21"/>Gaaɓelagi zu, zɛnvui ta maaɓuɠani, é lo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Nɔ̀un nà zoo gè yaava.› Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛ ma: ‹Ɗa kɛɛzu ɠale?› <verse eid="1KI 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 22:22"/>É ɠɛ ma: ‹Nà liizu gè zɛɛi lɔ ná-GALA goo wo nuiti kpein da.› Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛ ma: ‹Gaamazu ɗa zoo yaavazu, ɗa ziɛ ná wu. Liina, è kɛ ʋelei è bogai la.› » <verse eid="1KI 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 22:23"/>Misé wooɠaaɓelani, é ɠɛ ma: «Naa ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI kɛai faaʋɛ bu ga zɛɛ yɛnvui ʋa é lɔ ɗa-ƓALA goo wo nuiti kpein su ti ʋɛ, mazɔlɔɔ é ɗa-undaaʋiligi levea.»<verse eid="1KI 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 22:24"/>Naazu GALA goo wo nui nii daa ga Sedesiyase, Kenaana ná-doun zunui wuzeɠeni la, é Misé woizuloɠa, é ɠɛ ma: «Pelei ma ɓɛgele ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-Zɛnvui leʋegai la, é ɠula nɔ̀un su, é ɓɔɛ è ʋɔ?» <verse eid="1KI 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 22:25"/>Misé ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa kwɛɛ voloi ɗa ɠɛ leʋeteʋesu pɛlɛiti bu ga è ʋa lɔɔɠu.»<verse eid="1KI 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 22:26"/>Izilayɛle masagi niima levei veeni ná-botiɠɛ nui gila zea, é ɠɛ ma: «Misé zo, è li, è fe taa ɠundiɠii Amon ya, ta masagi ná-doun zunui Zoase. <verse eid="1KI 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 22:27"/>Ɗa ɠɛ ti ma: ‹Masagi ɠɛ wo zunui nii lɔ kasoi ɠa, wo ɗa ɓului ta ziɛi tago nɔ ve zea, eyɛsu gè ɠale ma, gè zeɠe kɔɔɠɔzuʋɛ ga pagɔ ziilɛigi zu.› » <verse eid="1KI 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 22:28"/>Misé zɛba é wooɠula, é ɠɛ ma: «Ni ɗa ɠalena ma ga ziilɛigi, naa ɠa ɠɛɛna Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI la ɓɔɛni ga màaʋele.» É ɠɛni ma ʋolu: «À woilo gòo ma, wɔi kpein wo ga nuɓusɛiti.»<verse eid="1KI 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Akaɓe zaa vai kɔɔi zu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 18:28-34">2 Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛi 18:28-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 22:29"/>Naama ziɛ su, Izilayɛle masagi ta Zuda masagi Zozafate ti lɛɛni Lamɔte Galaade yooi zu. <verse eid="1KI 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 22:30"/>Akaɓe ɠɛni Zozafate ma: «Nà ná-seɠeiti maaleʋesu, gè li kɔɔɠɔzuʋɛ, ɗa ma, è ɗa masa seɠei loo ɠɔba.» Izilayɛle masagi ná-seɠeiti maaleʋeni, é li kɔɔɠɔzuʋɛ. <verse eid="1KI 22:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 22:31"/>Siili masagi niima levei veeni kundiɠi ʋuusaʋagɔ maazu felegɔiti (32) zea, niiti ti ɠɛni kɔɔɠɔ wotoloiti unda, é ɠɛ ti ma: «À mina vala salaʋusu goiti ta kɔɔɠuluɓaiti ba, kɛlɛ Izilayɛle masagi ɠila nɔ ɠa wa vala ba.» <verse eid="1KI 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 22:32"/>Kɔɔɠɔ wotolo ɠundiɠiiti ti Zozafate ɠaai ma, ti ɠɛ ɓɔɠɔ ma: «Izilayɛle masa kitei ɠanu.» Ti liini pɔ pelei ga ti vala ba. Kɛlɛ Zozafate ɓainni. <verse eid="1KI 22:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 22:33"/>Kɔɔɠɔ wotolo ɠundiɠiiti ti kaai ma ga Izilayɛle masagi laade, ti zeɠeni polu.<verse eid="1KI 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 22:34"/>Siili zalaʋusui gila ge ná-mɛɛin ʋilini ga kulafilibai, é lɔ kaka makɛ ɠɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlai zeidazuʋɛ yɔɠɔzu, é zeeli Izilayɛle masagi ma. Masagi ɠɛni naazu ná-kɔɔɠɔ wotolo ɓizɛ nui ma: «Daalati ga ze, ɠula ga ze kɔɔ lɔɓɔi ʋa, mazɔlɔɔ màawanaa.» <verse eid="1KI 22:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 22:35"/>Kɔɔi ɓɔini naama voloi. Masagi yɛni loni ná-kɔɔɠɔ wotoloi zu Siili nuiti daawu, eyɛsu é za kpɔkɔi. Maawana ɲamai ʋuuni ná-kɔɔɠɔ wotoloi zu ná pɛ. <verse eid="1KI 22:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 22:36"/>Kpɔkɔi, wooi ta ɠulani kɔɔʋɛbɛi pɛ saama, ti ɠɛ ma: «Ɛsɛ pɛ ge ɠalena ma ná-taazu, ɛsɛ pɛ ge ɠalena ma ʋɔ bɛ.»<verse eid="1KI 22:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 22:37"/>Ʋele ɠana masagi zaani la, ti lii la Samali, ti maaɠulu miná. <verse eid="1KI 22:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 22:38"/>Ti ɠɛai ma ma ɲamai gbazu ná-kɔɔɠɔ wotoloi zu Samali ɓoigi wu, gilɛiti ti ɠɛni ma ɲamai ɠɔmɔsu, koloɠolo anzanuiti ti ɗa maagba bu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laawooi nii é boni, naa ʋilɛni su naazu.<verse eid="1KI 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 22:39"/>Akaɓe ná-kɛɛwotii mɔtaiti, ta nii kpein é kɛɛni, see ɲiiga ʋɛlɛi é toni, ta taai niiti kpein é siɠigi loni ti ma, naati sɛʋɛʋɛ Izilayɛle masagiti ta-ɠɛɛwoti zɛʋɛi zu. <verse eid="1KI 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 22:40"/>Akaɓe zaani. Ná-doun zunui Aɠazia ɠa é masadai ɠɛɛni potogi zu.<verse eid="1KI 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zuda masagi Zozafate</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 17:1-6">2 Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛi 17:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 20:31-21:1">20:31—21:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 22:41"/>Akaɓe ná-kona naanisiɛi ma masadai zu Izilayɛle unda, Aza ná-doun zunui Zozafate zeini Zuda unda ga masagi. <verse eid="1KI 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 22:42"/>Zozafate ná-konagi ɠɛni ga puusaʋa maazu lɔɔlugɔ (35), siɛgi zu é zeini la ga masagi. Kona ʋuufelegɔ maazu lɔɔlugɔ (25) ɠa é kɛɛni masadai zu Zeluzalɛme. Dee laa ɠɛni ga Azuɓa, Siliɠi ná-doun anzanui ɠɛni de. <verse eid="1KI 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 22:43"/>É ziɛ ʋele ʋani ga kɛɛɠɛ Aza ɠɛʋele, é la zeɠeni naa ná-pelei tanɔpɛ ba, é ɗa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yiima vaiti nɔ ɠɛ. <verse eid="1KI 22:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 22:44"/>Kɛlɛ é la ɠɛni zalaɠa ɠula adaʋɛti koloɠoloni, nuɓusɛiti ti ɠɛni dɛ zalaɠaiti kulazu, ti ɗa ansansegiti gala zalaɠa ɠula adaʋɛti. <verse eid="1KI 22:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 22:45"/>Ziilɛigi ɠɛni Zozafate ta Izilayɛle masagi ti yɔɠɔzu.<verse eid="1KI 22:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 22:46"/>Zozafate ná-kɛɛwotii mɔtaiti, ná-tɔɠɔɠula faiti ta kɔɔi niiti é ti ɠɔɔni, naati sɛʋɛʋɛ Zuda masagiti ta-ɠɛɛwoti zɛʋɛi zu. <verse eid="1KI 22:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 22:47"/>É koloɠolo zunui mɔtaiti kulani zooi ʋa, niiti ti ɠɛni ná kaite kɛɛɠɛ Aza ná-siɛgi zu zɔli.<verse eid="1KI 22:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 22:48"/>Masa nɔpɛ ge la ɠɛni Edɔme yooi zu, kɛni masagi ná-zou zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠii gila nɔ. <verse eid="1KI 22:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 22:49"/>Zozafate ɓatoiti kpɛtɛni Taalasise ɗɛi ɠa, ga ti ɗa li Wofiil, ti ɗa ʋa ga zanugi. Kɛlɛ ti la zeelini pɛ, tɔɔzei ɓatoiti ti ɠɛni ɠoloɠolosu Ɛsiyon-Geeɓɛɛl. <verse eid="1KI 22:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 22:50"/>Akaɓe ná-doun zunui Aɠazia zɛba é ɠɛ Zozafate ma: «De ɓɔsu de da-wotiɠɛ nuiti teʋe ʋɔɔma ɓatoiti su,» kɛlɛ Zozafate la ɠɛni kɛɛni. <verse eid="1KI 22:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 22:51"/>Zozafate zaani. Ti maaɠuluni mɛmɛwolani ta-ɠabamaʋɛ, Davide ná-taa wolai zu. Ná-doun zunui Yolame ɠa é masadai ɠɛɛni potogi zu.<verse eid="1KI 22:51"/></para>
  <para style="s">Izilayɛle masagi Aɠazia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 22:52"/>Zozafate ná-kona puugɔ maazu lɔfelasiɛi (17) ma masadai zu Zuda unda, Akaɓe ná-doun zunui Aɠazia zeini Izilayɛle unda ga masagi Samali. Kona felegɔ ɠa é kɛɛni masadai zu Izilayɛle unda. <verse eid="1KI 22:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 22:53"/>É Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wanama vai ɠɛɛni ga kɛɛɠɛ ta dee ɠɛʋele, ta Zeloɓoame Neɓate ná-doun zunui ɠɛʋele, nii é Izilayɛle nuiti diini kotoi ɠɛɛ vai ma. <verse eid="1KI 22:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1KI 22:54"/>É Ɓaale lɛbini, é nɔkɔ bu, é Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yiiɠaawanani, Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI, eɠɛʋelei nɔ kɛɛɠɛ kɛɛni la.<verse eid="1KI 22:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 22"/>
</usx>
